<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JER" style="id">- Shambala Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">YELEMIA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kitabu cha Yelemiya</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yelemiya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yel</para>
  <para style="mt2">Gondwe ja</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yelemia</para>
  <para style="imt">Uandukio wa gondwe ja Yelemia</para>
  <para style="ip">Mwe gondwe ja Yelemia, kwagondwa ndima na uteghanyi wa Yelemia. Yelemia nee ni mteghanyi wa Yuda mwe mishi ya ugholokezi wa zumbe Yosia na zumbe Yehoahazi na zumbe Yehoyakimu na zumbe Sedekia. Ateghanya kuanduka mwe vui ja magana mtandatu na miongo miili na mtandatu mpaka mwe vui ja magana mashano na miongo mnane na mtandatu. Mbuli zakwe zagondwa ni mwegonda mweitangwa Baluku Yelemia 36:4. Vyadahikana kuti Baluku aunganyanya mbuli zoshe za Yelemia mwe gondwe sa ivi tivyena najo lelo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mteghanyi ni mntu mwebilikila mbuli kwa wantu ilawieyo kwa Zumbe Mulungu. Mbuli ndizo akishialonga Zumbe Mulungu kuzinkia mteghanyi Yelemia nee ni za kukanya na kulaha. Kwa kuti izo mbuli zosheni nee zikilongea kwa mbuli ya uhuza wa wantu na Yelemia nee akisungudishwa kwa mishi mingi. Aaona via ndivyo wazumbe wakibea makanyo ya Zumbe Mulungu na via mzi wa Yelusalemu ubanighwevyo ni Wakalidayo. Miya Yelemia akaeta mbuli yena kialilo yeonyesha via ndivyo Zumbe Mulungu awauze wantu wakwe. Mwe Yelemia 31:31-34 nee akilongea mbuli ya kilagha kihya ndicho Zumbe Mulungu aike na wantu wakwe. Neachiike mwe myoyo yawe na kia mntu neamtaile Zumbe Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mbuli zeumo</para>
  <para style="io1">Sula ya 1 Yelemia ataitangwa aituke mteghanyi.</para>
  <para style="io1">Sula ya 2-38 ni makanyo kwa wantu wa Yuda.</para>
  <para style="io1">Sula ya 39-45 ni mbuli ya kudahighwa kwa wantu wa Yelusalemu na kubanighwa kwa uwo mzi.</para>
  <para style="io1">Sula ya 46-51 ni mbuli ya mlaho kwa wantu wa mbali ntuhu.</para>
  <para style="io1">Sula ya 52 ni shimoezi zihi yeonyesha via mzi wa Yelusalemu utoighwevyo na Waizilaeli wagwizighevyo na kuighawa kwe shi ya ugheni.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JER 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 1:1" />Izi nee mbuli alongazo Yelemia ng'wana wa Hilikia, mng'we wa wavikizi wa mzi wa Anasosi, mwe shi ya Benjamini. <verse eid="JER 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 1:2" />Zumbe Mulungu akalonga na Yelemia mwe vui ja muongo mng'we na ntatu ja ugholokezi wa Yosia ng'wana wa Amoni, zumbe wa Yuda. <verse eid="JER 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 1:3" />Zumbe Mulungu akalonga naye vingi mwe mishi ya ugholokezi wa Yehoyakimu ng'wana wa Yosia zumbe wa Yuda. Vikibinda, Zumbe Mulungu akahimba kulonga na Yelemia mpaka mwe vui ja muongo mng'we na ng'wenga mwe ugholokezi wa Sedekia ng'wana wa Yosia, zumbe wa Yuda. Uhebula ng'wezi wa shano mwe ijo vui, wantu wa Yelusalemu wakaighawa na mwe shi ya ugheni.<verse eid="JER 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yelemia ataghalushwa mteghanyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 1:4" />Zumbe Mulungu aanighambila kuti, <verse eid="JER 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 1:5" />“Naakutaila kuanduka huvyaighwe, nikakushaghuwa uituke mteghanyi wa mbali zoshe.”<verse eid="JER 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 1:6" />Nee nihemhisa, “Zumbe Mulungu, imi sidaha kulonga, kwa kuti nike mbwanga.” <verse eid="JER 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 1:7" />Miya Zumbe Mulungu akanighambila, “Usheghambe kuti uke mbwanga, neuite kwa wantu woshe niwekuaghiiza kwawe, na kuwaukuiya mbuli zoshe nizekughambila. <verse eid="JER 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 1:8" />Ushezawaogoha awo, kwa kuti imi ni hang'we na iwe nikuambize. Nimiyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo” <verse eid="JER 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 1:9" />Nee Zumbe Mulungu akanyoosha mkono, akadoa kanwa changu, akanighamba, “Nizagea mbuli zangu mwe kanwa chako. <verse eid="JER 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 1:10" />Lelo nizakunka ufung'wa mwe mbali na zumbe zoshe kunga ung'unte na kugandua, ubane na kukoma, kunga uzenge na kuhanda.”<verse eid="JER 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mifumbulo miili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 1:11" />Zumbe Mulungu akaniuza kuti, “Yelemia, uona mbwai?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 1:11">Nee nihemhisa, “Niona tambi ja mti wa mlonzi jeshuka.”<verse eid="JER 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 1:12" />Zumbe Mulungu akanighambila, “Uzaona vitana, kwa kuti nami niwelela mbuli yangu kunga ibontoke.”<verse eid="JER 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 1:13" />Zumbe Mulungu akalonga naimi kambii, “Uona mbwai?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 1:13">Nikamhisa, “Niona nyungu yesheuka ifununkukeyo na wazu wa kasikazini.”<verse eid="JER 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 1:14" />Nee Zumbe Mulungu ahenighambila, “Mabada neyaize kulawiya wazu wa kasikazini, na kuwabuiza wantu wosheni weikala mwe inu shi. <verse eid="JER 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 1:15" />Neniwaitange wantu wa mbali zoshe ze wazu wa kasikazini. Wazumbe wawe newaize na kuika viti vyawe vya uzumbe mwe zuvi ja Yelusalemu na kukinya nkando zoshe, na kuitoa mizi yosheni ya Yuda. <verse eid="JER 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 1:16" />Neniwalahe wantu wangu kwa mbuli ya uhuza wawe woshe wa wakunieka imi, na kulavya ntogoo kwa mulungu na kuvika vinyago wakighosholeevyo kwa mikono yawe wenyewe. <verse eid="JER 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 1:17" />Kwa ivyoho ushe iwe Yelemia, lawa uite ukawaghambile mbuli zoshe nikughambilezo. Ushezawaogoha, ukiwaogoha nenikuitushe muwogha kwawe. <verse eid="JER 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 1:18" />Lelo nitakutoghesha sa mzi uzungukwewo ni waghojo, sa mnala wa chuma vingi sa ukando wa shaba, mwe shi yoshe hekuituke na mwekudaha, wazumbe wa Yuda na waambizi wawe, wavikizi wakwe na wantu wakwe woshe. <verse eid="JER 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 1:19" />Newatoane na iwe, miya hewakudahe kwa kuti imi ni hang'we na iwe nikuambize. Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.”<verse eid="JER 1:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JER 2" />
  <para style="s">Zumbe Mulungu atawaambiza Waizilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 2:1" />Zumbe Mulungu akanighambila kuti, <verse eid="JER 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 2:2" />“Hita ukawaghambile vigima wantu woshe wa Yelusalemu kuti imi Zumbe Mulungu naghamba ivi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:2">Naaufukila ukweli wako wiike mbwanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:2">via wanikundavyo sa uvyemkunda mndee ywako mshi wa nteghuzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:2">wanitongelavyo mwe ughongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:2">mwe shi ishihandighweyo mbeyu yoyoshe.<verse eid="JER 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 2:3" />Izilaeli, iwe nee uiwangu imi ike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:3">nee ui mpaa yangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:3">Wosheni wakuumizawo watekiondea masa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:3">wakafa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:3">Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.”<verse eid="JER 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uhuza waghosholewo wababa wa Izilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 2:4" />Teghelezai mbuli ya Zumbe Mulungu, inywi wavyawa wa Yakobo na inywi wantu wa kolwa ja Izilaeli. <verse eid="JER 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 2:5" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:5">“Baba zenyu waona mbuli ani mbada kwangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:5">iwaekieyo wanihituke na kunieka?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:5">Waazahitukia mulungu ishidahayo kuwaambiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:5">wakashoa uwambizi.<verse eid="JER 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 2:6" />Hewakiuzize kuti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:6">‘Akuhi Zumbe Mulungu, atilavyaye mwe shi ya Misii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:6">atiambizaye mwe nyika</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:6">mwe shi ya ughongo na makoongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:6">shi ishiozokayo yena kiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:6">shi ishizinkwayo ni wantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:6">vingi heiikawa?’<verse eid="JER 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 2:7" />Nawaeta na mwe shi yeozoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:7">kunga waje nkande ntana zeozoka umo na kutamilwa kiiko cha nkande zakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:7">Miya wahebula mwe shi yangu, wakaeka nisheikunde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:7">ikanigea usei.<verse eid="JER 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 2:8" />Wavikizi hewakiuzize kuti, ‘Akuhi Zumbe Mulungu?’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:8">Wetaila sheiya hewanitaile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:8">wagholokezi wa wantu wazanihituka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:8">wateghanyi wohe wateghanya mbuli za Baali</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:8">wakatongela mbuli zishiwaambizazo.”<verse eid="JER 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlaho wa Zumbe Mulungu kwa wantu wakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 2:9" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:9">“Imi nenimilahe inywi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:9">na vivyazi vyenyu.”<verse eid="JER 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 2:10" />Ombokai mwe bahai muite mpaka Kupulo mukawelele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:10">hambu aghiizai wantu waite Kedali wakawelele</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:10">kuti kwaataila kulawiya mbuli sa inu.<verse eid="JER 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 2:11" />Ivi kuna mbali yetaila kubadiisha mulungu yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:11">hang'we na kuti iyo mulungu shiyo ya kweli?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:11">Miya wantu ywangu wazanihituka imi Zumbe Mulungu newainka ishima na kutaikana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:11">wakatongela mulungu ishiwaambizayo.<verse eid="JER 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 2:12" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, iwe lwingu maka na kuona usoyoyo kwa inu mbuli.<verse eid="JER 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 2:13" />Wantu ywangu wazaghoshola uhuza ntambo mbii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:13">wazanieka imi shoko ya mazi ya ugima wawe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:13">na wazakifukia vishima vyawe wenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:13">vishima viatukevyo, vishidahavyo kuika mazi.<verse eid="JER 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bontokelo ja Waizilaeli kusheituka wakweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 2:14" />“Izilaeli ni mtung'wa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:14">Avyaighwe mwe utung'wa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:14">Kwai ushe azaituka mntu wa kugwiwa ni wankuu ywakwe?<verse eid="JER 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 2:15" />Shimba zizamgumiia Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:15">zizagumia kwa mgumio mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:15">shi yakwe heina wantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:15">mizi izaituka mahuzu, heiikawa.<verse eid="JER 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 2:16" />Wantu wa Memufisi na wa Tahipanesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:16">wazamushiiza ishima na kumghalusha mtung'wa.<verse eid="JER 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 2:17" />Ivyo vyosheni uvikundie ng'wenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:17">kwa kunieka imi Zumbe Mulungu ywako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:17">nikuambizeye mwe sia.<verse eid="JER 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 2:18" />Neuonele mbwai ukiita Misii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:18">kwevata mazi ya mto Naili?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:18">Hambu kuna utana ani ukiita Ashulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:18">kwevata mazi ya mto Eufulate?<verse eid="JER 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 2:19" />Uhuza wako, neukulahe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:19">na kusheituka na uhehi naimi nekukuetee mlaho.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:19">Fukila na utaile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:19">viivyo vibada na vyaaumiza</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:19">kunieka na kusheituka mkweli kwa imi Zumbe Mulungu ywako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:19">Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu mwena ufung'wa nilongiewo.”<verse eid="JER 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waizilaeli wataemela kumvika Zumbe Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 2:20" />Zumbe Mulungu mwena ufung'wa aghamba ivi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:20">“Iwe waaemela kugholokewa ni miyo kuanduka kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:20">waemela kunitegheleza na kunivika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:20">waaivika mulungu yeeta uwozo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:20">mwe kia muima mtai</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:20">na shi ya kia mti wena mahungo maishi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:20">waakilaza sa mkilanga.<verse eid="JER 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 2:21" />Nakuhanda sa mti mtana wa mzabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:21">kulawa mwe mbeyu ntana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:21">Viituke zeze ukabanika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:21">ukaghaluka mzabibu ushitamawo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:21">Na kughaluka mzabibu wa tundui?<verse eid="JER 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 2:22" />Hata ukihake kwa sabuni ya maghadi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:22">na kwa sabuni zeghenea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:22">madoa ya masa yako heyauke mwe mesho yangu.<verse eid="JER 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 2:23" />Udaha zeze kughamba, ‘Imi naakundwa ni Zumbe Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:23">siwavikie Mabaali?’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:23">Fukila uhuza ughosholevyo kuja kwe koongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:23">iwe u sa ngamia ya kivyee ye mwe kiuke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:23">yekeseka, <verse eid="JER 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 2:24" />vingi u sa mpunda izoeeyo kuikala mwe ughongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:24">yaahefya mpeho ii mwe kiuke chakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:24">ni ndai mwedaha kuikinda?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:24">Mpunda zoshe za ngoshi zitamdosa hezikunda kukisangadisha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:24">kwa kuti zaitaila mishi yakwe ikibula nezimtongee du.<verse eid="JER 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 2:25" />Izilaeli, ushesangadike mpaka ushakaze viatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:25">ushekasaghawe ni mimeo yako kwa mbuli ya nkiu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:25">kwa kuitongela mulungu mituhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:25">Miya iwe ukaghamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 2:25">‘Doo senidahe kuuya mghongo naikunda mulungu ya kigheni ne ndiyo nibashe.’ ”<verse eid="JER 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Izilaeli shuti atoighwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 2:26" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, “Sa via ng'wivi avyeona shoni akigwiwa, Waizilaeli wohe, wazumbe wawe, wagholokezi wawe, wavikizi wawe na wateghanyi wawe newaone shoni. <verse eid="JER 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 2:27" />Wataighamba miti, iwe utate angu na kujighamba iwe niweyo univyaiyewo kwa kuti wazanihituka wala hewaniwelele. Miya wa imwe ntogho wataghamba, so utivunile.<verse eid="JER 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 2:28" />“Ihi mulungu mukishongoleeyo? Neigholoke ushe kati yaadaha kumivunia mukiituka mwe ntogho. Ehe Yuda una mulungu mingi yeighana na mizi yako. <verse eid="JER 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 2:29" />Kwai mwaaninomonekea imi? Vikiituka nyosheni muighoshole uhuza? <verse eid="JER 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 2:30" />Naawatoa wantu wako miya heviambize chochoshe, wo wenye hewakundie niwashunde. Uhamba wako uzawakoma wateghanyi wako sa vinga ni shimba ivyenyaghafua maunde. <verse eid="JER 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 2:31" />Inywi wantu wa Izilaeli, teghelezai nivyelonga imi Zumbe Mulungu. Ivi kwenyu imi nizaituka ughongo, hambu shi itoghieyo kiza? Kwai ushe mwaaghamba, nemughoshole muvyekunda na hemuniuiye vingi? <verse eid="JER 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 2:32" />Mndee aadaha kujaa maheli yakwe ya kukihambia, hambu ng'wai aadaha kujaa shuke yakwe ya nteghuzi? Miya wantu wangu imi wazanijaa kwa mishi ishitaikayo. <verse eid="JER 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 2:33" />Kweli iwe uvitana kwa kuondeeza waja uweona kuti newakuambize. Mpaka wavyee wabada wakihinya kulawa kwako. <verse eid="JER 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 2:34" />Shuke zako zina mpome ya wakiwa na wantu washinawo masa, na shiyo madanko ya mpombe za wabavi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 2:34">“Hang'we na ivyo vyoshe, <verse eid="JER 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 2:35" />iwe utaghamba, ‘Imi sina masa, kwa kweli maya yakwe yahae na imi.’ Miya imi nenikulahe kwa kuti uzaghamba, ‘Sina uhuza nighosholewo.’ <verse eid="JER 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 2:36" />Kwai waakigea shoni kwa kuhitukia mulungu ya mbali ntuhu. Wamisii uwebasha newakugee shoni, sa via wageighwavyo shoni ni Waashulu. <verse eid="JER 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 2:37" />Vikibinda, neuuke uko Misii kwa shoni uko uitozize mtwi. Kwa kuti Zumbe Mulungu azawaemela waja uwealila, heuonele kwa uwambizi wawe.”<verse eid="JER 2:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JER 3" />
  <para style="s">Waizilaeli shiyo wakweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 3:1" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, “Mghoshi akimueka mkazie, na uyo mvyee akaghuighwa ni mghoshi mtuhu, ivi uja mghoshi hadaha kumuuiya vingi mkazie. Kwa kughoshola ivyoho, shi heimtamile Zumbe Mulungu vigima. Miya iwe shi ya Izilaeli, uzaghoshola ukilanga na wangi na iviaha ukunda uniuiye! <verse eid="JER 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 3:2" />Welela kwe ntui za miima kwa laviiza ntogoo. Ivi kuna hantu mushivikileho mulungu? Mwaikala nkanda ya sia, sa mntu mbada mweghojeeza wantu mwe ughongo awahoke vintu. Muzaieka shi ishekundwe ni Zumbe Mulungu kwa mbuli ya ukilanga wenyu. <verse eid="JER 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 3:3" />Nee vyeleka fua izagwiwa, na fua za vui hezigwee. Mu sa wakilanga washinawo shoni.<verse eid="JER 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 3:4" />“Viviushe du nee ukiniiiya ukighamba, ‘Iwe utate angu, nee ukinikunda kuanduka nii mnkebe. <verse eid="JER 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 3:5" />Heukwewe ni maya kale, heuniihiwe imi kale.’ Izilaeli, ivyo nee ulongievyo miya uzaghoshola uhuza wosheni udahiewo.”<verse eid="JER 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Izilaeli na Yuda shuti wavoteke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 3:6" />Mwe ugholokezi wa zumbe Yosia, Zumbe Mulungu aanighambia ivi, “Uzaona Izilaeli ashiye mkweli aghosholevyo? Aanieka, akakwea mwe miima mitai na kuita shi ya kia mti wena mani maishi, akavika mulungu mituhu uko. <verse eid="JER 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 3:7" />Imi nafanyanya kuti, akibinda kughoshola mbuli zoshe, neaniuiye. Miya doo, haniuiye. Yuda umbuje ashiye mkweli, aaziona izi mbuli zosheni. <verse eid="JER 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 3:8" />Yuda aaona nikimnka Izilaeli talaka na kuwausha kwa mbuli ya kunihituka na kuvika mulungu mituhu. Miya Yuda umbuje ashiye mkweli, haaogohe. Yohena akahimba kuvika mulungu mituhu, <verse eid="JER 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 3:9" />kwa kuti kuvika mulungu mituhu kwa Izilaeli nee ni mbuli ndodo kwa Yuda. Kwa ivyoho ushe wantu wa Yuda wakahimba kuvika mawe na miti na kuighalusha shi iituke hantu hashitamaho kumvika Zumbe Mulungu. <verse eid="JER 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 3:10" />Hang'we na izo mbuli zoshe, Yuda umbuje ashiye mkweli haniuiye kwa ukweli, miya kwa lufyo du.”<verse eid="JER 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 3:11" />Zumbe Mulungu akanighamba, “Izilaeli ashiye mkweli akubalika kunivika kuiko Yuda mwena lufyo. <verse eid="JER 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 3:12" />Hita ukalonge na Izilaeli umti, ‘Iwe Izilaeli ushiye mkweli, uya. Imi senikuwelele kwa maya kwa kuti nina mbazi, seniituke na maya ya kale na iwe.’ <verse eid="JER 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 3:13" />Iwe voteka du kuti uzanihituka imi Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu wako na shi ya kia mti wena mahungo maishi uzavika mulungu mituhu na hutegheleze kanwa changu.”<verse eid="JER 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 3:14" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba, “Uyai inywi wantu mushiwo wakweli, kwa kuti inywi mu wantu ywangu. Nenighue mntu mng'we kulawa mwe kia mzi, na wantu waili kulawa mwe kia kolwa, niwauze mpaka muima Sayuni. <verse eid="JER 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 3:15" />Neniminke wagholokezi weniiva, ndiwo wamigholokele kwa unyanyi na viugho. <verse eid="JER 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 3:16" />Mishi iyo mukizamema na kughenea mwe shi, wantu hewajiange vingi sanduku jangu ja kilagha. Hewajifanyanye wala kujifukila, hewajikunde na hewaghoshole tuhu. <verse eid="JER 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 3:17" />Mwe iyo mishi, mzi wa Yelusalemu newiitangwe ‘Kiti cha Uzumbe cha Zumbe Mulungu’ na mbali zoshe neziunganyane uko Yelusalemu zinivike imi. Hewaghoshole kwa utii wa myoyo yawe. <verse eid="JER 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 3:18" />Mwe iyo mishi, wantu wa Yuda newaituke hang'we na wantu wa Izilaeli, wosheni newalawe mwe shi za kasikazini na kuuya mwe shi niwainkileyo wa ishe zenyu iituke shi yawe ya kale.”<verse eid="JER 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu wa Zumbe Mulungu watavika mulungu mituhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 3:19" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 3:19">“Izilaeli, nikundie nikukunde iwe sa ng'wanangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 3:19">nikundie nikunke shi yeozoka, yetama kwa kuima na kushugha kuiko shi yoyoshe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 3:19">Nikundie uniitange tate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 3:19">na ungesheeka kuituka hang'we naimi.<verse eid="JER 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 3:20" />Miya sa mvyee ashiye mkweli kwa muume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 3:20">nee mushozievyo ukweli kwangu imi inywi wavyawa wa Izilaeli.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 3:20">Imi Zumbe Mulungu nizalonga.<verse eid="JER 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 3:21" />Kwaaivikana vuzo mwe vitui vikazu vya miima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 3:21">Waizilaeli waaiya na kusigiiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 3:21">kwa kuti wazaikala kwa kughoshola uhuza</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 3:21">na wazamjaa Zumbe Mulungu wawe.<verse eid="JER 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 3:22" />Uyai inywi wana muekiewo kunitegheleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 3:22">nenimihonye na kumigheusha wakweli.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 3:22">Nenywi mwaghamba, “Welela ishwi titakuuiya, kwa kuti iwe niweyo Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu lweshu. <verse eid="JER 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 3:23" />Kweli tizakilufya kuvika mulungu mituhu kwe miima. Kweli uvunizi wa Izilaeli uwanduka na kwa Zumbe Mulungu ye ike du. <verse eid="JER 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 3:24" />Kwa kumvika Baali zumbe atieteeye shoni kuzatieka ishwi tiaze vintu vyetu vyaondeezwavyo ni baba zeshu kwa kughoshola ndima kuanduka kale, mafyo ya ngoto, ng'ombe na wana wawe wa kimbwanga na wa wakindee. <verse eid="JER 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 3:25" />Shuti tikilaze he shanga kwa shoni, na kueka shoni yeshu itighubike. Ishwi na baba zeshu tizaghoshola uhuza mwe mesho ya Zumbe Mulungu lweshu kuanduka tiike wabwanga mpaka ivi lelo, wala hetamtegheleze Zumbe Mulungu lweshu.”<verse eid="JER 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JER 4" />
  <para style="s">Muitango wa Kuvoteka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 4:1" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, “Inywi wantu wa Izilaeli, kati mwaakunda kuuya niuiyai imi, kati mukiiusha mulungu yeniihia mwe mesho yangu na kushesangadika uko na uko, <verse eid="JER 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 4:2" />mukiituka wakweli na kuituka sa Zumbe Mulungu avyekunda na kwa utanda, neulape kwa zina jangu, kwa kughamba, ‘Sa Zumbe Mulungu avyeishi,’ nee ndiho wantu wa mbali zoshe waonele mng'azo wa mesho kulawa kwakwe na kukigimbika.”<verse eid="JER 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 4:3" />Zumbe Mulungu awaghamba wantu wa Yuda na wantu wa Yelusalemu kuti, “Imai mbuwa zenyu zena mputi, mushezahanda mbeyu zenyu chamakoa. <verse eid="JER 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 4:4" />Inywi wantu wa Yuda na wa Yelusalemu tozai kilagha changu imi Zumbe Mulungu, kiavyei kwangu kwa myoyo yoshe. Mukisheghoshola ivyoho, nenikwewe ni maya makai, hekuna mwedaha kuyahoza.”<verse eid="JER 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shi ya Yuda itatoighwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 4:5" />Biikiai mwe shi ya Yuda na uko Yelusalemu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:5">Vuziiyai magunda mwe shi yoshe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:5">Biikiai na kughamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:5">Kiunganyanyei, tighuukie na kwe mizi yena ughojo!<verse eid="JER 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 4:6" />Onyeshai ntangilo kuti mutaita Sayuni!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:6">Ghuukai mukakihonye! Ekai kuhondomaa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:6">Zumbe Mulungu ataeta ntogho</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:6">na ubanasi kuandukia wazu wa kasikazini.<verse eid="JER 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 4:7" />Mkomi wa shi azalawa pee uko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:7">sa shimba ivyelawa ikifishizeho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:7">azalawa pele mwe hemelo jakwe, kunga aibane shi ya Yuda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:7">Mizi ya Yuda neighaluke mahuzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:7">heiikawe ni mntu yoyoshe.<verse eid="JER 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 4:8" />Kwa ivyoho, zwikai shuke za magunia, musigiie na kukema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:8">kwa kuti Zumbe Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:8">akena maya na shi ya Yuda.<verse eid="JER 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 4:9" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, “Mwe uwo mshi, wazumbe na waambizi wawe newahondomae, wavikizi newaogohe na wateghanyi newamashwe.”<verse eid="JER 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 4:10" />Nee niheghamba, “Zumbe Mulungu azawalufya wantu wa Yelusalemu! Wawaghambila kuti, mbuli zawe neziite vitana, kumbe hamba ji mwe shingo zawe.”<verse eid="JER 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 4:11" />Hakizabula, awa wantu hang'we na waja we mwe mzi wa Yelusalemu newaghangwe kuti, “Wantu wangu newafufuntwe ni mpeho yena kiuke yeanduka na kwe vitui vikazu vye mwe ughongo yakunta kuita na kwe wantu wangu. Miya iyo sio mpeho yepuiisha mantu, <verse eid="JER 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 4:12" />miya iyo niyeeta imi ni mpeho nkai. Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu mwewalaha awa wantu.”<verse eid="JER 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kudengwa kwa shi ya Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 4:13" />Welela, mnkuu aaiza sa zunde. Magai yakwe ya nkondo ni sa kimbunga, na faashi zakwe zaaghuuka kuzinka ngwiizi. Tahea ishwi! Tizashia kufa!<verse eid="JER 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 4:14" />Iwe Yelusalemu, eka uhuza we mwe moyo ywako, kunga muvuniwe. Neufanyanye uhuza mpaka ini?<verse eid="JER 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 4:15" />Kwa kuti mtung'wa kulawa Dani na mwelawa mwe miima ya Efulaimu watabiikia mbuli mbada. <verse eid="JER 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 4:16" />Waghambilei wantu wa mbali zoshe inu mbuli, biikiai izi mbuli mwe mzi wa Yelusalemu kuti, wankuu waaiza kulawa shi ya hale, waawiikia nkani mzi wa Yuda. <verse eid="JER 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 4:17" />Newaudenganyize mzi wa Yelusalemu sa wantu we mwe kiisi, kwa kuti wazanihituka, ayo nee Zumbe Mulungu alongieyo.<verse eid="JER 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 4:18" />Mbuli zako na uvyeghoshola nee vikueteevyo ivi. Izo nee ntogho zikubuizezo, welela zaakuja mwe moyo wako.<verse eid="JER 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yelemia atawasininikia wantu wakwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 4:19" />Moyo wangu utapwita pwita!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:19">Naasungudika kwa kuumia!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:19">Sidaha kutongomaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:19">naaiva mvumiio wa gunda</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:19">na vuzo ja nkondo.<verse eid="JER 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 4:20" />Kuna ntogho ulanga ya ntogho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:20">shi ngima izabanika.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:20">Hemelo jangu jizabanighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:20">vyashitia vyakwe vizatatulwa vihindi hindi.<verse eid="JER 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 4:21" />Nenione nkondo mpaka ini</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:21">na kuiva vuzo ja magunda?<verse eid="JER 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 4:22" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, “Wantu wangu ni madashi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:22">hewanitaila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:22">Ni wana madashi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:22">hewana akii.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:22">Ni wantu wetaiya kughoshola uhuza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:22">hewadaha kughoshola mbuli zedi.”<verse eid="JER 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yelemia atateghanya ntogho ndizo zilawiiye</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 4:23" />Naaiwelela shi, nee ni nkazu na heina kintu chochoshe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:23">naawelela lwingu, nee jiishina langaila.<verse eid="JER 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 4:24" />Naawelela miima, nee ikitingishika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:24">viima vyoshe nee vitakweta.<verse eid="JER 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 4:25" />Nizaweya miya saene mntu yoyoshe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:25">mpaka madeghe nee yaishiho.<verse eid="JER 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 4:26" />Naawelela ija shi yeozoka izagheuka ughongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:26">na mizi yakwe yosheni izagheuka mahuzu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:26">kwa mbuli ya maya makai ya Zumbe Mulungu.<verse eid="JER 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 4:27" />Zumbe Mulungu aghambile ivi, “Shi ngima neigheuke ughongo, miya seniibane.<verse eid="JER 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 4:28" />Kwa ivyoho, shi neisininike</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:28">na lwingu nejiituke kiza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:28">Kwa kuti imi Zumbe Mulungu nizalonga na senibadiishe kanwa changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:28">nizalonga na senihituke.<verse eid="JER 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 4:29" />Wakiiva vuzo ja wekwea faashi na wetoa maosa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:29">kia mng'we mwe mzi naaghuuke.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:29">Kung'we newaghuuke na mwe mashafi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:29">na kung'we newakwee kwe makuungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:29">Mizi yoshe neiituke heina wantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:29">hekuna mntu ndiye aikale mwe iyo shi.<verse eid="JER 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 4:30" />Mzi wa Yelusalemu uzabanighwa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:30">Kwai wagholokezi wakwe wazwika shuke zeunguika za kizumbe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:30">Kwai waakihamba mahembo ya zahabu na kukishisha wanja mwe mesho yako?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:30">Kukipamba kwako ni bue!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:30">Wemikunda wazamieka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:30">na wachekunda ni kukukoma.”<verse eid="JER 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 4:31" />Naaiva kiiyo sa cha mvyee mwekishungua,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:31">vuzo via atakishungua mpaa yakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:31">Nee ni vuzo ja mndee wa Yelusalemu mwehemezuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:31">na kunyoosha mikono yakwe akighamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:31">“Changu ndicho!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 4:31">Lelo nafa! Ugima wangu u mwe mikono ya wakomi!”<verse eid="JER 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JER 5" />
  <para style="s">Uhuza wa wantu wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 5:1" />Ghuukai uko na uko mwe mzi wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:1">welelai kia hantu mukionee wenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:1">ondezai mwe vyengo vyakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:1">muwelele kati kuna mntu mweghoshola kwa ukweli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:1">kati ahaho, Zumbe Mulungu neauivile mbazi mzi wa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="JER 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 5:2" />Hang'we na kuti waalapa, “Sa Zumbe Mulungu avyeishi,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:2">miya milape yawe ni ya lufyo.<verse eid="JER 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 5:3" />Iwe Zumbe Mulungu, kale awelela kweli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:3">Azamitoa, miya hemuhezie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:3">azamivaiya miya hemumtegheleze.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:3">Nee muii watii, hemukundie kueka uhuza wenyu.<verse eid="JER 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 5:4" />Nee nihetaila kuti, “Awa ni wakiwa, vingi hewana akii.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:4">Hewataila mbuli ntana azekunda Zumbe Mulungu wayaghoshole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:4">hewataila mulomo wa Mulungu wawe.<verse eid="JER 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 5:5" />Kwa ivyoho, neniite kwa wagholokezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:5">neimi nenilonge nawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:5">kwa kuti waataila mbuli ntana azekunda Zumbe Mulungu waghoshole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:5">wataila milomo ya Mulungu.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:5">Miya woshe wazaemea ugholokezi wa Zumbe Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:5">na kumtegheleza.<verse eid="JER 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 5:6" />Kwa ivyoho, shimba kulawa mzitui neikunyaghufue,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:6">kui ja tundui nejilawe mwe ughongo jikung'afue.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:6">Shui neiwateghe hehi na mizi yawe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:6">Mwelawa du neadwishwe vihindi hindi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:6">kwa kuti washindia mhituka Zumbe Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:6">mishi yoshe wataeka kumtongela Zumbe Mulungu.<verse eid="JER 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 5:7" />Zumbe Mulungu atauza kuti, “Kwai niwaushiize wantu wangu uhuza wawe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:7">Muzanihituka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:7">na kuita kweivika mulungu ya lufyo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:7">Nihewainka nkande, waheighuta</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:7">watehimba kuvika mulungu ya lufyo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:7">wakashoshonteana mwe kaya za kughoshoela ukilanga.<verse eid="JER 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 5:8" />Ni sa faashi za ngoshi ziighutezo zekunda faashi za fyee,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:8">kia mng'we akimkunda mvyee wa nyiae.<verse eid="JER 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 5:9" />Ivi nishewalahe kwa izo mbuli zosheni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:9">Nisheihiize nkuu kwa wantu wa inu mbali?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:9">Ivyo nee Zumbe Mulungu avyelonga. <verse eid="JER 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 5:10" />Neniwaaghiize wankuu waite kwe mbuwa za mizabibu za wantu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:10">wakaikee miya washeibane.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:10">Neniwaghambile wahadue matambi ya mzabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:10">kwa kuti ayo matambi shiyo yangu imi Zumbe Mulungu.<verse eid="JER 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 5:11" />Wantu wa Izilaeli na wantu wa Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:11">wazanihituka kwei.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 5:11">Ivyo nee Zumbe Mulungu avyelonga.<verse eid="JER 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zumbe Mulungu atawaemea Waizilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 5:12" />Wazalonga lufyo kwa mbuli ya Zumbe Mulungu, wakighamba, “Heaghoshole chochoshe, wala hekuna ubada wowoshe welawiya. Hetitoighwe nkondo vingi hetiisiize kushowa nkande.” <verse eid="JER 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 5:13" />Wateghanyi hewana kintu chochoshe wachelonga miya mbuli zishinazo viugho, kwa kuti hekuna mbuli waghambiweyo ni Zumbe Mulungu. Kwa ivyoho ushe, neviwauiye wenye! <verse eid="JER 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 5:14" />Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu mwena nguvu zoshe aghamba ivi, “Kwa kuti wo wazalonga izo mbuli nikunkiezo iwe Yelemia mwe kanwa chako, neniyagheushe sa moto na awa wantu newahye sa nkuni.”<verse eid="JER 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 5:15" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba, inywi wantu wa Izilaeli, nenimietee mbali ng'wenga kulawa hale, iize kwemitoa. Ni mbali ya mavui mangi, na heitaila kudahighwa ni mbali yoyoshe na miongee yawe hemudaha kuiiva. <verse eid="JER 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 5:16" />Watoa maosa wawe ni hodali, wakoma bia mbazi. <verse eid="JER 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 5:17" />Newaje mbeyu zenyu na nkande zenyu, newawakome wana wenyu wa kibwanga na wa kindee, newachinje mafyo yenyu ya ngoto, ya mbuzi na ya ng'ombe, newaibane mizabibu yenyu na miti yenyu ya mitini. Newaibane mizi yenyu izungushiizweyo wigho muyealila na kukoma wantu weikala umo kwa mamundu yawe.<verse eid="JER 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 5:18" />Zumbe Mulungu akaghamba, “Iyo mishi ikizabula, imi senimikome inywi wantu wangu. <verse eid="JER 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 5:19" />Wantu wakizamiuza, kwai Zumbe Mulungu lweshu azatighoshoela ivyoho? Iwe neuwaghambe, inywi mwaamueka Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu wenyu mukavika mulungu mwe shi yenyu. Vivyoho, nemukawatumikile wantu watuhu mwe shi ishiyo yenyu.”<verse eid="JER 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zumbe Mulungu atawashunda wantu ywakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 5:20" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, “Wabiikilei wantu wa chengo cha Yakobo, na wantu wa Yuda muwaghambile ivi, <verse eid="JER 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 5:21" />Teghelezai inywi madashi mushinawo akii, muna mesho miya hemuona, muna magutwi miya hemuiva. <verse eid="JER 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 5:22" />Imi Zumbe Mulungu nitauza! Kwai hemuniogoha? Kwai hemuzingiiza kwangu? Nizaika mshanga uituke nee mhaka wekindiiza mazi ya bahai kale na kale. Hang'we na kuti mawimbi yaautoa, miya heyadaha kuuzinka, yaaboha, miya heyauzinka. <verse eid="JER 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 5:23" />Miya awa wantu wana myoyo ya utii na wehetuka, wazanihituka wakaita zawe. <verse eid="JER 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 5:24" />Hewafanyanya mwe myoyo yawe kuti, timuogohei Zumbe Mulungu lweshu, mwetigwishiiza fua za vui na za mashika kwa mishi yakwe, na kutinka majila ya kushuma. <verse eid="JER 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 5:25" />Mbuli zenyu mbada na uhuza wenyu uzaeka musheonele mbuli ntana.”<verse eid="JER 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 5:26" />“Mwe wantu wangu kuna wahuza, wetegha sa vinga ni wantu weteghea madeghe, vingi sa wantu weika mitegho yawe kunga iwagwile wantu. <verse eid="JER 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 5:27" />Sa via mkaa avyememeeza mwe ntezu madeghe alashizeyo, nee nyumba zawe zimemievyo vintu vya ubavi. Nee vyeleka wazaituka wantu wetaikana vingi wana kiiko, <verse eid="JER 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 5:28" />wazagimbaa na kudodomoka. Hewana mihaka kwe kughoshola mbuli mbada, hewawaambiza wafiiwewo ni waishe zawe na wanine zawe kuinkwa chewataa, wala hewawavunia wakiwa kwa ukweli.”<verse eid="JER 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 5:29" />“Kweli nishewalahe kwa izi mbuli? Nenieke zeze kulaha mbali ya wantu sa awa? <verse eid="JER 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 5:30" />Mbuli yemasha na kuihiza izalawiya mwe inu shi, <verse eid="JER 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 5:31" />wateghanyi wateghanya mbuli za lufyo, wavikizi wohena wagholokela sa wavyekunda wenye, na wantu ywangu wazaivana navyo. Miya bontokelo jikizabula nemutendeze?”<verse eid="JER 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JER 6" />
  <para style="s">Mzi wa Yelusalemu utadengwa ni wankuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 6:1" />Inywi wantu wa Benjamini, lawai mwe mzi wa Yelusalemu mughuuke kwa mbuli ya usaama wenyu! Vuziiai magunda mwe mzi wa Tekoa, onyeshai ntangilo uko Besi Hakelemu. Kwa kuti ntogho na ubanasi vihehi kuiza kulawa wazu wa kasikazini. <verse eid="JER 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 6:2" />Mzi wa Yelusalemu ni mtana, miya neniubane. <verse eid="JER 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 6:3" />Wazumbe newaize na waghojo wawe kweutoa uwo mzi, sa walishi wavyeituka hang'we na ngoto na mbuzi zawe. Newakime makumbi yawe kuudenganyia uwo mzi, na kia zumbe neaikale hantu ahekunda ye ng'wenye. <verse eid="JER 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 6:4" />Newaghambe, “Kikantei tikautoe mzi wa Yelusalemu! Titei tikautoe mshii!” Vikibinda newaghambe, “Tizacheewa zua jitagongooka, na vizui vitaisiiza kuleha. <verse eid="JER 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 6:5" />Inukai, titei nakio tikabonde ngome zawe.”<verse eid="JER 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 6:6" />Zumbe Mulungu mwena ufung'wa woshe aghamba ivi, “Shengai miti, muzenge kiugha cha kukweea kudenganyiiza ukando wa mzi wa Yelusalemu. Shuti unu mzi utoighwe kwa kuti wantu weikala umo wamemie zuuma du. <verse eid="JER 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 6:7" />Sa kishima chivyeika mazi matana, nee mzi wa Yelusalemu uvyeika uhuza wakwe. Kuivikana vuzo na ubanasi mwe uwo mzi, mishi yoshe niona matamu na vionda du mwe uwo mzi. <verse eid="JER 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 6:8" />Inywi wantu wa Yelusalemu, kundai kushundwa, kati sio ivyoho nenimieke na shi yenyu neniighalushe ughongo, hantu hashiikalwaho ni wantu.”<verse eid="JER 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu washikundawo kuiva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 6:9" />Zumbe Mulungu mwena ufung'wa woshe aghamba ivi, “Waunganyanyei wantu wosheni wa Izilaeli washighaewo sa wantu wavyeghoshola wakishuma mazabibu, ughiizai vituhu.”<verse eid="JER 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 6:10" />Nee nihehisa, “Nenitegheezwe ni ndai nikilonga nawo kunga niwashunde? Wo ni watii wataemea kutegheleza mbuli yako watasheka nikiwaghambila zia mbuli unighambilezo niwaghambile. <verse eid="JER 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 6:11" />Maya yako kwawe yaniumiza iwe Zumbe Mulungu, sidaha kuzizimiza.” Nee Zumbe ahenighambila, “Ayo maya kayaukue kwa wana we mwe sia na kia hantu wabwanga waheunganana, waghoshi na wakazie wawe newaghuighwe na kuighawa hale na waghundu heweekwe. <verse eid="JER 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 6:12" />Nyumba zawe neziinkiwe kwa wantu watuhu, mbuwa zawe hang'we na wakazie wawe kwa kuti, nenikusue mkono wangu kunga niwalahe wantu weikala mwe inu shi. <verse eid="JER 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 6:13" />Wantu wosheni, kuandusha wetaikana na washitaikanawo, wakunda waonee vingi kwa sia za zuuma, wateghanyi na wavikizi, wohe waghoshola kwa lufyo. <verse eid="JER 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 6:14" />Chia wacheghoshola kwa wantu wangu waumizwewo kweli nikuwainka kialilo cha amani chishicho cha kweli. <verse eid="JER 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 6:15" />Ivi waona shoni, kwa mbuli zawe kwa mbuli zawe zekweza maya kwei? Doo! Hewaona shoni hata hadodo du hewateiya hata kuona shoni. Kwa ivyoho newagwe hang'we na waja wegwa neniwakome kweli, ivyo nee avyelonga Zumbe Mulungu.”<verse eid="JER 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu Waizilaeli wataemela kumtongela Zumbe Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 6:16" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, “Gholokai mwe sia mpanda muwelele, uzai sia za kale mutaile sia yedi ihi. Zinkai mwe iyo sia nenywi nemuonee mpolele.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 6:16">Miya wo wakaghamba, “Hetizinke mwe iyo sia.” <verse eid="JER 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 6:17" />Nee nihewaikila waghojo, nikawaghamba, teghelezai muiyo wa magunda. Miya wo wakaghamba, “Hetiutegheleze ishwi.”<verse eid="JER 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 6:18" />Kwa ivyoho, “Teghelezai inywi wantu wa mbali zoshe na inywi bumba mutaile mbuli zeiza kwewalawiya wantu wangu. <verse eid="JER 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 6:19" />Tegheleza inywi wantu mweikala mwe shi! Neniwaetee awa wantu ntogho kwa mbuli wafanyanyezo wenye. Kwa kuti hewategheleze mbuli yangu na sheia yangu wazaiemea. <verse eid="JER 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 6:20" />Munietea ubani wa mbwai kulawa Sheba na udi wena mzingo mtana welawa kwe shi ya hale ni wa mbwai? Senizihokele ntogoo zenyu za kuoka na ntogoo zenyu zakughubika uhuza hezinitamila. <verse eid="JER 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 6:21" />Kwa ivyoho imi Zumbe Mulungu naghamba, awa wantu neniwaikile vidighino. Ivyo vidighino neviwakinye wana na waishe zawe, wantu weikala nyumba ya mazu na weae wawe newafe.”<verse eid="JER 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wankuu waaiza kulawa wazu wa kasikazini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 6:22" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, “Welelai wantu waaiza kulawa shi ya kasikazini, waghojo wangi waaiza na shi yena wantu wena nguvu wazainuka kulawa hae na inu shi. <verse eid="JER 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 6:23" />Wainue nyuta na maosa yawe, awo wantu ni makatii washinawo mbazi. Wakiituka waikwezie mwe faashi zawe shindo zawe ni sa mazi ya bahai yeboha, waikiighanye pee kwa kuutoa nkondo mzi wa Yelusalemu.”<verse eid="JER 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 6:24" />“Tizaiva mbuli zawe, mikono yeshu izaegheeka, tizatozwa ni mishango, savinga ni mvyee mwekishungua. <verse eid="JER 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 6:25" />Hetidaha kuita nkoi na se hekuawika kwa kuti, wankuu lweshu waitozize siaha mwe mikono, kia hantu haagea wogha.”<verse eid="JER 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 6:26" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, “Inywi wantu wangu zwikai shuke za magunia, musaghane mwe zeu. Kemai sa mntu mwemkemea ng'wanae ayenanaye yuyo du akifa, kwa kuti wakomi waaiza viviushe kwemikoma. <verse eid="JER 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 6:27" />Yelemia, iwe nitekuika uituke muweezi wa wantu wangu, kunga uwelele na kuzitaila sia zawe. <verse eid="JER 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 6:28" />Woshe ni watii na wehituka waisizeewo, wazinkana kia hantu wakilonga mbuli za wantu. Watogha sa shaba yechuta ama sa chuma, wosheni wana zuuma. <verse eid="JER 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 6:29" />Ziko jitaaka, lisasi itaungumia umo mwe moto, nizakiekea kuwang'aza wantu wangu, kwa kuti wahuza hewadaha kushizwa uhuza wawe. <verse eid="JER 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 6:30" />Newaitangwe ‘Mantu ya madini ya hea,’ kwa kuti imi Zumbe Mulungu nizawaemela.”<verse eid="JER 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JER 7" />
  <para style="s">Yelemia atabilikila mwe nyumba ya Zumbe Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 7:1" />Inu nee mbuli yamuiiziayo Yelemia kulawa kwa Zumbe Mulungu ikighamba, <verse eid="JER 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 7:2" />hita ukagholoke mwe zuvi kulu ja kuingila mwe nyumba ya kunighoshoela mviko ukabiikile ivihi, “Teghelezai mbuli ya Zumbe Mulungu inywi wantu wa Yuda mweingila aha na kumvika Zumbe Mulungu. <verse eid="JER 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 7:3" />Zumbe Mulungu mwena ufung'wa woshe, Mulungu wa Izilaeli aghamba ivi, ‘Ekai mbuli zenyu mbada muzeghoshola, nee ndiho nimieke muikale haha.’ <verse eid="JER 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 7:4" />Ekai kualila mbuli za lufyo mukighamba kuti, ‘Kuihozie, inu ni nyumba ya Zumbe Mulungu, inu ni nyumba ya Zumbe Mulungu, ehe ni nyumba ya Zumbe Mulungu!’ ”<verse eid="JER 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 7:5" />“Kati kwei mukieka sia zenyu mbada na mbuli zenyu mbada na kughoshoeana mbuli ntana sa avyekunda Zumbe Mulungu kia mng'we na nyiae, <verse eid="JER 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 7:6" />kati mukieka kuwazuumu wagheni, wana wafiiwewo ni wavyazi, wavyee wafiiwewo ni waghoshi wawe na kueka kuwakoma wantu washinawo masa mwe inu shi na mukieka kuvika mulungu mituhu yemibana inywi, <verse eid="JER 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 7:7" />mukihituka, nenimieke muikale mwe inu shi nawainkayo baba zenyu ighaluke yawe kale na kale.”<verse eid="JER 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 7:8" />“Welelai ushe, mualila mbuli za lufyo zishimiambizazo. <verse eid="JER 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 7:9" />Mwaabawa, mwaakoma, mwaaghoshola ukilanga, mwaaghoshola mlape wa lufyo, mwamtutuishiza ubani zumbe Baali na kuvika mulungu mituhu mushitailayo. <verse eid="JER 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 7:10" />Mughoshola izo mbuli zoshe zeniihiza imi Zumbe Mulungu, vikibinda mutaiza kwegholoka mwe nyumba yangu mukighamba, ‘Hetibulwe ni mbuli mbada yoyoshe.’ <verse eid="JER 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 7:11" />Ivi, inu nyumba yangu izaghaluka mpanga ya wabavi? Tailai kuti, naaona mbuli zosheni muzeghoshola. <verse eid="JER 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 7:12" />Hitai kuja Shilo, mwe mzi nashaghulawo aho kale nivikwe, mukawelele icho kihii nawazisacho, kwa mbuli ya uhuza wa wantu wangu wa Izilaeli. <verse eid="JER 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 7:13" />Muhezaituka mwaaghoshola uwo uhuza wosheni, naalonga na inywi kwa kangi miya hemunitegheleze. Nihezamiitanga hemuniivile. <verse eid="JER 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 7:14" />Kwa ivyoho, icho nighosholecho kwe mzi wa Shilo, nee ndicho niighoshole nyumba muyevikia na kuialila, nee hantu niminkileho inywi na baba zenyu. <verse eid="JER 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 7:15" />Nenimighuushe muite na hale sa via nawaghuushavyo wandughu wenyu wa Efulaimu.”<verse eid="JER 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu wataituka watii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 7:16" />Zumbe Mulungu aanighamba kuti, “Yelemia, ushewavikile awa wantu, usheniiye wala ushenivike kwa mbuli yawe, kwa kuti senikutegheleze. <verse eid="JER 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 7:17" />Ivi iwe huona mbuli zeghoshoka mwe mizi ya Yuda na mwe sia za Yelusalemu? <verse eid="JER 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 7:18" />Wana watadodoeza nkuni, waghoshi watasha moto na wavyee watakanda unga kunga wadike mikate kwa mbuli ya mulungu wayeitanga malikia wa kwe lwingu. Vingi waaigeea divai mulungu mituhu kunga wanikweze maya. <verse eid="JER 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 7:19" />Ivi wamkweza ndai maya? Ivi hemukiumiza wenye na kukigea shoni? <verse eid="JER 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 7:20" />Kwa ivyoho, imi Zumbe Mulungu mwena ufung'wa woshe naghamba ivi, maya yangu makai neyaituke aha hantu kwa mbuli ya awa wantu na vizama na miti ye nkoi na mbeyu ze mwe shi. Neyaituke sa moto ushidahawo kuzimighwa.”<verse eid="JER 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 7:21" />Zumbe Mulungu mwena ufung'wa woshe, Mulungu wa Izilaeli aghamba ivi, “Haya ongezai ntogoo zenyu za kuoka ulanga ya ntogoo za kughubika uhuza na nyama zakwe mje wenye. <verse eid="JER 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 7:22" />Kwa kuti, nihezawalavya baba zenyu mwe shi ya Misii, saawainkile mulomo wowoshe kwa mbuli ya ntogoo za kuokwa na ntogoo ntuhu, <verse eid="JER 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 7:23" />miya nawaghambila du kuti, wategheleze nivyelonga, nee ndiho niituke Mulungu wawe, wohena waituke wantu wangu. Vingi waghoshole mbuli zoshe sa niwaghambilevyo, kunga mbuli zawe ziite vitana. <verse eid="JER 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 7:24" />Miya hewanitegheleze wala kuniiva miya wakaituka na utii, wakauya mghongo badala ya kuita mbele. <verse eid="JER 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 7:25" />Kuanduka mishi baba zenyu wahelawa mwe shi ya Misii mpaka ivi lelo, siteiya kueka kumiaghiziiza watung'wa wangu wateghanyi. <verse eid="JER 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 7:26" />Miya hewanitegheleze wala kuniiva nichelonga, wakaituka watii na wenihituka kuiko baba zenyu.”<verse eid="JER 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 7:27" />“Miya ushe iwe Yelemia, ukizawaghambila izo mbuli zoshe, hewakutegheleze, neuwaitange hewakuzumiye. <verse eid="JER 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 7:28" />Kwa ivyoho waghambile kuti, inywi mumbali mushimuivawo Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu wenyu wala hemkunda kushundwa. Ukweli heumo mwe vyanwa vyenyu.”<verse eid="JER 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uhuza utaghoshoka mwe Koongo ja Hinomu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 7:29" />“Moai sui zenyu inywi wantu wa Yelusalemu, muziashe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 7:29">iyai inywi wantu wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 7:29">imbai maimbo ya ndio mwe miima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 7:29">kwa kuti, imi Zumbe Mulungu nizakwewa ni maya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 7:29">nizamiemela vigima inywi wantu wangu.”<verse eid="JER 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 7:30" />“Wantu wa Yuda wazaghoshola uhuza mwe mesho yangu. Wazaika mulungu yawe yeniihia mwe nyumba yangu, waieka ishetame kwa mviko. <verse eid="JER 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 7:31" />Wazazenga hantu hakulaviiza ntogoo heitangwa Tofesi kwe kitui che mwe koongo ja Hinomu, kunga wawalavye wana wawe wa kibwanga na wa kindee ntogoo mwe moto. Imi sitaila kuwaaghiiza waghoshole ivyoho, wala siifanyanye iyo mbuli mwe mtwi wangu. <verse eid="JER 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 7:32" />Kwa ivyoho ushe, mishi yaaiza, ijo koongo hewajiitange vingi Tofesi wala Koongo ja Hinomu, newajiitange Koongo ja kuchinjiiza. Newazikiye wantu uko, kwa kuti hekuituke na hantu hatuhu hakuzikiya. <verse eid="JER 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 7:33" />Maiti zawe neziituke nkande za madeghe ya uko ulanga na vizama vya tundui, hekuoneke mweyashaka. <verse eid="JER 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 7:34" />Iyo shi neighaluke ughongo. Hekuivikane vuzo jojoshe ja kisheko wala ja nyemi, nyemi za mweteghua wala mweteghulwa mwe mizi ya Yuda na mitaa ya Yelusalemu, kwa kuti shi neiituke heina kintu.”<verse eid="JER 7:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JER 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 8:1" />Zumbe Mulungu mwena ufung'wa woshe aghamba ivi, “Mishi iyo ukizabula, mavuha ya wazumbe wa Yuda na ya waambizi wawe na ya wavikizi na ya wateghanyi na ya wantu wa Yelusalemu neyaushighwe kulawa mwe mbiya zawe. <verse eid="JER 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 8:2" />Ivyo nee vintu wakundavyo na kuvitumikila, wakavitongela kunga wainkwe vinyanyi na kuvivika, nevianikiwe vitoighwe ni zua na ng'wezi na ntondwe za kwe lwingu. Ayo mavuha heyaunganyanywe wala kushiiwa, miya neyaituke sa mantu mwe shanga. <verse eid="JER 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 8:3" />Hantu hohoshe ndiho niwaghuushe naho awa wantu wa inu mbali mbada, newaone kesa kufa kuiko kuituka moyo.”<verse eid="JER 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuagha kwa wantu wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 8:4" />Iwe Yelemia waghambile awa wantu kuti, Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, “Mntu akigwa hainuka vingi? Mntu akiagha sia hauya na mwe sia yakwe? <verse eid="JER 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 8:5" />Kwai ushe awa wantu wataagha? Kwai wantu wa Yelusalemu wataagha kia saa? Watetozeeza lufyo na wazemea kuniuiya imi. <verse eid="JER 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 8:6" />Imi naawategheleza vitana, miya wo hewalongie ukweli wowoshe. Hekuna mwevoteka kwa mbuli ya uhuza wakwe, wala kukiuza kuti, ‘Ni mbwai ivi nighosholevyo?’ Kangi kia mng'we adosa sia yakwe ng'wenye, sa vinga ni faashi yeghuuka kuita kwe nkondo. <verse eid="JER 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 8:7" />Kolongo jaataila mshi wa kushama, sua, shemkoko na hondohondo vyataila mishi yawe ya kuuya. Miya wantu wangu hewataila nivyekunda kwawe imi Zumbe Mulungu. <verse eid="JER 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 8:8" />Mudaha zeze kughamba, ‘Ishwi tina viugho, kwa kuti tina sheiya ya Zumbe Mulungu,’ naho wegonda sheiya zangu, wazazihitua na kugonda lufyo? <verse eid="JER 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 8:9" />Wena viugho newaingiwe ni shoni, newasungudishwe na kugwiwa. Kwa kuti, wazaiemela mbuli ya Zumbe Mulungu, ushe, ni viugho ani ivyo wavyena navyo? <verse eid="JER 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 8:10" />Kwa ivyoho, wakazie wawe neniwainkile na kwa waghoshi watuhu, mbuwa zawe neniziinkile kwa wantu watuhu. Kwa kuti kuandusha wetaikana na washitaikanawo wakikunda waonee vingi kwa sia za zuuma, wateghanyi na wavikizi wohe waghoshola kwa lufyo. <verse eid="JER 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 8:11" />Chia wacheghoshola kwa wantu wangu waumizwewo kweli nikuwainka kialilo cha amani chishicho cha kweli. <verse eid="JER 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 8:12" />Ivi waona shoni, kwa mbuli zawe kwa mbuli zawe zekweza maya kwei? Doo! Hewaona shoni hata hadodo du hewateiya hata kuona shoni. Kwa ivyoho newagwe hang'we na waja wegwa neniwakome kweli, ivyo nee avyelonga Zumbe Mulungu.”<verse eid="JER 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 8:13" />Zumbe Mulungu naghamba ivi, “Naakunda kuwaunganyanya wantu wangu sa muimi avyeunganyanya shumo jakwe, miya wazahituka wakaghaluka sa mti wa mzabibu ushinawo zabibu, vingi sa mti wa mtini ushinawo tini na mahungo yawe yazakaaghaa. Kwa ivyo nizawakundiiza wagheni waighue shi yawe.”<verse eid="JER 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 8:14" />Wantu wa Yuda watauzana, “Kwai ishwi titeikala du aha? Tiituke kintu king'we, tiite mwe mzi wena ughojo, tikafiie uko. Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu lweshu azakunda tife, azatinka mazi yena sumu tivate, kwa kuti tizaghoshola uhuza. <verse eid="JER 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 8:15" />Tighambile netionele uhonyi na mpolele, miya tihee du kugeighwa wogha. <verse eid="JER 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 8:16" />Kwaaivikana vuzo ja faashi za wankuu kwe mzi wa Dani, shi ngima itazingiiza kwa kuti vifa vizabula. Waizile kweibana shi na wantu na vintu vyosheni vyeumo.”<verse eid="JER 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 8:17" />Nenimietee nyoka zena sumu nkai zishioghekazo kunga zimiume. Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.<verse eid="JER 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yelemia ana usoyoyo kwa mbuli ya wantu wakwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 8:18" />Moyo wangu waasungudika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 8:18">ukiwa wangu heudaha kushiya.<verse eid="JER 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 8:19" />Tegheleza kiiyo cha wantu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 8:19">kulawa mwe shi ya hae.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 8:19">Kwani Zumbe Mulungu hako uko Sayuni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 8:19">Kwani zumbe wakwe hako vingi uko?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 8:19">Kwai wazanikweza maya kwa mbuli ya vinyago yawe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 8:19">kwa mulungu yawe ya kigheni ishiwambizayo?<verse eid="JER 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 8:20" />Shumo jizashia, mishi ya zua izashia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 8:20">ishwi hetizati kuhonywa!<verse eid="JER 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 8:21" />Kwa kuti wantu wangu wazaumizwa na imi nizaumia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 8:21">na imi ni mkiwa, nitasininika.<verse eid="JER 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 8:22" />Ivi uko Gileadi hekuna mzighi wehonya?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 8:22">Uko hekuna mghanga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 8:22">Kwai ushe vionda vya wantu wangu havihonyize?<verse eid="JER 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JER 9" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 9:1" />Nenga mtwi wangu nee ni kishima cha mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:1">na mesho yangu nee ni shoko ya meshozi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:1">nangakema kio na mshii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:1">kwa mbuli ya wantu wangu wakomighwewo.<verse eid="JER 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 9:2" />Nenga nee niina hantu ha kuikala uko kwe ughongo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:2">ambaho ni hale na wantu wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:2">Shiyo wakweli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:2">ni wantu wena lufyo.<verse eid="JER 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 9:3" />Kia mshi wafanyanya kulonga mbuli za lufyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:3">watozeshe mbuli za lufyo hewawelela mbuli za kweli.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 9:3">Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:3">“Wantu wangu wataghoshola uhuza kia mshi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:3">na hewakunda kuti imi ni Mulungu lwawe.”<verse eid="JER 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 9:4" />Kia mng'we aikale na ng'wiae kwa akii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:4">kwa kuti kia mndughu shiyo mkweli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:4">kia mntu ana lufyo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:4">na kia mntu ni mmambeza.<verse eid="JER 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 9:5" />Kia mntu atamuufya ng'wiae,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:5">hekuna hata mng'we mwelonga ukweli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:5">vyanwa vyawe vihinyighwe kuonga lufyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:5">wakitibua wenye kwa kughoshola uhuza.<verse eid="JER 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 9:6" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:6">“Waufyana wenye kwa wenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:6">na mwe kuufyana kwawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:6">wataemela kunitaila imi.”<verse eid="JER 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 9:7" />Kwa ivyoho Zumbe Mulungu mwena ufung'wa woshe aghamba ivi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:7">“Neniwang'aze wantu wangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:7">na kuwazisa mwe mighezo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:7">Wantu wangu wazaghoshola uhuza</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:7">nenighoshole mbwai na awa wantu?<verse eid="JER 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 9:8" />Vyanwa vyawe ni sa maosa yena sumu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:8">hevishiwa ni lufyo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:8">Kia mng'we ashimoea vitana na ng'wiyae,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:8">miya mwe moyo wakwe afanyanya kumuikia mtegho.<verse eid="JER 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 9:9" />Nishewatoe kwa mbuli ya izi mbuli wazeghoshola?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:9">Nisheihiize nkuu kwe mbali sa inu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:9">Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.”<verse eid="JER 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 9:10" />Nenikeme na kusininika kwa mbuli ya miima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:10">nenisininikie hantu hakuishiiza mwe nyika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:10">kwa kuti yazakaaghaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:10">hekuna mwezinkia aho hantu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:10">Ng'ombe heziivikana vingi zikikema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:10">madeghe na vizama vizaghuuka hevioneka.<verse eid="JER 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 9:11" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, “Mzi wa Yelusalemu neniugheushe mahuzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:11">neniugheushe hemelo ja mbweha</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:11">na mizi ya Yuda neniigheushe ughongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:11">hantu hashiikalwaho ni mntu yoyoshe.”<verse eid="JER 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 9:12" />Nee niheuza, “Ivi kweli kuna mntu mwena viugho mwedaha kuzitaila izi mbuli? Zumbe Mulungu amhinyize ndai kunga adahe kubiikila iyo mbuli? Kwai shi izabanighwa na kugheushwa sa ughongo hekuna mntu mwezinka uko?”<verse eid="JER 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 9:13" />Zumbe Mulungu akahisa, “Ivi vilawiye kwa kuti awa wantu wazaemela kutoza mulomo wangu nawainkawo na kuiva nichelonga, wakaghoshola wavyekunda wo. <verse eid="JER 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 9:14" />Miya waitile kwa kuwelela fanyanyi ze mwe myoyo yawe, wakaita kwevika mulungu ya Baali sa baba zawe waghosholavyo.” <verse eid="JER 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 9:15" />Kwa ivyoho, Zumbe Mulungu mwena ufung'wa woshe, Mulungu wa Izilaeli aghamba ivi, “Awa wantu neniwainke nkande zenyeghea waje na mazi yena sumu wavate. <verse eid="JER 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 9:16" />Neniwaasakanye na mwe mbali washitailazo wo na baba zawe, neniwadughanye na nkondo mpaka niwakome woshe.”<verse eid="JER 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu wa Yelusalemu wataombeza uwambizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 9:17" />Zumbe Mulungu mwena ufung'wa woshe aghamba ivi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:17">“Ntongonyezai mbuli zeita kwelawiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:17">muwaitange wavyee wesigiiya waize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:17">ehe, wavyee wedaha imba maimbo ya ndiyo.”<verse eid="JER 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 9:18" />Muwaghambe kuti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:18">“Waize nguzu watiimbile maimbo ya ndiyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:18">mesho yeshu yalavye meshozi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:18">na meshozi yaikie mwe nkumbiti zeshu sa mazi.”<verse eid="JER 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 9:19" />Kwaivikana nkoo uko kwe mzi wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:19">“Welelai, tikomighwevyo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:19">Tizagewa shoni!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:19">Shuti tiishame inu shi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:19">kwa kuti nyumba zeshu zizakinywa.”<verse eid="JER 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 9:20" />Nee niheghamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:20">“Teghelezai mbuli ya Zumbe Mulungu ivywi wavyee,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:20">ikalai washu mutegheleze avyelonga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:20">Wahinyei wandee wenyu kusigiiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:20">kia mng'we amhinye ng'wiaye imbo ja ndiyo.<verse eid="JER 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 9:21" />Kifa chizaingila mwe madiisha yeshu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:21">na mwe nyumba zeshu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:21">chizawakoma wana weshu mwe sia</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:21">na wabwanga weshu mwe vyengo vya mzi.<verse eid="JER 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 9:22" />Wantu wafiewo waaiasakane kia hantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:22">sa kiugha cha mbolea che mwe ubuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:22">sa mafumba ya mahaagi yaekighweyo ni mweshuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:22">hekuna mweyakunganya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:22">Nee Zumbe Mulungu anighambilevyo nilonge.”<verse eid="JER 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 9:23" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:23">“Mwena viugho ashekikombe kwa viugho vyakwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:23">na mwena nguvu ashekikombe kwa nguvu zakwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:23">na mwena kiiko ashekikombe kwa mbuli ya icho kiiko chakwe.<verse eid="JER 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 9:24" />Miya mwekikomba, akikombe kwa kuti aanitaila imi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:24">kuti imi Zumbe Mulungu nina ukundisho ushinawo kihituhitu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:24">nighoshola mbuli za kweli na za utaanda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:24">Kwa kuti, wantu weivyoho nee wenitamila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 9:24">Ivyo nee nivyelonga imi Zumbe Mulungu.”<verse eid="JER 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 9:25" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, “Mishi yaaiza ndiho niwatoe woshe wagezighwewo vionda king'wii du, <verse eid="JER 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 9:26" />yani, Wamisii, Wayuda, Waamoni, Wamoabu na wantu woshe weikala mwe ughongo wemoa madenge. Kwa kuti awa wantu wa izi mbali zoshe hang'we na Waizilaeli hewajiye shogha na imi mwe myoyo yawe.”<verse eid="JER 9:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JER 10" />
  <para style="s">Kuvika vinyago na mviko wa ukweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 10:1" />Inywi wantu wa Izilaeli, teghelezai mbuli muyeghambiwa ni Zumbe Mulungu, <verse eid="JER 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 10:2" />“Mushedoseeze mbuli zeghoshoka mwe mbali ntuhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:2">ntangilo zelawiya kwe lwingu zishemigee wogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:2">hata kati zaawagea wogha wantu wa mbali ntuhu.<verse eid="JER 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 10:3" />Kwa kuti, mila za awa wantu ni za lufyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:3">wataita kweshenga miti mwe mzitu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:3">vikibinda, mweshongola atashongola kwa patasi.<verse eid="JER 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 10:4" />Vikiinda wantu watachihamba kwa madini yeghoshoea hea na zahabu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:4">Watachikonteea misumai</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:4">kunga chishezagwa.<verse eid="JER 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 10:5" />Vinyago vyawe viikale sa vinga ni vinyago vya kuitishiza madeghe mwe ubuwa wa matango,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:5">hevidaha kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:5">vitainulwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:5">kwa kuti hevidaha kujata.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:5">Musheviogohe ivyo vinyago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:5">kwa kuti hevidaha kughoshola mbuli mbada wala yedi.”<verse eid="JER 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 10:6" />Hekuna sa iwe Zumbe Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:6">iwe u mkulu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:6">na waataikana kwa nguvu zako.<verse eid="JER 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 10:7" />Ni ndai ashikuogohaye iwe Zumbe wa mbali zoshe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:7">Iwe ukundighwa uivighwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:7">Mwe wantu wa mbali zoshe wena viugho</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:7">na mwe uzumbe wawe woshe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:7">hekuna sa iwe.<verse eid="JER 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 10:8" />Wosheni hewana akii vingi vighija,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:8">wahinywa ni ivyo vinyago vyawe vishongolwevyo kwa miti vishiwaambizavyo chochoshe.<verse eid="JER 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 10:9" />Ivyo vinyago vihambighwa kwa madini yeghoshoea hea kulawa Talishishi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:9">na madini ya zahabu kulawa mwe shi ya Ufazi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:9">Izi zoshe ni ndima za weshongola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:9">wavikanta shuke za langi yeunguika na buluu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:9">zishumighwezo ni washumi wetaila.<verse eid="JER 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 10:10" />Miya Zumbe Mulungu ye ni Mulungu wa ukweli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:10">Mulungu mwe moyo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:10">zumbe wa kale na kale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:10">Akikwewa ni maya, shi itazingiza</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:10">na wantu wa mbali zoshe hewadaha kuzizimiza kwa mbuli ya maya yakwe.<verse eid="JER 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 10:11" />Awa wantu neuwaghambile kuti, “Milungu ishiumbieyo lwingu na shi, neife. Neiaghe vigima mwe shi na shi ya lwingu.”<verse eid="JER 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imbo ja kumtogola Zumbe Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 10:12" />Miya Zumbe Mulungu aumba shi kwa nguvu zakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:12">aitoghesha kwa viugho vyakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:12">kwa akii zakwe akaika kia kintu kwe lwingu sa akundievyo.<verse eid="JER 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 10:13" />Akigumiya du, mazi ye kwe lwingu yataboha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:13">aaeta ngonono kia hantu mwe shi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:13">aaeka ubambaa utoe mwe mishi ya fua</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:13">na kueta mpeho kulawa uko iiko.<verse eid="JER 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 10:14" />Kia mng'we wawe hana akii, vingi hana achetaila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:14">kia mweshongola vinyago agewa shoni ni ivyo vinyago vyakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:14">kwa kuti ivyo vinyago ni vya lufyo hevina ugima wowoshe.<verse eid="JER 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 10:15" />Ivyo vinyago hevina chochoshe, vitashesha du.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:15">Zumbe Mulungu akizaiza kwewalaha newafe woshe.<verse eid="JER 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 10:16" />Miya Mulungu wa Yakobo, ye shiyo sa ivyo vinyago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:16">ye nee aghosholeye vintu vyoshe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:16">na Izilaeli ni wantu wakwe ashaghulewo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:16">Zina jakwe ni Zumbe Mulungu mwena nguvu zoshe.<verse eid="JER 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kushama kuhehi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 10:17" />Shunganyai vintu vyenyu mulawe mwe inu shi, idenganyizwewo ni wankuu. <verse eid="JER 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 10:18" />Kwa kuti ivi nee avyelonga Zumbe Mulungu, “Neniwalavye mwe inu shi, niwagee mwe ntogho kunga waone sungu.”<verse eid="JER 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 10:19" />Changu ndicho kwa mbuli ya kuumia kwangu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:19">Kionda changu ni kikulu hechiiva mzighi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:19">Miya nikaghamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:19">“Izi ni ntogho, shuti nizizimize.<verse eid="JER 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 10:20" />Kumbi jangu jizang'untwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:20">ngoe zoshe zizadwishwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:20">Wanangu wazanieka wazaita zawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:20">hekuna ashighaeye wa kujikima katuhu kumbi jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:20">hekuna wa kunihoezeza mapazia.”<verse eid="JER 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 10:21" />Nee niheghamba, “Wagholokezi ni madashi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:21">hewamuombeze vinyanyi kwa Zumbe Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:21">Nee vyeleka wazahewa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:21">na wantu wetu wazaasakana.<verse eid="JER 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 10:22" />Teghelezai! Kuzaiza mbuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:22">nkondo kuandukia wazu wa kasikazini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:22">iyo mbuli neieke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:22">mizi ya Yuda ighalushwe mahuzu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:22">na umo nemuituke hemelo ja mbweha.” <verse eid="JER 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 10:23" />Wene Zumbe Mulungu, naataila kuti mtu hadaha kukiamuiya ng'wenye avyeishi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:23">hadaha kugholokela sia zakwe ng'wenye.<verse eid="JER 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 10:24" />Iwe Zumbe Mulungu unishunde</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:24">kwa ukweli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:24">shiyo kwa maya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:24">ushezanikoma.<verse eid="JER 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 10:25" />Maya yako yaighale na kwa wantu wa mbali washikuvikawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:25">na kwa wantu washikutailawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:25">Kwa kuti, wazawakoma wantu ywako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:25">wazatikoma vigima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 10:25">na shi yeshu wazaighalusha mahuzu.<verse eid="JER 10:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JER 11" />
  <para style="s">Kilagha chitabanighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 11:1" />Izi nee mbuli Zumbe Mulungu amghambilazo Yelemia, <verse eid="JER 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 11:2" />“Tegheleza ichi kilagha chivyekunda waghoshole. Vikibinda, uite ukawashimoeze wantu wa Yuda na wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JER 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 11:3" />Ukawaghambile kuti, Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu wa Izilaeli, aghamba ivi, mntu yoyoshe ashitozaye ichi kilagha chivyekunda, nealanwe. <verse eid="JER 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 11:4" />Ichi nee kilagha nawainkacho baba zawe nihezawalavya mwe shi ya Misii, shi imemieyo sungu. Naawaghamba waniive na kughoshola mbuli zoshe niwaaghiizezo. Kuti wakighoshola ivyoho, newaituke wantu ywangu, naimi neniituke Mulungu wawe. <verse eid="JER 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 11:5" />Wakighoshola ivyo niwaaghiizevyo, nenibontoe kilagha nawainkacho baba zawe, kuti neniwainke shi yeozoka kia kintu na yetama kwa kuishiiza, sa viivyo mpaka ivi lelo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 11:5">Nee niheghamba, “Neviituke ivyoho Zumbe Mulungu.”<verse eid="JER 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 11:6" />Zumbe Mulungu akanighambila, “Bilikila mbuli zoshe nikughambilezo mwe mizi ya Yuda na mwe sia za Yelusalemu. Waghambile wantu wazitegheleze izo mbuli za ichi kilagha na kuzighoshola. <verse eid="JER 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 11:7" />Kuanduka mishi iyo nihezawalavya baba zawe mwe shi ya Misii, nikakihima kuwakanya wanitegheleze mpaka iji jecha. <verse eid="JER 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 11:8" />Wo hewaniivile wala kuona kuti iyo mbuli ni yedi, miya wateisiiza kuituka watii na kutongela fanyanyi zawe mbada. Hata ivyoho, naawatoa kwa kushetoza kilagha changu, miya hewachitozize.”<verse eid="JER 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 11:9" />Zumbe Mulungu akanighambila vingi kuti, “Wantu wa Yuda na wa Yelusalemu wana fanyanyi za kunihituka. <verse eid="JER 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 11:10" />Wazaughiiza kughoshola uhuza waghosholwawo ni wababa zawe waemelawo kutegheleza mbuli zangu, wazavika mulungu mituhu na kuitumikila. Wantu wa Izilaeli na wantu wa Yuda wazabana kilagha naikacho na baba zawe. <verse eid="JER 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 11:11" />Kwa ivyoho ushe imi Zumbe Mulungu nitawashunda kuti, neniete vifa washidahavyo kuvinyiika. Hata wanikemee zeze, seniwategheleze. <verse eid="JER 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 11:12" />Aho nee ndiho wantu wa Yuda na wa Yelusalemu waite kweikemea mulungu yawe wayeokea ubani. Miya iyo mulungu yawe heidahe kuwaambiza mwe iyo mishi ya sungu. <verse eid="JER 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 11:13" />Wantu wa Yuda wana mulungu yeghenea sa mizi yawe ivyeghenea, waizengie kwa kulaviiza ntogoo kweghenea sa ziivyo sia za Yelusalemu, kangwe wamuokee ubani mulungu Baali mwegea usei. <verse eid="JER 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 11:14" />Ushe iwe Yelemia, ushewavikile awa wantu, ushewaiiye wala kunisigiiya kwa mbuli yawe, kwa kuti hata wakiniiya wai mwe sungu, seniwaambize.” <verse eid="JER 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 11:15" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, “Wantu niwekundisha hewadaha kuingila mwe nyumba yangu viikituka ni wahuza, mpaka wataghua nyama zilavighwezo kwa mbuli ya ntogoo za kuoka. Nikizawatoa newaniihiwe.” <verse eid="JER 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 11:16" />Zumbe amiitanga inywi mti wa mzaituni wena mahungo maishi, mzaituni mtana wevyaa matunda yedi, miya ushe, nizawaetea maya ya wankuu wawe kunga waikale sa kintu chihyeecho na kubanika.<verse eid="JER 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 11:17" />“Zumbe Mulungu mwena ufung'wa woshe amihandieye azamieka mubulwe ni ntogho, kwa kuti inywi wantu woshe wa Izilaeli na wa Yuda muzaghoshola mbuli mbada na kumkweza maya Zumbe Mulungu kwa kumuokea ubani Baali.”<verse eid="JER 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fanyanyi za kumkoma Yelemia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 11:18" />Zumbe Mulungu aanighambila fanyanyi zawe kwa kunionyesha ndicho wakighoshola, naimi nikazitaila. <verse eid="JER 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 11:19" />Nee ni mhozu sa ngoto yeighalwa kwechinjwa, sitaile kuti ubada wefanyanywa ni kwa mbuli yangu. Waghamba kuti, “Netiushenge mti hang'we na matunda yakwe, timkome auke mwe wantu wemoyo, ashefukilwe kale.”<verse eid="JER 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 11:20" />Nee nihevika, “Zumbe Mulungu mwena ufung'wa woshe, mwelaha kwa kweli, mweighanya myoyo na fanyanyi za wantu, uniambize nione uvyewazisa kihii, kwa kuti masa yangu nizayaeta kwako.”<verse eid="JER 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 11:21" />Kwa ivyoho, Zumbe Mulungu ana cha kulonga na wantu wa Anasosi wekunda kunikoma na watanighamba, “Usheteghanye kwa zina ja Zumbe Mulungu, tishezakukoma.” <verse eid="JER 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 11:22" />Zumbe Mulungu mwena ufung'wa woshe aghamba ivi, “Neniwalahe awo wantu! Wabwanga wawe newafiie kwe nkondo, wana wawe wa kibwanga na wa wakindee newafe kwa saa. <verse eid="JER 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 11:23" />Nizaika mshi wa kuwakoma wantu wa Anasosi, mshi uwo ukibula newafe woshe.”<verse eid="JER 11:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JER 12" />
  <para style="s">Yelemia atamuosa Zumbe Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 12:1" />“Zumbe Mulungu iwe u Mulungu ushinaye masa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:1">nikieta masa yangu kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:1">miya nikunda nikuuze kwa mbuli ya uvyelaha kwa ukweli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:1">kwai wahuza mbuli zawe zawaitila vitana?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:1">Kwai wena lufyo waaonea?<verse eid="JER 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 12:2" />Uzawahanda wohena wazalawa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:2">waakua na kuvyaa matunda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:2">Kia mshi waakuanga mwe vyanwa yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:2">miya myoyo yawe i hale na iwe.<verse eid="JER 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 12:3" />Miya iwe Zumbe Mulungu waanitaila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:3">waaniona na kuwelela fanyanyi zangu kwa mbuli yako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:3">Uwabuute wahuza sa ngoto zeighawa kwechinjwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:3">wagholokele mpaka mshi ya kufa kwawe ubule.<verse eid="JER 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 12:4" />Shanga neikasaghae mpaka ini</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:4">na kunyuuka kwa mani yoshe mwe mbuwa nekushie ini?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:4">Vizama na madeghe vitashiya kufa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:4">kwa mbuli ya uhuza wa wantu weikala mwe iyo shi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:4">wataghamba, ‘Zumbe Mulungu haona tivyeghoshola.’ ”<verse eid="JER 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 12:5" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:5">“Kati uzaeng'wa kuhimana na wejata kwa miundi wakakudaha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:5">neudahe zeze kuhimana na weghuuka kwa faashi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:5">Kati wakitoa hantu hashinaho kintu cha kukukinya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:5">neudahe zeze kughuuka kwe mashafi ya nkanda ya mto Yolidani?<verse eid="JER 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 12:6" />Wandughu wako na wantu wa mbuya yako, wazakuhituka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:6">wazavungana kunga wakuetee nkumbizi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:6">Ushewaamini, hata kati wakughambila mbuli zedi.”<verse eid="JER 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulungu ana maya kwa mbuli ya wantu wakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 12:7" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:7">“Nizatana na wantu ywangu wa Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:7">nizaiemela mbali ya wantu wangu nishaghuleyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:7">nizawainkia wantu ywangu niwekunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:7">wagholokewe ni wankuu wawe.<verse eid="JER 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 12:8" />Wantu ywangu nishaghulewo wazanihituka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:8">wazaituka sa shimba ze mzitui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:8">wazanigumiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:8">nee vyeleka naawaihiwa.<verse eid="JER 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 12:9" />Wantu ywangu nishaghulewo wazaituka sa kimpanga ama sa ngugwa watanitoa nkondo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:9">na madeghe matuhu yatewadenganyiza na kuwadomonya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:9">Waeke wantu wa mbali zoshe wakiunganye hang'we sa vizama vikai vya tundui</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:9">waize kwewakoma awa wantu niweitanga wantu wangu.<verse eid="JER 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 12:10" />Wagholokezi wangi wa kigheni wazabana ubuwa wangu wa mizabibu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:10">na wazazijatajata mbuwa zangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:10">na wazaighalusha ughongo shanga yangu yenitamila.<verse eid="JER 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 12:11" />Wazaieka bue,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:11">hekuna chochoshe cheozoka umo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:11">Shi ngima izaghaluka ughongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:11">kwa kuti hekuna mntu yoyoshe mweiwelela.<verse eid="JER 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 12:12" />Mwe vitui vya miima yoshe ye mwe ughongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:12">wankuu wazaiza kwetikoma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:12">Mundu jangu jaazinka kwebana wantu weikala mwe shi kia hantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:12">hekuna mweikala kwa nyemi.<verse eid="JER 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 12:13" />Wazahanda ngano miya newaonee mahosha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:13">wazakihima kughoshola ndima miya hewaonee kintu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:13">Kwa ivyoho mbeyu zawe hezitame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 12:13">kwa mbuli ya maya yangu.”<verse eid="JER 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya Zumbe Mulungu kwa wantu wehakana na shi ya Izilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 12:14" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, “Kwa mbuli ya wantu wabada wabanio shi niwainkileyo wantu wangu wa Izilaeli, neniwaushe wantu wa izo mbali mwe shi zawe sa mntu avyenkunta mbeyu, nee ndiho neniwalavye wantu wa Yuda kwawe kunga washegholokewe ni awo wantu wa izo mbali. <verse eid="JER 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 12:15" />Nikiwausha pee, neniwaivile mbazi vingi kia wantu neniiuze na hantu hawe na mwe shi zakwe. <verse eid="JER 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 12:16" />Sa via wawahinyizevyo wantu wangu kughoshola mlape kwa zina ja mulungu Baali, wakikihinya sia za wantu wangu kwa moyo woshe na kulapa kwa zina jangu wakighamba, ‘Sa Zumbe Mulungu avyeishi,’ nee ndiho waonee hang'we na wantu wangu. <verse eid="JER 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 12:17" />Miya mbali yoyoshe ishiniteghelezayo na kuniiva, neniiushe na kuibana vigima. Imi Zumbe Mulungu nizalonga.”<verse eid="JER 12:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JER 13" />
  <para style="s">Msipi wa shuke yeng'aa ubanikewo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 13:1" />Zumbe Mulungu aanighambila ivi, “Hita ukaghule msipi wa shuke yeng'aa, ukikante mwe kighwidi, miya usheugee mwe mazi.” <verse eid="JER 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 13:2" />Kwa ivyoho, nikaita kweghula uwo msipi wa shuke yeng'aa sa Zumbe Mulungu aniaghiizevyo, nikakikanta mwe kighwidi. <verse eid="JER 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 13:3" />Vikibinda, mbuli ya Zumbe Mulungu ikaniizia kambii ikighamba, <verse eid="JER 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 13:4" />“Ughue uwo msipi ughuliewo ukakikanta mwe kighwidi, uite Fulati ukaufishe uwo msipi mwe mpanga.” <verse eid="JER 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 13:5" />Kwa ivyoho, nikaita na kuufisha uwo msipi hehi na Fulati, sa Zumbe Mulungu anighambilevyo.<verse eid="JER 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 13:6" />Mishi mingi ihezinka, Zumbe Mulungu atenighambila kuti, “Hita Fulati, ukaughue uja msipi nakuaghiizayo ukaufishe uko. <verse eid="JER 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 13:7" />Nee niheita Fulati, nikafuka na kuulavya uja msipi haja hantu naufishaho. Niheulavya, uzabanika na heutama vingi.”<verse eid="JER 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 13:8" />Zumbe Mulungu akanighambila vingi, <verse eid="JER 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 13:9" />“Ichi uenecho mwe uwo msipi nee bontokeo ja kibui cha wantu wa Yuda na kibui kikulu cha wantu wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JER 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 13:10" />Awa wantu wahuza washikundawo kutegheleza mbuli zangu, miya watatongela utii we mwe myoyo yawe, wataita kwe mulungu mituhu kunga kuitumikila na kuivika, newaituke sa unu msipi ubanikewo. <verse eid="JER 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 13:11" />Sa via msipi uvyetozana na kighwidi cha mntu, nee nikishungilevyo wantu wa Izilaeli na wantu wa Yuda, kunga wataikane kwa zina jangu, wanitogole na kunigimbika, miya wo hewanitegheleze.” Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.<verse eid="JER 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfuko wa babu wakuinuia divai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 13:12" />Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu wa Izilaeli, aanighambia ivi, “Waghambile wantu wa Izilaeli kuti, kia mfuko wa babu neumeezwe divai. Miya ukizawaghambila ivyoho, wohe newakuhise ivi, ‘Ughambile ishwi hetitaila kuti kia mfuko wa babu ukundighwa umemeezwe divai?’ <verse eid="JER 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 13:13" />Nawe neuwaghambile kuti, Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, neniwainke divai wantu wosheni weikala mwe inu shi mpaka watengee, wazumbe wegholokela bumba ja Daudi, wavikizi na wateghanyi wangu na wantu woshe wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JER 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 13:14" />Neniwashonganye wenye kwa wenye, wana na waishe zawe. Seniwaeke, seniwaivile mbazi na kuwaushiiza miya neniwakome.”<verse eid="JER 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yelemia atawakanya wantu wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 13:15" />Teghelezai vitana inywi wantu wa Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 13:15">musheituke na mahiku, Zumbe Mulungu akilonga na inywi.<verse eid="JER 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 13:16" />Mgimbikei Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu wenyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 13:16">aishizati kumietea kiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 13:16">muishizati kukitoa miundi yenyu mwe miima yena kiza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 13:16">Inywi mualila langaila, miya ye neajighalusha kiza kikulu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 13:16">ndicho chimigee usoyoyo.<verse eid="JER 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 13:17" />Miya kati mukishenitegheleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 13:17">nenikemee mwe moyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 13:17">kwa kusheiva kwenyu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 13:17">Nenikeme kwa ukiwa na kuitikwa ni meshozi, kwa kuti wantu wa Zumbe Mulungu wazaighawa kwe utung'wa.<verse eid="JER 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 13:18" />Zumbe Mulungu akanighamba ivi, “Mghambile zumbe na nine yakwe, ‘Ukai mwe viti vyenyu vya uzumbe, kwa kuti linga zenyu ntana nezigwe mwe mitwi yawe.’ <verse eid="JER 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 13:19" />Mizi ya wazu wa kusini ya Yuda izadengwa ni wankuu, hekuna mwedaha kuwazinka na kuwabuiza weumo ndai ya iyo mizi. Wantu wosheni wa Yuda wazagwiwa, wazaighalwa na mwe shi ya ugheni.”<verse eid="JER 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 13:20" />Inuiya mesho yako iwe Yelusalemu uwelele! Wankuu wako waaiza kulawiya wazu wa kasikazini! Wakuhi wantu uinkighwewo uwawelele? Wabuzighwe ni mbwai waja wantu wa Yuda wakikombawo nawo? <verse eid="JER 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 13:21" />Neughambe zeze Zumbe Mulungu akizakuikia waja wantu ndiwo uihang'we nawo sa wambuya wako, wakizakudaha na kukugholokela? Ivi heukiive sa mvyee mwekishungua avyekiiva? <verse eid="JER 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 13:22" />Na iwe neukiuze mwe moyo wako kuti, “Kwai nizabulwa ni izi mbuli?” Zilawie kwa mbuli ya uhuza wako wiisizewo, nee vyeleka wankuu wako wazatatua shuke za wavyee wako, wakawakungumiza wagone nawo. <verse eid="JER 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 13:23" />Ivi mntu mwechuta aadaha kukihitua langi yakwe, hambu shui yaadaha kuhitua madoa yakwe? Vivyoivyo, inywi mutailewo kughoshola uhuza hemudahe kughoshola mbuli ntana. <verse eid="JER 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 13:24" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, nenimiasakanye sa mantu yeinuiwa ni mpeho kulawa kwe ughongo. <verse eid="JER 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 13:25" />Ivyo nee ndivyo vimilawiye, imi Zumbe Mulungu nifanyanye kumighoshoela ivyoho, kwa kuti muzanijaa imi mukaalila mulungu ya lufyo. <verse eid="JER 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 13:26" />Nenikuzue shuke yako mpaka mwe mtwi, uingiwe ni shoni. <verse eid="JER 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 13:27" />Nizaona ughoshola mbuli zeniihiza. Nizaona ukitongela mulungu ya kigheni mwe miima na mwe mbuwa, sa mvyee ashiye mkweli kwa muume. Chenyu ndicho inywi wantu wa Yelusalemu! Nemughoshole izi mbuli mpaka ini?<verse eid="JER 13:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JER 14" />
  <para style="s">Kukasaghaa kuisiizeko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 14:1" />Izi nee mbuli Zumbe Mulungu anighambilazo imi Yelemia kwa mbuli za kukasaghaa,<verse eid="JER 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 14:2" />“Wantu wa Yuda watasininika</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:2">na mizi yakwe itabanika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:2">wantu wakwe watadongooka mwe shanga kwa ukiwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:2">na nkoo za wantu wa Yelusalemu zizaisiiza.<verse eid="JER 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 14:3" />Wena kiiko watawaaghiiza wandima wawe mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:3">wandima wataita kwe vishima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:3">miya hewaonea mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:3">watauza maigha yawe bue.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:3">Wataingiwa ni wogha na kufighwa ni myoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:3">wataghubika mitwi yawe.<verse eid="JER 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 14:4" />Shanga izaatuka, kwa kuti fua heigwee, waimi watagea mbazi na wataghubika mitwi yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:4">kwa ivyo shanga ikaaghalevyo.<verse eid="JER 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 14:5" />Mpee zitanyiika madondwe yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:5">kwa kuti hekuna mani.<verse eid="JER 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 14:6" />Mpunda za mzitui zitagholoka mwe vitui vikazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:6">zitahemezuka sa mbweha kwa kushoa hewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:6">mesho yawe heyaona vitana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:6">kwa kushoa mani.<verse eid="JER 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 14:7" />Wantu wangu wataniiya wakighamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:7">‘Hang'we na kuti uhuza yweshu waatilaha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:7">iwe Zumbe Mulungu taaombeza utiambize sa utighambilevyo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:7">Tizaisiiza kukuhituka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:7">tizakughoshoela uhuza.<verse eid="JER 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 14:8" />Ni weyo du kialilo cha Waizilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:8">umvunizi yweshu mwe mishi ya ntogho.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:8">Kwai u sa mgheni mwe shi yeshu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:8">sa mntambo mweonda gono ja kio king'we?<verse eid="JER 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 14:9" />Uituke zeze sa mntu mwemashwa ni mbuli ashialileyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:9">hambu sa mghojo ashidahae kuvunia mntu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:9">Miya iwe Zumbe Mulungu uhang'we na ishwi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:9">Ishwi ti wantu lwako, ushetieke.’ ”<verse eid="JER 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 14:10" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi kwa mbuli ya awa wantu, “Kweli waakundisha kuikala hale na imi, hewafanyanya. Kwa ivyoho hewanitamila imi Zumbe Mulungu. Nenifukile mbuli zawe mbada na kuwatoa kwa mbuli ya uhuza wawe.”<verse eid="JER 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 14:11" />Zumbe Mulungu aanighambila ivi, “Ushewaombezeze awa wantu uwambizi. <verse eid="JER 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 14:12" />Hata wakifunga, senitegheleze mviko wawe, wakinilaviiza ntogoo za kuoka na ntogoo za mbeyu, senizihokele. Miya neniwakome kwa uhamba, saa na kwa matamu.”<verse eid="JER 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 14:13" />Nee niheghamba, “Zumbe Mulungu mwena ufung'wa woshe, waataila kuti wateghanyi watawaghambila awa wantu kuti, hekuituke na nkondo wala saa, kwa kuti uzaika kilagha kuti, mwe shi yeshu nekuituke na mpolele du.”<verse eid="JER 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 14:14" />Zumbe Mulungu akanighambila, “Awo wateghanyi walonga lufyo kwa zina jangu. Imi siwashaghule, silongie nawo wala siwaghiize. Wateghanya mbuli za lufyo na ughanga ushiambizawo chochoshe na mbuli zeanduka mwe fanyanyi zawe wenye. <verse eid="JER 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 14:15" />Ushe, imi Zumbe Mulungu naghamba ivi, ‘Kwa mbuli ya awo wateghanyi weteghanya lufyo kwa zina jangu, kwa kuti siwaaghiize, miya wo wataghamba kuti hekulawiye nkondo na saa mwe inu shi, neniwakome kwa mundu na saa. <verse eid="JER 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 14:16" />Na awo wantu wateghanyiizwewo izo mbuli, newaashighwe na se mwe baabaa za Yelusalemu wakiituka waifiie kwa saa na kwa nkondo, hekuituke na mntu wa kuwazika wo wenye, wavyee wawe na wana wawe wa kibwanga na wa kindee, kwa kuti imi neniwaihiize kwa mbuli ya uhuza wawe wenye.’ ”<verse eid="JER 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 14:17" />Zumbe Mulungu aanighamba niwaghambile wantu kwa mbuli ya usoyoyo niwena nawo kwawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:17">“Nenga mesho yangu yateikiza meshozi kio na mshii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:17">yasheeke kulawa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:17">kwa kuti wantu ywangu wazaisiiza kuumizwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:17">wazabulwa ni maonda makulu.<verse eid="JER 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 14:18" />Nikiita nkoi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:18">niona mii ya wantu wafiiewo kwe nkondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:18">nikiingila mwe mizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:18">niona watafa kwa saa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:18">Wateghanyi na wavikizi wawelela mbuli zawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:18">hewataila wacheghoshola.”<verse eid="JER 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu watamuombeza Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 14:19" />Zumbe Mulungu, utewaemela vigima wantu wa Yuda?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:19">Ivi wawaihiwa wantu wa Yelusalemu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:19">Kwai uzatiumiza ivihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:19">mpaka vionda vitaema kuhona?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:19">Tialile nyemi, miya hetionee mbuli ntana yoyoshe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:19">tialile kuhona, miya tihee du kugewa wogha.<verse eid="JER 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 14:20" />Kweli tizakughoshoela uhuza iwe Zumbe Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:20">taavoteka kwa mbuli ya ubada weshu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:20">na masa ya baba zeshu.<verse eid="JER 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 14:21" />Ushetieke kwa mbuli ya ishima yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:21">usheubee mzi wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:21">hambu nee kiti chako cha uzumbe chiiho.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:21">Ushebane kilagha chako waikacho na ishwi.<verse eid="JER 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 14:22" />Ivi mulungu ya lufyo ya mbali ntuhu yaadaha kutietea fua?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:22">Ivi zunde jaadaha kusheeza madodwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:22">Doo! Ni weyo ike du Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu yweshu, tiyekualila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 14:22">kwa kuti ni weyo mweghoshola izi mbuli zoshe.<verse eid="JER 14:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JER 15" />
  <para style="s">Mlaho kwa wantu wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 15:1" />Nee Zumbe Mulungu akanighambila, “Hata kati Msa na Samwei wangeiza kweniombeza, ningeshewaivila mbazi awa wantu. Waushe mwe mesho yangu waite zawe. <verse eid="JER 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 15:2" />Wakikuuza, ‘Tite hii ushe?’ Uwaghambe kuti, Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:2">Wekundwa kufa kwa matamu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:2">newafe kwa matamu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:2">Wekundwa kufa kwa uhamba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:2">newafe kwa uhamba!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:2">Wekundwa kufa kwa saa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:2">newafe kwa saa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:2">Wekundwa kuighawa na mwe shi ya ugheni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:2">newaighawe.<verse eid="JER 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 15:3" />Imi Zumbe Mulungu nizaamua kuwaetea ntogho za mbali ne ndizo ziwalawiye, newafe kwa nkondo, mii yawe neibuutwe ni makui, kudomonywa ni madeghe ya uko ulanga na kujighwa ni vizama vya tundui. <verse eid="JER 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 15:4" />Neniwaghalushe waituke wantu weihiwa ni wantu wa zumbe zosheni za shi, kwa mbuli aghosholeyo Manase ng'wana wa Hezekia zumbe wa Yuda uko Yelusalemu.”<verse eid="JER 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 15:5" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:5">“Nemuoneewe mbazi ni ndai inywi wantu wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:5">na nemukemeewe ni ndai?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:5">Neuvuiwe ni ndai?<verse eid="JER 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 15:6" />Inywi muzaniemela imi Zumbe Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:6">kia mshi mutahimba kunihituka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:6">Ushe, nenimikome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:6">nizatibuka kumiivila mbazi.<verse eid="JER 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 15:7" />Mwe kia mzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:7">nenimihete sa mahaagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:7">nenimikome inywi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:7">na kukoma wana wenyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:7">kwa kuti hemwaekile mbuli zenyu mbada.<verse eid="JER 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 15:8" />Neniwaeke wavyee wangi wafiiwe ni waghoshi wawe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:8">kuzinka shanga ye mwe bahai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:8">Neniwakome wabwanga wenyu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:8">na kuwagea wanine zawe ukiwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:8">Neniwaeke wabulwe ni ukiwa na wogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:8">kwa kumaka.<verse eid="JER 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 15:9" />Mvyee afiiweye ni wana mfungate neazimie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:9">neahese moyo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:9">Zua jakwe nejigongooke kuike mshii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:9">neagewe shoni na kushekwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:9">Na waja wemoyo washighalewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:9">neniwaeke wakong'we ni wankuu wawe kwa hamba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 15:9">Imi Zumbe Mulungu, nizalonga.”<verse eid="JER 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yelemia atamkaaiza Zumbe Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 15:10" />Changu ndicho! Kwai mnaa aazanivyaa? Nizaituka mntu wa nkumbizi na kuheekuana na kia mntu mwe inu shi. Sina nikopesheye wala sikopeshwe, miya kia mntu atanilaha. <verse eid="JER 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 15:11" />Zumbe Mulungu akaghamba, nenikuambize kunga uonee mbuli ntana, shuti niwaeke wankuu wako wakuombeze uwambizi mwe mishi ya ntogho na sungu. <verse eid="JER 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 15:12" />Ivi kuna mwedaha kubonda chuma cheandukia wazu wa kasikazini ama shaba?<verse eid="JER 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 15:13" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, “Neniete wankuu waghue mai zenyu na kiiko chenyu na hewamilihe kintu chochoshe kwa mbuli ya uhuza wenyu mughosholewo mwe shi ngima. <verse eid="JER 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 15:14" />Nenimighalushe watung'wa wa wankuu wenyu mwe shi mushitailayo, kwa kuti nizakweewa ni maya sa moto ushizimawo kale na kale.”<verse eid="JER 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 15:15" />Nami nee niheghamba, “Miya iwe Zumbe Mulungu waataila. Nifukila uniambize. Waihiize wankuu wangu. Usheisiize kuwaivila mbazi mpaka wakanikoma. Fukila kuti, nikankwa kwa mbuli yako. <verse eid="JER 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 15:16" />Naategheleza mbuli zosheni ulongiezo na imi. Izo mbuli zikaninka nyemi na mpolele mwe moyo wangu kwa kuti, imi ni wako iwe Zumbe Mulungu mwena ufung'wa woshe. <verse eid="JER 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 15:17" />Siikale hang'we na wantu weghoshola mbuli zewatamila wo wenye. Naikala ike du, kwa kuti ni weyo mwegholokela mbuli zosheni nizeghoshola. Naimi nikamemighwa ni maya yako. <verse eid="JER 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 15:18" />Kwai uzanieka niikale mwe sungu? Sitaila kuti kwai uzanieka nisungudike. Kwai vionda vyangu hevihona? Hambu ukunda unikome moyo sa shoko za mazi zenahwa mwe mishi ya zua?”<verse eid="JER 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 15:19" />Kwa ivyoho Zumbe Mulungu akahisa, “Ukivoteka nenikuuze uituke sa ndivyo uivyo aho boosi kunga unitumikile vingi. Waona walonga mbuli zena viugho na shiyo mbuli za udashi, nenikuitushe mntu mwelonga mbuli zangu. Awa wantu newakubashe iwe miya shiyo iwe mwewabasha. <verse eid="JER 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 15:20" />Nenikutogheshe sa ukando wa shaba mwe mesho ya awa wantu. Newatoane na iwe, miya hewakudahe, kwa kuti imi ni hang'we na iwe kunga nikuambize na kukuvunia. Imi Zumbe Mulungu nizalonga. <verse eid="JER 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 15:21" />Nenikuvunie mwe mikono ya wahuza na kukuusha mwe mikono ya wantu makatii.”<verse eid="JER 15:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JER 16" />
  <para style="s">Zumbe Mulungu avyekunda Yelemia aikale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 16:1" />Zumbe Mulungu atelonga na imi akighamba, <verse eid="JER 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 16:2" />“Iwe usheteghue wala kuonea wana aha hantu. <verse eid="JER 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 16:3" />Nenikughambile mbuli ndizo zilawiye kwa mbuli ya wana wa kibwanga na wa kindee ndiwo wavyaighwe aha hantu na kwa wavyazi wawe. <verse eid="JER 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 16:4" />Newafe kwa matamu yegea wogha, na hekuna ndiye awaghosholee ndiyo wala kuwazika. Maiti zawe neziasakane sa mantu mwe shi. Newafe kwa uhamba na kwa saa na maiti zawe neziituke nkande za madeghe ya uko ulanga na vizama vya tundui.”<verse eid="JER 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 16:5" />Zumbe Mulungu akaghambila vingi, “Ushezaingila mwe nyumba yena nkande za ndiyo. Usheite kwewakemea wala kuwaivila mbazi, kwa kuti nizausha mng'azo wangu wa mesho, ukundisho wangu na mbazi zangu kwa awa wantu. <verse eid="JER 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 16:6" />Wekidaha na wakiwa newafe mwe inu shi, miya hewazikwe wala kughoshoewa ndiyo. Hekuna mwekishengashenga wala kumoa kinoo kwa mbuli yawe. <verse eid="JER 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 16:7" />Hekuna mwewainka nkande za kuwagea moyo wala kuwainka vyanywa waja wafiiwewo hata kati wafiiwe ni waishe zawe ama wanine zawe.”<verse eid="JER 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 16:8" />Usheingile mwe nyumba yena mvigha. Usheikale nawo kunga uje na kuvata. <verse eid="JER 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 16:9" />Kwa kuti imi Zumbe Mulungu mwena ufung'wa woshe, Mulungu wa Izilaeli, naghamba ivi, “Neniushe vigima vuzo ja nyemi na kutamilwa hang'we na vuzo ja nteghuzi. Izi mbuli nezilawiye muimoyo, muiwelele kwa mesho yenyu.”<verse eid="JER 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 16:10" />“Ukizawaghambila awo wantu izi mbuli zosheni, newakuuze kuti, ‘Kwai Zumbe Mulungu azafanyanya kutietea ubada weinga aha? Tibaniei? Timghosholee uhuza ani Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu lweshu?’ <verse eid="JER 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 16:11" />Neuwahise kuti, ‘Vilawiye kwa kuti, baba zenyu waazanieka imi, wakatongela mulungu mituhu, wakaitumikila na kuivika. Watenieka wala hewategheleze vinyanyi vyangu. <verse eid="JER 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 16:12" />Miya inywi muzaisiiza kughoshola mbuli mbada kushima zia zaghosholwezo ni baba zenyu, kwa kuti kia mng'we wenyu atongela utii wa fanyanyi zakwe mbada, vingi hemunitegheleza. <verse eid="JER 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 16:13" />Kwa ivyoho, nenimihomele na mwe shi mushitailayo inywi na baba zenyu. Nemukatumikile mulungu mituhu uko na senimiivile mbazi.’ ”<verse eid="JER 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuuya kulawa mwe shi ya ugheni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 16:14" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, “Mishi yaaiza wantu hewalape vingi kwa zina jangu wakighamba, ‘Kweli sa avyeishi Zumbe Mulungu awalavizeye wantu wa Izilaeli mwe shi ya Misii.’ <verse eid="JER 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 16:15" />Miya newaghambe, ‘Sa avyeishi Zumbe Mulungu awalavizeye wantu wa Izilaeli mwe shi ye wazu wa kasikazini na mwe shi zosheni awaasakanyeko.’ Kwa kuti, neniwauze na mwe shi yawe nawainkayo baba zawe.”<verse eid="JER 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlaho wetongea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 16:16" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, “Miya ushe neniwaaghiize wankuu wangi waize kwewagwia wantu wa Yuda sa wantu wavyevuuwa mpeege. Vikibinda, neniwaaghiize wantu wangi waize kwewaingata. Newawasake sa weingata wavyesaka vizama mwe kia muima, mwe kia kitui na mwe mpanga. <verse eid="JER 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 16:17" />Kwa kuti imi naaona mbuli zosheni wazeghoshola, hekuna nishitailacho. Uhuza wawe woshe naautaila. <verse eid="JER 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 16:18" />Neniwazise kihii kaili kuzinka vivyekundwa kwa mbuli ya uhuza na ubanasi wawe, kwa kuti wazaieka shi yangu ishenitamile kwa mbuli ya mulungu yawe ifieyo yeniihiza wamemeezeyo mwe shi yangu.”<verse eid="JER 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yelemia ataombeza nguvu kwa Zumbe Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 16:19" />Zumbe Mulungu, iwe u nguvu zangu na ughojo wangu, nikualila iwe mwe mishi ya ntogho. Mbali zosheni neziize kwako zikighamba, “Baba zeshu nee waishina kintu kituhu kushima mulungu ya lufyo na vinyago vishiambizavyo. <verse eid="JER 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 16:20" />Wantu waadaha kukighoshoela mulungu yawe wenye? Doo! Kati wazaghoshola ivyoho, utaile kuti uyo shiyo Mulungu.”<verse eid="JER 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 16:21" />Zumbe Mulungu akahisa, “Kwa ivyoho, neniwahinye wataile nguvu zangu na ufung'wa wangu. Newataile kuti imi ni Mulungu.”<verse eid="JER 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JER 17" />
  <para style="s">Uhuza na mlaho kwa wantu wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 17:1" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, “Inywi wantu wa Yuda uhuza wenyu ni kintu chemwe maisha yenyu, sa via mntu azigondieye mwe myoyo yenyu na mwe mpembe za hantu halaviiza ntogoo sa via mntu avyeghua patasi ya chuma yena uhembo mgumu na kuzigonda mwe mawe. <verse eid="JER 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 17:2" />Hata wana wenyu waafukila hantu hawe hakulaviiza ntogoo na vigiingi vya mulungu wa kivyee mweitangwa Ashela viikighwevyo ulanga ya miti itivieyo na mwe vitui vya miima, <verse eid="JER 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 17:3" />na mwe miima ye mwe nyika. Neniwaeke wankuu wenyu waghue mai zenyu na kiiko chenyu choshe kwa mbuli ya uhuza wenyu mughosholewo mwe shi ngima. <verse eid="JER 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 17:4" />Nemuiyeke shi yenyu niminkileyo kwa mbuli ya ubada wenyu mughosholewo, nenimighalushe watung'wa kwa wankuu wenyu mwe shi mushitailayo, kwa kuti nizakwewa ni maya yashishiayo kale na kale.”<verse eid="JER 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vinyanyi mbaimbai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 17:5" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 17:5">“Ana ute uja mwemualila mntu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 17:5">mntu mwealila nguvu za mntu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 17:5">mntu mwenieka imi Zumbe Mulungu.<verse eid="JER 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 17:6" />Uyo ni sa shafi je mwe ughongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 17:6">heaone mbuli ntana zikilawiya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 17:6">Neaikale hantu hakazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 17:6">mwe shi yena munyu ishiikalwayo ni wantu.”<verse eid="JER 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 17:7" />“Miya nenimng'aze mesho mntu mwenialila imi Zumbe Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 17:7">mntu mwetaila kuti imi Zumbe Mulungu ike du ni miyo wakualilwa.<verse eid="JER 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 17:8" />Uyo mntu ni sa mti uhandighwewo hehi na mto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 17:8">weighaa mazindo yakwe na mwe mazi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 17:8">Mishi ya zua ikibula heuwogoha</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 17:8">na mahungo yakwe heyakaaghaa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 17:8">Heuwone wogha mwe vui jishinajo fua</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 17:8">na heuweke kuavya matunda.”<verse eid="JER 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 17:9" />“Moyo wa mntu una lufyo kushima vintu vyoshe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 17:9">ni mbada kuisiiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 17:9">ni ndai mwedaha kuutaila?<verse eid="JER 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 17:10" />Imi Zumbe Mulungu niwelela moyo wa mntu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 17:10">na kuzigea mwe mighezo fanyanyi za wantu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 17:10">na kumliha kia mng'we kuighana na avyeikala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 17:10">na avyeghoshola.”<verse eid="JER 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 17:11" />Mntu mwena mai ashiondiezo kwa ukweli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 17:11">ni sa nkwae yeangua matagi yataghighweyo ni ng'wiae.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 17:11">Nezezishiye du mwe mishi ya ubwanga wakwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 17:11">neaingiwe ni shoni kwa udashi wakwe.<verse eid="JER 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 17:12" />Kapee jeshu, ni sa kiti cha uzumbe chigimbikwecho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 17:12">chiikighwecho ulanga ya muima, kuanduka aho boosi.<verse eid="JER 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 17:13" />Zumbe Mulungu, mwealilwa ni Waizilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 17:13">wosheni wekuemela newaingiwe ni shoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 17:13">Waja wekueka iwe newaaghe sa mazina yagondighweyo mwe shanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 17:13">kwa kuti wazakueka iwe Zumbe Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 17:13">shoko za mazi ya ugima.<verse eid="JER 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yelemia ataombeza uwambizi kwa Zumbe Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 17:14" />Iwe Zumbe Mulungu, kesa unihonye nami nenihone, uniambize nami neniikale vitana, kwa kuti, nikugimbika iwe!<verse eid="JER 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 17:15" />Welela wantu wataniuza, “Zikuhi mbuli alongiezo Zumbe Mulungu? Eka du ushe zitibule!”<verse eid="JER 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 17:16" />Zumbe Mulungu, waanishaghula imi nighoshole ndima ya ulishi naimi siemee. Waataila kuti sakundie mshi wa ntogho uwawalawiye awa wantu wako. Iwe ng'wenye waataila mbuli nalongaeyo kwa wantu wako. <verse eid="JER 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 17:17" />Ushenigee wogha, kwa kuti nikualila iwe mwe mishi ya ntogho. <verse eid="JER 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 17:18" />Wagee shoni wankuu wangu, miya imi ushenieke niingiwe ni shoni. Awo wantu wabulwe ni wogha, miya imi ushenieke nibulwe wogha. Uwaetee mshi wa ntogho, wafe vigima.<verse eid="JER 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuufukila mshi wa kuhema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 17:19" />Zumbe Mulungu aanighamba ivi, “Hita ukagholoke mwe zuvi ja mzi wa Yelusalemu, waheingila na kulawiya wazumbe wa Yuda. Vingi ukagholoke kwe nyuvi ntuhu za mzi wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JER 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 17:20" />Waghambile, ‘Teghelezai mbuli ya Zumbe Mulungu inywi wazumbe wa Yuda na inywi wantu wa Yuda na wa Yelusalemu mweingila mwe iji zuvi. <verse eid="JER 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 17:21" />Kati mwaakunda ugima wenyu, mushezainua mzigho wowoshe mshi wa Sabato na mushezaaghiiza mzigho kuzinkia mwe zuvi ja mzi wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JER 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 17:22" />Mushelavye mzigho wowoshe mwe nyumba zenyu na musheghoshole ndima mshi wa kuhema. Muufukile mshi wa kuhema sa mshi wa kumvika Zumbe Mulungu du sa via nawaghambilavyo baba zenyu. <verse eid="JER 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 17:23" />Miya baba zenyu hewanitegheleze wala kuniiva, wakaemela kutegheleza na kughoshola mbuli nizewaghambila.’ ”<verse eid="JER 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 17:24" />“Miya mukinitegheleza imi Zumbe Mulungu, mukaeka kuzisa mizigho mwe nyuvi za unu mzi mshi wa kuhema na kueka kughoshola ndima, miya mukaughoshola uituke mshi wa kunivika imi du, <verse eid="JER 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 17:25" />nee ndiho wazumbe na wana wa wazumbe wemtongela zumbe Daudi mwe ufung'wa wakwe, hang'we na wantu wa Yuda na wantu wa Yelusalemu, newaingile kwa kuzinkia nyuvi za unu mzi, wakiituka waikwezie mwe faashi na mwe magai ya nkondo. Unu mzi hezeushiwe ni wantu. <verse eid="JER 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 17:26" />Wantu newaize kulawa mwe mizi ya Yuda na mwe mizi yehakana na mzi wa Yelusalemu, wakilawiya mwe shi ya Benjamini, na shi ya viima vye wazu zua jikwegongookea, shi ya miima na wazu wa kusini ya Yuda. Newaete ntogoo za kuoka na ntogoo za kughubikia uhuza, ntogoo za nkande na ubani wena mhempe mtana, hang'we na ntogoo za kutogola mwe nyumba ya Zumbe Mulungu. <verse eid="JER 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 17:27" />Miya mukishenitegheleza na kuughoshola mshi wa kuhema sa mshi wa kunivika imi du, mukisheeka kuinua mizigho na kuzinka nayo mwe nyuvi za mzi wa Yelusalemu mshi wa kuhema, kwa ivyoho, neniashe moto uwoke nyuvi zoshe za mzi wa Yelusalemu na mazumba yosheni ya kizumbe na hekuna ndiye auzime.”<verse eid="JER 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JER 18" />
  <para style="s">Yelemia mwe nyumba ya mweghoshola nyungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 18:1" />Zumbe Mulungu akanighambila kuti, <verse eid="JER 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 18:2" />“Yelemia, hita kwa mweghoshola vizungu, ukibula nenikughambile mbuli yangu.” <verse eid="JER 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 18:3" />Ushe, nikaita mpaka kwa mweghoshola nyungu, nikambuiza aaghoshola ndima yakwe he msehe. <verse eid="JER 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 18:4" />Vikaituka kuti, nyungu ayeghoshola ihebanika mwe mikono yakwe, ateighoshola nyungu ntuhu sa avyekunda ye ng'wenye.<verse eid="JER 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 18:5" />Nee Zumbe Mulungu ahenighambila, <verse eid="JER 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 18:6" />“Inywi wantu wa Izilaeli, ivi kweli imi Zumbe Mulungu sidaha kumighoshola sa uyu mweghoshola vizungu aghosholevyo?” Tailai kuti, “Sa shanga iivyo mwe mikono ya mweghoshola vizungu, nee muivyo inywi mwe mikono yangu. <verse eid="JER 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 18:7" />Nikiinua kanwa kwa mbuli ya mbali hambu uzumbe kuti neniuushe, neniukinye hambu kuubana, <verse eid="JER 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 18:8" />vikaituka kuti wantu wa iyo mbali wakavoteka na kueka uhuza wawe, senibontoe ija mbuli mbada nafanyanyayo kuwaghoshoela. <verse eid="JER 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 18:9" />Nikiinua vingi kanwa kwa mbuli ya mbali hambu uzumbe kuti neushimikwe na kuzengwa, <verse eid="JER 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 18:10" />vikaituka kuti iyo mbali ikaghoshola mbuli mbada mwe mesho yangu na kusheniiva, nenieke kuighoshoela mbuli ntana niwaghambilezo kuti neniwaghosholee.” <verse eid="JER 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 18:11" />Kwa ivyoho ushe, waghambile wantu wa shi ya Yuda na waja weikala mwe mzi wa Yelusalemu kuti, “Imi Zumbe Mulungu naghamba ivi, niifanyanye kumietea ntogho na nikunda nighoshole ivyoho. Kwa ivyoho, hitukai mueke mbuli zenyu mbada kwa kuhitua miikaile yenyu na mbuli zenyu muzeghoshola. <verse eid="JER 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 18:12" />Miya wo newaghambe, ‘Hevitiambize chochoshe. Keba tiwelele du mbuli zeshu na kia mng'we atongele utii wa moyo wakwe mbada.’ ”<verse eid="JER 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu watamuemela Zumbe Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 18:13" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 18:13">“Uza wantu mbali zoshe kuti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 18:13">ni ndai mwetaila kuiva mbuli sa inu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 18:13">Mbuli yegeza wogha izaghosholwa ni wantu ywangu wa Izilaeli!<verse eid="JER 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 18:14" />Kwani baafu ya Lebanoni yaataiya kusheoneka mwe makoongo yakwe ya mawe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 18:14">Ivi mazi yakwe yeota yelawiya kwe shoko za hale zaataila kuhwa?<verse eid="JER 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 18:15" />Miya wantu wangu imi wazanijaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 18:15">wataoka ubani kwa mulungu ya lufyo ishiwaambizayo chochoshe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 18:15">Iwaekileyo wakitoe mwe sia wazinkiiezo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 18:15">hewazinka vingi mwe sia zawe za boosi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 18:15">wazinka tundui.<verse eid="JER 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 18:16" />Shi yawe wazaieka izaituka kintu chegea wogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 18:16">neizomeewe kale na kale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 18:16">Kia mwezinka atamaka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 18:16">na kukucha mtwi.<verse eid="JER 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 18:17" />Neniwaasakanye kwa wankuu wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 18:17">sa mpeho yelawiya wazu zua jikwelawiya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 18:17">Neniwakande mghongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 18:17">seniwaambize uwo mshi wakizabulwa ni ntogho.”<verse eid="JER 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fanyanyi za kumkoma Yelemia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 18:18" />Vikibinda wantu wakaghamba, “Soi tiaghane kwa mbuli ya kumtoa nkondo Yelemia! Kwa kuti, hetishoe wavikizi wakutihinya, wena viugho wakutinka vinyanyi na wateghanyi wakubilikila mbuli ya Zumbe Mulungu. Soi timlahe kwa mbuli zakwe ng'wenye alongiezo na tishemtegheleze avyelonga.”<verse eid="JER 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 18:19" />Kwa ivyoho, nikavika ivi, “Zumbe Mulungu, naaombeza unitegheleze! Vingi tegheleza via wankuu wangu wavyelonga. <verse eid="JER 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 18:20" />Ivi mbuli ntana zilihwe kwa mbuli mbada? Miya wazanifukia tubwi kunga nigongooke na umo. Fukila naizavyo kwako nikalonga na iwe kwa mbuli yawe kunga usheituke na maya nawo. <verse eid="JER 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 18:21" />Kwa ivyoho, waeke wana wawe wafiie kwe nkondo kwa uhamba na kwa saa. Wavyee wawe wafiiwe ni waghoshi na wana wawe, waghoshi na wabwanga wawe wafe kwa uhamba kwe nkondo. <verse eid="JER 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 18:22" />Wankuu wakiingila mwe nyumba zawe, kuivikane nkoo, kwa kuti wainifukiie tubwi kunga nigongooke na umo, vingi waiikile mitegho mwe sia nizezinke kunga wanigwie. <verse eid="JER 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 18:23" />Miya iwe Zumbe Mulungu waazitaila fanyanyi zawe zoshe za kunikoma. Ushezawahokela kwa kuti wazaghoshola uhuza na uwo uhuza wawe ushezaujaa kale na kale. Waeke wagwe shi mwe mesho yako, uwalahe kwa maya yako.”<verse eid="JER 18:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JER 19" />
  <para style="s">Igha jituikejo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 19:1" />Zumbe Mulungu aanighamba ivi, niite kwa mweghoshola vizungu ukaghule igha. Vikibinda, ughue wagholokezi wagheke wa wantu na wagholokezi wa wavikizi, <verse eid="JER 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 19:2" />uite hang'we nawo kwe koongo ja ng'wana wa Hinomu kwa kuzinkia mwe zuvi ja vigae. Ukibula uko, neubiikie mbuli ndiyo nikughambile. <verse eid="JER 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 19:3" />Neughambe ivihi, “Teghelezai mbulingwa ya Zumbe Mulungu inywi wazumbe wa Yuda na wantu wa Yelusalemu. Zumbe Mulungu mwena ufung'wa woshe Mulungu wa Izilaeli aghamba ivi, neniete ntogho mwe unu mzi, na kia mweziiva neamake. <verse eid="JER 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 19:4" />Nenighoshole ivyoho kwa kuti, wantu wa Izilaeli wazanieka imi, vingi wazaeka nishehakunde aha hantu hambu wazaoka ubani kwa mulungu washitailayo wo wenye, baba zawe na wazumbe wa Yuda. Aha hantu wazahamemeeza mpome za wantu washinawo masa, <verse eid="JER 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 19:5" />vingi wazamzengea Baali kwe vitui hantu hakulaviiza ntogoo, kunga wawaoke wana wawe sa ntogoo ya kuoka. Imi sitaila kuwaghambila kuti waghoshole mbuli sa iyo, wala sitaila kuifanyanya. <verse eid="JER 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 19:6" />Kwa ivyoho ushe tailai kuti, mishi yaaiza aha hantu hehaitangwe vingi Tofesi, wala koongo ja ng'wana wa Hinomu, miya nehaitangwe Koongo ja Vifa. <verse eid="JER 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 19:7" />Na aha hantu nee ndiho nibanie fanyanyi za wantu wa Yuda na wa Yelusalemu. Neniwaeke wantu wawe watoighwe na kukong'wa ni wankuu wawe mwe nkondo. Maiti zawe nezidomonywe ni madeghe na kujighwa ni vizama vya tundui. <verse eid="JER 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 19:8" />Neniubane unu mzi na kuughalusha kintu cha kubewa, woshe wezinka hehi nawo newaumake kwa mbuli ya ntogho zilawiiyezo.”<verse eid="JER 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 19:9" />Wankuu newaudenge mzi na kugheza kukoma wantu weikala umo. Na awo wantu we umo mwe mzi newaingiwe ni saa mpaka waje nyama zawe wenye na kuja nyama za wana wawe wa kuwavyaa.<verse eid="JER 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 19:10" />Nee ndiho ujitue ijo igha mwe mesho ya awo wantu uitiewo nawo, <verse eid="JER 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 19:11" />na kuwaghambila kuti, imi Zumbe Mulungu mwena ufung'wa woshe naghamba ivi, “Neniwatoe awa wantu hang'we na unu mzi, wohena newaituke sa iji igha jituighwejo jishidahajo kuuyiana vingi. Wantu wafiewo newazikwe uko Tofesi, kwa kuti hekuituke na hantu hatuhu ha kuzikia. <verse eid="JER 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 19:12" />Ivi nee ndivyo niughoshole unu mzi wa Yelusalemu hang'we na wantu weikala umo sa via nighosholevyo Tofesi. <verse eid="JER 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 19:13" />Nyumba ze mwe mzi wa Yelusalemu na za wazumbe wa Yuda, hezitame kwa kunivika imi Zumbe Mulungu sa aha Tofesi. Nyumba zosheni waokeezo ubani kwa mbuli ya ntondwe za kwelwingu na kulavya ntogoo za vyanywa kwa mbuli mulungu mituhu.” <verse eid="JER 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 19:14" />Nee nihelawa Tofesi, hantu naaghizwaho ni Zumbe Mulungu nikabilikile mbuli yakwe. Vikibinda nikaita kwegholoka mwe chengo cha nyumba ya Zumbe Mulungu na kuwaghambila wantu wosheni weumo kuti, <verse eid="JER 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 19:15" />Zumbe Mulungu mwena ufung'wa woshe, Mulungu wa Izilaeli aghamba ivi, “Neniete ntogho zoshe naghambazo kuti neniziete mwe unu mzi hang'we na mizi yosheni yehekana na unu mzi, kwa kuti ni watii na hewakunda kunitegheleza nivyelonga.”<verse eid="JER 19:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JER 20" />
  <para style="s">Kuemana kwa Yelemia na mvikizi Pashuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 20:1" />Mvikizi Pashuli ng'wana wa Imeli, ndiye ai mgholokezi mkulu mwe nyumba ya Zumbe Mulungu, aamuiva Yelemia akilavya uteghanyi. <verse eid="JER 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 20:2" />Ushe, Pashuli akamtoa na kumtaha Yelemia hehi na zuvi ja Benjamini je ulanga ndijo jii mwe nyumba ya Zumbe Mulungu. <verse eid="JER 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 20:3" />Keloi hakwe wa makeo, Pashuli ahemdohoa Yelemia, nee Yelemia akamghamba Pashuli kuti, “Zumbe Mulungu heakuitange vingi Pashuli, miya neakuitange ‘Magoli misabibu’ yani ‘Wogha kia wazu.’ <verse eid="JER 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 20:4" />Kwa kuti Zumbe Mulungu ng'wenye aghamba ivi, ‘Welela, nenikughalushe ukigee wogha ng'wenye na kuwagea wogha wantu watuhu. Neuwaone kwa mesho yako wankuu wako wakikong'wa kwa uhamba kwe nkondo. Neniwainkiize wantu wosheni wa Yuda kwa zumbe wa Babeli, yohe neawagwie awaighale mpaka Babeli akawakome. <verse eid="JER 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 20:5" />Mai zawe zosheni ze mwe unu mzi hang'we na kiiko cha wazumbe wa Yuda, nenichiinkile kwa wankuu wawe wachiighale na uko Babeli. <verse eid="JER 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 20:6" />Na iwe Pashuli hang'we na wantu wa chengo chako, nemuighalwe na mwe shi ya Babeli kwe utung'wa. Neufe na kuzikwa ghuko, hang'we na mbuya yako yosheni uwateghanyizewo lufyo.’”<verse eid="JER 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yelemia atamkaaiza Zumbe Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 20:7" />Zumbe Mulungu, iwe utenilufya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:7">naimi nikaitikia lufyo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:7">Iwe waadaha kuiko imi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:7">na uzanidaha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:7">Kia mntu atanibea</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:7">mshi mgima watanisheka.<verse eid="JER 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 20:8" />Kwa kuti kia nihelongea nitabilikila</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:8">Nikibilikila ukatii na ubanasi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:8">Kwa ivyoho, mbuli ya Zumbe Mulungu izanietea ukanko</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:8">na kubewa mshi mgima. <verse eid="JER 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 20:9" />Kia nikighamba, senimuange vingi Zumbe Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:9">na senilonge kwa zina jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:9">mbuli yako itaaka sa moto mwe moyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:9">na mwe mavuha yangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:9">Nizatibuka kuuhoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:9">kwa kweli nizahewa.<verse eid="JER 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 20:10" />Naaiva wantu wangi waanomoneka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:10">“Wogha wangu u kia wazu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:10">Netitei tikamlahe, netitei!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:10">Hata weangu wataghojeeza nikine.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:10">Wataghamba, “Ngea neakunde timuufye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:10">Nee ndiho timgwie na kumuihiiza.”<verse eid="JER 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 20:11" />Miya iwe Zumbe Mulungu uhang'we naimi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:11">sa mghojo mwena nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:11">woshe washikundawo nionee newagwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:11">kwa kuti hewadahe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:11">newaingiwe ni shoni ya kale na kale.<verse eid="JER 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 20:12" />Zumbe Mulungu mwena ufung'wa woshe, iwe waawagheza wantu wakweli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:12">na waataila mbuli ze mwe myoyo na mwe akii za wantu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:12">Niambiza nione ukiwaihiiza wankuu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:12">kwa kuti nikualila iwe mwe masa yangu.<verse eid="JER 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 20:13" />Muimbilei Zumbe Mulungu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:13">Mtogolei Zumbe Mulungu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:13">Kwa kuti azamvunila mkiwa, kulawa mwe mikono ya wantu wahuza.<verse eid="JER 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 20:14" />Neulanwe mshi nivyaighwewo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:14">Mshi navyaighwawo usheng'azwe mesho!<verse eid="JER 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 20:15" />Nealanwe mntu amghambiaye tate mbuli ya kuvyaighwa kwangu kuti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:15">“Uzaonea ng'wana wa kibwanga,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:15">na kumueka akatamiwe.<verse eid="JER 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 20:16" />Neakong'we sa ija mizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:16">yakinywayo ni Zumbe Mulungu bia mbazi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:16">Makeo aive nkoo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:16">na mshii aive gunda ja nkondo,<verse eid="JER 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 20:17" />kwa kuti hanikomie mwe ifu ja mnaa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:17">Ifu ja mnaa jangaituka nee mbiya yangu, jingeituka kulu kale na kale.<verse eid="JER 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 20:18" />Kwai ushe naavyaighwa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:18">Navyaighwa nisungudike na kuona usoyoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 20:18">na kuingiwa ni shoni mishi yangu yoshe?<verse eid="JER 20:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JER 21" />
  <para style="s">Mzi wa Yelusalemu utaeng'wa nkondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 21:1" />Zumbe Mulungu aalonga vingi na Yelemia, mwe mshi Sedekia zumbe wa Yuda ahezamuaghiiza Pashuli ng'wana wa Malikia na mvikizi Sefania ng'wana wa Maaseya, wakamghambe Yelemia kuti, <verse eid="JER 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 21:2" />“Taaombeza utivikile kwa Zumbe Mulungu kwa kuti Nebukadineza, zumbe wa Babeli hang'we na waghojo wakwe, watatiandushiiza nkondo. Ngea Zumbe Mulungu neatiambize sa avyekatiambiza, Nebukadineza ashetietee nkondo atieke aite zakwe.”<verse eid="JER 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 21:3" />Yelemia akawaghamba, hitai mukamghambe Sedekia kuti, <verse eid="JER 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 21:4" />Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu wa Izilaeli, aghamba ivi, “Sedekia, siaha uzemtoea nkondo zumbe wa Babeli na waghojo wakwe wekutoa nkondo se ya ukando wa mzi neniziumbike hantu hang'we gatigati ya mzi wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JER 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 21:5" />Imi ng'wenye nenitoane na iwe kwa nguvu zangu zoshe na kwa maya yangu makai. <verse eid="JER 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 21:6" />Neniwakome weikala mwe unu mzi, wantu na vizama kwa utamu mbada. <verse eid="JER 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 21:7" />Vikibinda, nenimueke Sedekia zumbe wa Yuda hang'we na waambizi wakwe na wantu wa unu mzi washifiewo kwa utamu mabada, nkondo na saa, wagwiwe ni Nebukadineza zumbe wa Babeli na wankuu wawe wekunda kuwakoma. Newawakome woshe kwa uhamba na hewawaivile mbazi wala kuwategheleza. Imi Zumbe Mulungu nizalonga.”<verse eid="JER 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 21:8" />Vingi waghambile awa wantu kuti, “Ivi nee avyelonga Zumbe Mulungu, welela nitaika mwe mesho yenyu sia ya ugima na ya kifa. <verse eid="JER 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 21:9" />Mntu yoyoshe ndiye ashighae mwe unu mzi neafe kwa uhamba, kwa saa ama kwa utamu. Miya waja wekiighaa wenye wakagwiwe ni waghojo wa Babeli weutoa unu mzi, hewafe. <verse eid="JER 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 21:10" />Ivi nevilawiye kwa kuti, imi Zumbe Mulungu nizaufanyanyiiza unu mzi kuuwetea mbuli mbada na shiyo ntana. Nenimuambize zumbe wa Babeli kuughua unu mzi na kuuoka kwa moto.”<verse eid="JER 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu wa chengo cha uzumbe wa Yuda watalahwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 21:11" />Zumbe Mulungu akanighamba kuti, ushe waghambile wantu wa chengo cha uzumbe wa shi ya Yuda, kuti “Teghelezai avyelonga Zumbe Mulungu, <verse eid="JER 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 21:12" />inywi wantu wa chengo cha Daudi, wantu muwelaha kia mshi walahei kwa ukweli. Wavunilei waja wagwizighwewo ni wantu wena zuuma wekunda kuwahoka mai zawe. Mukisheghoshola ivyoho, nenikwewe ni maya makai sa moto na hekuna mwedaha kuyahoza kwa mbuli ya ubanasi wenyu mughosholewo. <verse eid="JER 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 21:13" />Imi si hang'we na inywi wantu wa Yelusalemu, mweikala mwe iji koongo uwanga ya makuungu. Inywi mweghamba kuti, ‘Ni ndai mwedaha kutitoa ishwi? Ni ndai mwedaha kuingila hantu hetu haghuukia?’ <verse eid="JER 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 21:14" />Nenimilahe kuighana na mbuli zenyu muzeghoshola. Nyumba yenyu ya kizumbe neniitoe moto, uwo moto neuoke kia kintu che umo. Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.”<verse eid="JER 21:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JER 22" />
  <para style="s">Mbuli ayelonga Yelemia kwa wantu wa chengo cha zumbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 22:1" />Zumbe Mulungu aanighamba niite mwe kitaa cha uzumbe wa Yuda, uwaghambile wantu inu mbuli, <verse eid="JER 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 22:2" />iwe zumbe wa Yuda mweikala mwe kiti cha uzumbe cha zumbe Daudi, hang'we na waambizi wako na wantu wako weingila kuzinkia mwe izi nyuvi, teghelezai mbuli alongilezo Zumbe Mulungu. <verse eid="JER 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 22:3" />“Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, lahai kwa ukweli na kwa utanda. Mvunilei mntu agwizighweye ni wabavi wekunda kumhoka mai zakwe. Mushewaghoshoee mbuli mbada ama ukatii mgheni, wana wafiiewo ni wavyazi wawe na wavyee wafiiwewo ni waghoshi wawe, vingi, mushezakoma wantu washinawo masa mwe unu mzi. <verse eid="JER 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 22:4" />Kwa kuti mukighoshola izi mbuli nimighambilezo kwa utanda, nee ndiho wavyawa wa Daudi newaendee kuituka wazumbe mwe inu shi. Wo na waambizi wawe hang'we na wantu wawe, newahimbe kuzinka mwe uvi wa zumba ja kizumbe wakiituka waikwezie mwe magai yebuutwa ni faashi na watuhu waikwezie faashi. <verse eid="JER 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 22:5" />Miya mukisheghoshola sa nimighambilevyo, imi Zumbe Mulungu nitalapa kulawa mwe moyo wangu kuti, iji zumba ja kizumbe nenijighalushe huzu.”<verse eid="JER 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 22:6" />Kwa mbuli ya zumba ja kizumbe ja zumbe wa Yuda, Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, “Hata kati umtana sa shi ya Gileadi na miima ya Lebanoni, nenikughalushe uituke ughongo, vingi sa mizi ishiikalwayo ni wantu. <verse eid="JER 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 22:7" />Neniete wankuu wabane iji zumba ja kizumbe. Newaize na machoka wazikee mpau zako ntana za miti ya mielezi na kuzihomea na kwe moto.<verse eid="JER 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 22:8" />“Vikibinda wantu wa mbali nyingi newazinke hehi na unu mzi na kuuzana kuti, ‘Kwai Zumbe Mulungu azaughoshola mbuli yeivihi mwe mzi mkulu sa unu?’ <verse eid="JER 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 22:9" />Wohe newahise kuti, ‘Aghoshole ivihi kwa kuti, wenyezi wa unu mzi watejaa shogha wajayo na Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu wawe, wakavika mulungu mituhu na kuitumikila.’ ”<verse eid="JER 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya Yelemia kwa Yehoahazi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 22:10" />Inywi wantu wa Yuda, mushemkemee zumbe Yosia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:10">wala mushemghosholee ndiyo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:10">Miya kemai kwa usoyoyo kwa mbuli ya Yehoahazi, ng'wanae,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:10">kwa kuti wazamghua na kumuighaa hale mwe shi ntuhu na heauye vingi kale na kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:10">wala haione vingi shi yakwe avyaighwako.<verse eid="JER 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 22:11" />Ivi nee alongavyo Zumbe Mulungu kwa mbuli ya ng'wanae ja zumbe Yosia, mweitangwa Yehoahazi, agholokeae hantu haishe Yosia, “Uyo azalawa mwe inu shi na kuita na mwe shi ya hale, hezeauye vingi kale na kale. <verse eid="JER 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 22:12" />Neafiiye hantu aighawaho kwe shi ya ugheni, heauye vingi kweiona shi yakwe.”<verse eid="JER 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya Yelemia kwa Yehoyakimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 22:13" />Chakwe ndicho yuja mwezenga kitaa chakwe cha uzumbe kwa sia ishimtamilayo Zumbe Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:13">na kuzenga vyumba vya dali kwa sia ya zuuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:13">mwewaghoshoeza ndima wantu wakwe awewagholokea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:13">bila kuwaliha chochoshe.<verse eid="JER 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 22:14" />Chakwe ndicho yuja mntu mweghamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:14">“Nenikizengee zumba kulu ja kizumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:14">jena vyumba vikulu uko ulanga kwe dali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:14">na kujiika madiisha yeghenea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:14">na ukando wakwe neniukontee mbao za hea nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:14">na kuzishisha langi yeunguika.”<verse eid="JER 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 22:15" />Ivi, ughambile kuti uituke zumbe kwa kuhimana kuzenga nyumba za mpau za miti ya mielezi ya hea nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:15">nyumba ntana kuiko zoshe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:15">Isho ako aikala maisha ya nyemi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:15">Nee ni mntu mtana na mkweli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:15">aho mbuli zakwe zikamuitia vitana.<verse eid="JER 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 22:16" />Aawavunia wakiwa na wekunda uwambizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:16">kwa ivyoho mbuli zakwe zosheni zikamuitila vitana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:16">Ivi ushe ivyoho se kumtaila Zumbe Mulungu?<verse eid="JER 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 22:17" />Miya mesho yako na moyo viwelela kuonea mai kwa sia za zuuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:17">waaitia mpome za wantu washinawo masa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:17">na kuwaghoshoela wantu zuuma na ukatii.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:17">Imi Zumbe Mulungu nizalonga.<verse eid="JER 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 22:18" />Kwa mbuli ya Yehoyakimu ng'wana wa Yosia, zumbe wa Yuda, imi Zumbe Mulungu naghamba ivi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:18">“Akizafa, heaonee mwemkemea akighamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:18">‘Yetate naneei, yetate naneei! Nitendaze imieee!’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:18">Heaonee mwemuiya akighamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:18">‘Yetate naneei zumbe wangu azafa! Nigwia yahii imi ee?’<verse eid="JER 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 22:19" />Neazikwe bila ishima sa mpunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:19">neabuutwe na kuhomeewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:19">se ya nyuvi za Yelusalemu.”<verse eid="JER 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya vifa kwa mzi wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 22:20" />Inywi wantu wa Yelusalemu, hitai mpaka Lebanoni mukabiikie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:20">kemai uko kwe shi ya Bashani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:20">tuai vuzo kulawa mwe miima ya shi ya Moabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:20">kwa kuti mbali zoshe zemiambiza mwe nkondo zizahewa.<verse eid="JER 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 22:21" />Zumbe Mulungu aalonga na inywi ija mishi muheituka muionee,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:21">miya inywi mukaemela kumtegheleza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:21">Ivi nee mughosholevyo kuanduka mui wabwanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:21">Hemwamtegheleze Zumbe Mulungu avyelonga.<verse eid="JER 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 22:22" />Wagholokezi wenyu woshe newahomewe hale ni mpeho.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:22">Na mbali zemiambiza mwe nkondo nezighuighwe na kuighalwa mwe shi ya ugheni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:22">Nee ndiho muingiwe ni shoni na kuona usoyoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:22">kwa mbuli ya ubanasi wenyu mughosholewo.<verse eid="JER 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 22:23" />Inywi wantu woshe mweikala Lebanoni, inywi mweikala vitana mwe nyumba za miti ya mielezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:23">welela ndivyo mukeme mukizatozighwa ni sungu ziisizezo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:23">mishango sa uja wa mvyele mwekishungua.<verse eid="JER 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlaho wa Zumbe Mulungu kwa Konia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 22:24" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, kwa mbuli ya Konia zumbe wa Yuda, ng'wana wa Yehoyakimu, “Nitalapa kuti, hata kati iwe Konia ng'wana wa Yehoyakimu, zumbe wa Yuda, ungeituka mpete yangu ya mkono wangu wa kuume yeonyesha ufung'wa wangu, nangakuusha du. <verse eid="JER 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 22:25" />Nenikueke ugwiwe ni wantu wekunda kukukoma, waja uweogoha, yani mwe mikono ya Nebukadineza, zumbe wa Babeli na mwe mikono ya Wakalidayo. <verse eid="JER 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 22:26" />Nenikukungumize iwe na nyokwe ako muighawe na shi ya kigheni. Nemuite mwe shi mushivyaaiweyo, nenywi nemufiie ghuko uko. <verse eid="JER 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 22:27" />Nemukunde kwei kuuya mwe shi yenyu, miya hemuuye vingi.”<verse eid="JER 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 22:28" />Mntu mng'we akaghamba, “Ivi, uyu zumbe Yehoyakimu azaghaluka nyungu ituikeyo, yebewa na kuashighwa se? Kwai ye na wanae wazaashighwa hale mwe shi washitailayo hata?”<verse eid="JER 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 22:29" />Wantu wa inu shi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:29">Teghelezai vitana mbuli ya Zumbe Mulungu,<verse eid="JER 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 22:30" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:30">“Mteilei uyu mntu sa mntu ashinae wana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:30">mntu ambaye hezeaonee mwe mishi yakwe yoshe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:30">Kwa kuti, heaituke na kivyazi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:30">ndicho chigholokee shi ya Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 22:30">na kugholokea sa zumbe Daudi.”<verse eid="JER 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JER 23" />
  <para style="s">Kialilo cheiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 23:1" />Chawe ndicho wagholokezi weazaghanya ngoto zangu! Imi Zumbe Mulungu nizalonga. <verse eid="JER 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 23:2" />Ivi nee Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu wa Izilaeli avyelonga kwa mbuli ya wagholokezi wegholokea wantu wangu, “Inywi muzaziazaghanya ngoto zangu na kuzishaka, hemuziishize vitana. Kwa ivyoho, nenimitoe kwa mbuli ya uhuza wenyu mughosholewo.” Imi Zumbe Mulungu nizalonga. <verse eid="JER 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 23:3" />Vikibinda, neniunganyanye ngoto zangu zishighaezo mwe shi zosheni niziasakanyeko na kuziuza na mwe maisho yawe. Wohe newavyaane na kughenea. <verse eid="JER 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 23:4" />Neniwainke wantu wangu wagholokezi watuhu wakuwagholokea vitana, wohe hewaituke na wogha na futofuto na seniwatoe vingi, imi Zumbe Mulungu nizalonga.<verse eid="JER 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 23:5" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, “Welela mishi yaaiza nenimishaghuie zumbe mkweli kulawa mwe wavyawa wa Daudi. Uyo neagholokele sa zumbe kwa viugho, kwa utanda na kulaha kwa ukweli mwe shi ngima. <verse eid="JER 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 23:6" />Mwe mishi ya ugholokezi wakwe, Yuda neavuniiwe na Izilaeli neaikale kwa usaama. Yohe neaitangwe, ‘Zumbe Mulungu mvunizi wetu.’<verse eid="JER 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 23:7" />“Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, mishi yaaiza wantu hewalape vingi na kughamba, ‘Sa Zumbe Mulungu avyeishi awalavizeye Waizilaeli mwe shi ya Misii,’ <verse eid="JER 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 23:8" />miya newalape kwa kughamba, ‘Sa Zumbe Mulungu avyeishi awalavizeye na kuwawelela Waizilaeli kulawa mwe shi ya wazu wa kasikazini na kulawa mwe shi zosheni awaasakanyeko.’ Vikibinda, newaikale mwe shi yawe wenye.”<verse eid="JER 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wateghanyi wa lufyo</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 23:9" />Kwa mbuli ya awo wateghanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:9">moyo wangu uzaingiwa ni wogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:9">mavuha yangu yoshe yatazingiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:9">nizaituka sa mntu atengeeye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:9">mntu aisiizeye kunywa mpombe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:9">Kwa mbuli alongiezo Zumbe Mulungu.<verse eid="JER 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 23:10" />Shi imemie wantu washinawo ukweli kwa Zumbe Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:10">waikaa kwa kughoshola ubanasi na kughoshola mbuli zishikundighwazo kughoshoka mwe ugholokezi wawe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:10">Kwa mbuli ya ute wa Zumbe Mulungu wantu wa shi watasininika</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:10">na mani yakwe yazakaaghaa.<verse eid="JER 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 23:11" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:11">“Wateghanyi na wavikizi woshe, hewamuiva Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:11">ubanasi wawe nizauona mpaka mwe nyumba yangu ya mviko.<verse eid="JER 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 23:12" />Kwa ivyoho, sia zawe neziituke zaapaata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:12">newaghuushwe hale mwe kiza, na kukina ghuko uko.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:12">Neniwaetee vifa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:12">mwe vui ja kuwalaha jikizabula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:12">Imi Zumbe Mulungu nizalonga.<verse eid="JER 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 23:13" />Mwe wateghanyi wa Samalia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:13">nizaona mbuli yeniihiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:13">wateghanya kwa zina ja Baali</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:13">na kuwaaza wantu ywangu wa Izilaeli.<verse eid="JER 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 23:14" />Miya mwe wateghanyi wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:14">nizaona mbuli mbada yegea usei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:14">wavika mulungu mituhu na wadosa mbuli za lufyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:14">watawahimbia wantu waghoshole mbuli mbada</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:14">hekuna mweeka kughoshola ubanasi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:14">Kwangu woshe wazaituka sa wantu wa Sodoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:14">wantu wa Yelusalemu wazaituka sa wantu wa Gomola.<verse eid="JER 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 23:15" />“Kwa ivyoho imi Zumbe Mulungu mwena ufung'wa woshe naghamba ivi kwa mbuli ya wateghanyi wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:15">neniwainke nkande zenyeghea waje</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:15">na wavate mazi yena sumu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 23:15">kwa kuti, wazawaeka wantu woshe mwe shi washemuive Zumbe Mulungu.”<verse eid="JER 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 23:16" />Zumbe Mulungu mwena ufung'wa woshe aghamba ivi, “Mushetegheleze mbuli muzeghambiwa ni wateghanyi, waminka kialilo cha lufyo. Mbuli wazemighambila zilawa mwe fanyanyi zawe wenye, hezilawa kwangu imi Zumbe Mulungu. <verse eid="JER 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 23:17" />Watahimba kuwaghambila waja webea mbuli yangu imi Zumbe Mulungu, wakighamba, ‘Mbuli zenyu nezimiitile vitana.’ Na kumghambila kia mntu mtii mwetongela fanyanyi zakwe, ‘Hekulawiye mbuli yoyoshe mbada.’ ”<verse eid="JER 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 23:18" />Nikaghamba, “Mwe awo wateghanyi, hekuna mwetaila fanyanyi za sii za Zumbe Mulungu. Hekuna hata mng'we mwe awo wateghanyi aivaye mbuli ya Zumbe Mulungu, wala kufukila yaja yalongighweyo ni Zumbe Mulungu. <verse eid="JER 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 23:19" />Welela, maya ya Zumbe Mulungu ni sa kimbunga. Chishiekacho kupusa mwe mitwi wa wantu wahuza. <verse eid="JER 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 23:20" />Maya ya Zumbe Mulungu heyashie, mpaka abontoe mbuli afanyanyezo mwe moyo wakwe. Mwe mishi yeiza wantu wakwe newaitaile inu mbuli vigima.”<verse eid="JER 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 23:21" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, “Imi siwaaghiize awa wateghanyi, miya wo wakaituka na kiheehee wakaita, siwaghambile mbuli yoyoshe, miya wo wakateghanya. <verse eid="JER 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 23:22" />Kati watezitaila fanyanyi zangu za sii, wangebiikila mbuli zangu kwa wantu wangu, wangewahitua kulawa mwe sia zawe mbada na kueka mbuli mbada wazeghoshola.”<verse eid="JER 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 23:23" />“Imi ni Mulungu mwe hehi, shiyo Mulungu mwe hale. <verse eid="JER 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 23:24" />Ivi mntu aadaha kukifisha hantu nishemuone? Hemutaila kuti imi Zumbe Mulungu ni kia hantu, kwe lwingu na kwe shi? <verse eid="JER 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 23:25" />Nizaiva wateghanyi wavyelonga, awo weteghanya mbuli za lufyo kwa zina jangu. Wataghamba, nizawainka uteghanyi mwe sozi. <verse eid="JER 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 23:26" />Ivi, izo mbuli neziiituke mwe myoyo ya awo wateghanyi wa lufyo, weteghanya mbuli za lufyo kwa fanyanyi zawe mpaka ini? <verse eid="JER 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 23:27" />Wafanyanya kuti, kwa kushimoezana sozi zawe nekueke wantu wangu wanijae, sa baba zawe wanijaavyo wakamvika Baali. <verse eid="JER 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 23:28" />Mteghanyi aoshighweye, nealonge du kuti iyo ni sozi, miya mwena mbuli yangu, neailonge kwa ukweli. Kwa kuti mantu yaadaha kuighanywa na ngano. Imi Zumbe Mulungu nizalonga. <verse eid="JER 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 23:29" />Mbuli yangu ni sa moto, ni sa nyundo yetua mawe vibaebae. <verse eid="JER 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 23:30" />Kwa ivyoho, imi Zumbe Mulungu si hang'we na awo wateghanyi weteghanya mbuli zawe savia zangu. <verse eid="JER 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 23:31" />Ehe naghamba, imi Zumbe Mulungu si hang'we na wateghanyi weteghanya mbuli zawe wenye wakighamba, ‘Zumbe Mulungu azalonga.’ <verse eid="JER 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 23:32" />Imi si hang'we na waja wateghanyi wewaghambila wantu wangu mbuli zawe za lufyo, wakighamba kuti wazahokea mbuli zangu mwe sozi, lufyo jawe na kukikomba kwawe kushiwaambizako chochoshe kutawaaza wantu wangu. Imi saawaaghiize wala kuwaghamba waite, kwa ivyoho, mbuli wazeghoshola awa wantu shiyo zedi kwa wantu woshe.”<verse eid="JER 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mzigho wa Zumbe Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 23:33" />Zumbe Mulungu aanighambila, “Yelemia, mntu yoyoshe, aituke mteghanyi ama mvikizi wakiuza kuti, ‘Mzigho wa Zumbe Mulungu ni mbwai?’ Iwe neuwahise, ‘Ni nywio mzigho wa Zumbe Mulungu, yohe neamiashe na hale.’ <verse eid="JER 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 23:34" />Vingi mteghanyi ama mvikizi ama mntu yoyoshe ndiye aghambe, ‘Unu ni mzigho wa Zumbe Mulungu,’ nenimtoe ye hang'we na wantu wa chengo chakwe. <verse eid="JER 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 23:35" />Mbuli muyekundwa kughoshola ni kuuzana inywi wenye kuti, ‘Ivi, Zumbe Mulungu atihisize mbwai?’ Hambu, ‘Zumbe Mulungu alongie mbwai?’ <verse eid="JER 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 23:36" />Miya mushelonge vingi kuti, ‘Unu ni mzigho tiinkighwewo ni Zumbe Mulungu.’ Kia mntu achelonga chitaituka ni mzigho kwakwe ng'wenye. Kwa kuti, mutahitua mbuli za Zumbe Mulungu mwena ugima, Zumbe Mulungu mwena nguvu zoshe, Mulungu wetu. <verse eid="JER 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 23:37" />Yelemia, muuze mteghanyi kuti, ‘Zumbe Mulungu akuihisize mbwai? Hambu Zumbe Mulungu aghambieze?’ <verse eid="JER 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 23:38" />Kati hemunitegheleze imi na mukaghamba, ‘Unu ni mzigho wa Zumbe Mulungu,’ na imi naamiemeza kughoshola ivyoho, aho nee ndiho <verse eid="JER 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 23:39" />imi neniwainue na kuwaasha hae na mesho yangu, wo wenye hang'we na mzi nawainkawo wo na baba zawe. <verse eid="JER 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 23:40" />Neniwaetee shoni na kubewa kae na kae ndiko kushejaighwe.”<verse eid="JER 23:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JER 24" />
  <para style="s">Vitezu viili vya tini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 24:1" />Baada ya Nebukadineza zumbe wa Babeli kuwashamiza Yehoyakini ng'wana wa Yehoyakimu zumbe wa Yuda, hang'we na wagholokezi, wezenga na wekonta chuma wa Yuda waheushighwa Yelusalemu na kuwaighawa Babeli, Zumbe Mulungu akanietea inu sozi, nikaona vitezu viili vya tini viikighwevyo mbele ya nyumba ya Zumbe Mulungu. <verse eid="JER 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 24:2" />Kitezu king'we nee chiina tini zetama, sa tini za boosi kushung'wa. Miya kitezu kituhu nee chiina tini zivundiezo zishitamazo kwa kuja. <verse eid="JER 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 24:3" />Nee Zumbe Mulungu aheniosa, “Yelemia, uona mbwai?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 24:3">Nikamhisa, “Niona tini ntana kwei zetama, na zia zivundiezo zishitamazo kujighwa.”<verse eid="JER 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 24:4" />Vikibinda Zumbe Mulungu akanighamba, <verse eid="JER 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 24:5" />“Imi Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu wa Izilaeli naghamba ivi, sa izi tini ziivyo ntana, nee ndivyo niwaone wantu wa Yuda kuti ni watana nawaavyawo aha hantu na kuwaighaa mwe shi ya Wakalidayo. <verse eid="JER 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 24:6" />Neniwalinde kae na kae na kuwauza mwe inu shi. Neniwazenge, wala seniwabomoe, neniwashimike wala seniwaeke. <verse eid="JER 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 24:7" />Neniwainke moyo wa kutaila kuti imi ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu. Nee ndiho waituke wantu wangu na imi niituke Mulungu wawe, kwa kuti newaniuiye kwa miyoyo yawe yoshe.”<verse eid="JER 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 24:8" />“Miya imi Zumbe Mulungu naghamba, sa ziya tini zivundiezo zishitamazo kujighwa, nee ndivyo nimghoshoee zumbe Sedekia wa Yuda na waambizi wakwe hang'we na wantu woshe watuhu wa Yelusalemu washighaewo umo mwe shi, hang'we na waja washamiawo mwe shi ya Misii. <verse eid="JER 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 24:9" />Neniwaetee ntogho ndizo ziwaeke wantu wa mbali zoshe waingiwe ni wogha. Newaituke kioja, newazomeewe na kushekwa na kushweewa ute kia hantu ndiho niwaasakanye. <verse eid="JER 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 24:10" />Wohe neniwaetee nkondo, saa na matamu mabada mpaka wafe asheshighae hata mng'we wawe mwe shi nawainkayo wo na baba zawe.”<verse eid="JER 24:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="JER 25" />
  <para style="s">Mnkuu mweandukia wazu wa kasikazini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 25:1" />Mwe ng'waka wa ne wa ugholokezi wa zumbe Yehoyakimu ng'wana wa Yosia zumbe wa Yuda, Zumbe Mulungu aaninka mbuli kwa mbuli ya wantu wa Yuda. Uwo nee ni ng'waka wa waboosi wa ugholokezi wa Nebukadineza zumbe wa Babeli. <verse eid="JER 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 25:2" />Imi Yelemia naawaghambila iyo mbuli wantu wosheni wa Yuda na wantu wa Yelusalemu, nikighamba, <verse eid="JER 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 25:3" />“Kwa mavui miongo mii na ntatu, kuvokea ng'waka wa muongo mng'we na ntatu wa ugholokezi wa Yosia ng'wana wa Amoni, zumbe wa Yuda, mpaka ivi lelo, nizaituka nikiiva mbuli ya Mulungu na kuwaghambila kia mshi, miya inywi hemunitegheleze. <verse eid="JER 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 25:4" />Hang'we na kuti Zumbe Mulungu aamietea watung'wa wakwe wateghanyi kia mshi, miya inywi hemuniivie wala hemunitegheleza. <verse eid="JER 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 25:5" />Nee wakamighambila kuti, kia mntu aeke sia zakwe mbada na mbuli mbada azeghoshola, kunga mudahe kuikala mwe shi muinkighweyo ni Zumbe Mulungu inywi na baba zenyu kale na kale. <verse eid="JER 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 25:6" />Zumbe Mulungu aamikanya musheitongele mulungu mituhu na kuivika na kumuihiza kwa kuvika vinyago mukighosholeeyo wenye. Kati mungemuiva Zumbe Mulungu angeshemitoa. <verse eid="JER 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 25:7" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba, inywi mwaaemela kunitegheleza imi, vikibinda mukanikweza maya kwa kuvika mulungu mukighosholeeyo wenye, kwa ivyoho mukakietea ntogho inywi wenye.”<verse eid="JER 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 25:8" />Zumbe Mulungu mwena nguvu zoshe naghamba ivi, “Kwa kuti hemwategheleze mbuli yangu, <verse eid="JER 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 25:9" />neniete wantu kulawa wazu wa kasikazini hang'we na mgholokezi wangu Nebukadineza, zumbe wa Babeli. Waitoe inu shi na wantu wakwe weikala umo hang'we na mbali zosheni ze hehi. Neniwakome vigima na kuighalusha kintu cheihiza na cha kuzomeewa na cha kubewa kale na kale. <verse eid="JER 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 25:10" />Hekuivikane sauti za nyemi, sauti ya mweteghulwa na mweteghua. Sauti ya mawe ya kusaghia heziivikane wala langaila ja vijai hejioneke vingi. <verse eid="JER 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 25:11" />Shi ngima neighalushwe mahuzu yegea wogha na kushetama kwa chochoshe, vingi izi shi nezighoshole ndima kwa zumbe wa Babeli kwa mavui muongo mfungate. <verse eid="JER 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 25:12" />Vikibinda ayo mavui muongo mfungate yakishia nenimtoe zumbe wa Babeli hang'we na wantu we mwe iyo shi. Nenibane iyo shi ya Wakalidayo kwa mbuli ya ubanasi wawe na kuighoshola iyo shi iituke mahuzu kale na kale. <verse eid="JER 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 25:13" />Neniitoe iyo shi ya Babeli kwa ntogho zoshe nilongiezo kuti neniwaghoshole savia zigondighwevyo mwe iji gondwe kuighana na uteghanyi wa Yelemia kwa mbali zosheni. <verse eid="JER 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 25:14" />Neniihize nkuu kwa wantu wa Babeli kwa mbuli ya via waghosholevyo. Mbali nyingi, nkulu na ndodo neziwaghalushe wantu wa Babeli watung'wa.”<verse eid="JER 25:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlaho wa Zumbe Mulungu kwa mbali zoshe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 25:15" />Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu wa Izilaeli, aanighamba kuti, “Ghua ichi kikombe cha divai che mwe mkono wangu cheonyesha maya yangu, uwainke wantu wa mbali zoshe ndizo nikuaghiize kwawe wanywe. <verse eid="JER 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 25:16" />Wakinywa du newakukutike na kukwewa ni maya kwa mbuli ya vifa ndivyo vilawiye kwawe.”<verse eid="JER 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 25:17" />Kwa ivyoho nikaghua icho kikombe mwe mkono wa Zumbe Mulungu, nikawainka wantu wa mbali zosheni niaghiizwezo ni Zumbe Mulungu kunga wanywe. <verse eid="JER 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 25:18" />Izi nee mbali naziinkazo kikombe cha divai zinywe, yani Yelusalemu na mizi yosheni ya Yuda, wazumbe wakwe na waambizi wawe, na kuighalusha iyo mizi iituke mahuzu na kintu cha kuihiza na kuzomeewa na kushweewa ute sa viivyo mpaka ivi lelo.<verse eid="JER 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 25:19" />Vikibinda nikamnka icho kikombe, Falao zumbe wa Misii, waambizi wakwe, hang'we na wantu wakwe wosheni, <verse eid="JER 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 25:20" />wagheni woshe weikala mwe shi ya Misii, wazumbe wosheni wa shi ya Uzi, wazumbe wosheni wa mizi ya Wafilisiti, yani Ashikeloni, Gaza, Ekiloni na washighalewo uko Ashidodi, <verse eid="JER 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 25:21" />na shi ya Edomu, Moabu na Amoni, <verse eid="JER 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 25:22" />wazumbe wosheni wa Tilo na Sidoni, wazumbe wa shi ze sheja ya bahai ya Meditelania, <verse eid="JER 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 25:23" />wantu wa shi Dedani, Tema, Buzi na wantu wosheni wemoa denge, <verse eid="JER 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 25:24" />wazumbe woshe wa Alabuni, wazumbe wosheni wa mbali ntuhu zeikala mwe ughongo, <verse eid="JER 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 25:25" />wazumbe wosheni wa shi za Zimli, Elamu na Wamedi, <verse eid="JER 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 25:26" />wazumbe wosheni wa wazu wa kasikazini, we hehi na we hale, wosheni newanywe, yani uzumbe wosheni we mwe shi. Wosheni wakibindiiza, zumbe wa Sheshaki yohe neanywe.<verse eid="JER 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 25:27" />Vikibinda Zumbe Mulungu akanighamba, “Neuwaghambe kuti, imi Zumbe Mulungu mwena nguvu zoshe, Mulungu wa Izilaeli, naghamba ivi, nywai mutengee na kutahika, mugwe muhewe kuinuka vingi, kwa mbuli ya vifa ndivyo niete kwenyu. <verse eid="JER 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 25:28" />Miya kati wakiemela kuchihokea icho kikombe che mwe mikono yako na kunywa, iwe neuwaghambe kuti, Zumbe Mulungu mwena nguvu zoshe naghamba ivi, shuti munywe. <verse eid="JER 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 25:29" />Welela, nitaandusha ushe kueta ntogho mwe mzi weitaikana kwa zina jangu. Ivi mufanyanya kuti hemutoighwe? Nemutoighwe du, kwa kuti neniete nkondo kwa mbuli ya wantu wosheni we mwe shi. Imi Zumbe Mulungu nena nguvu zoshe nizalonga.”<verse eid="JER 25:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 25:30" />“Iwe Yelemia uwaukuiye izi mbuli kwa kughamba ivi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 25:30">Zumbe Mulungu neagumie sa shimba kulawa kwe lwingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 25:30">neagumie sa ubambaa kulawa hantu haulanga kwe lwingu aiko Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 25:30">Neawagumie kwa nguvu kuwavaiya wantu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 25:30">na neagumiie sa mntu mwekoota zabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 25:30">kia mntu neamuive.<verse eid="JER 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 25:31" />Ivyo vishindo neviivikane mpaka miisho ya shi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 25:31">kwa kuti Zumbe Mulungu neazilahe mbali zosheni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 25:31">Neawalahe wantu wosheni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 25:31">na kuwakoma wahuza wosheni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 25:31">Imi Zumbe Mulungu nizalonga.”<verse eid="JER 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 25:32" />Zumbe Mulungu mwena nguvu zoshe aghamba ivi, welela nekulawiye ntogho mwe mbali ng'wenga baada ya ntuhu, na maya ya Zumbe Mulungu yataisiiza sa kimbunga chivyepusiia kulawa shi ikweheea. <verse eid="JER 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 25:33" />Mwe uwo mshi, wakomighwewo ni Zumbe Mulungu newaasakane kulawa wazu mng'we wa shi mpaka wazu mtuhu. Hekuituke na mntu mwewasininikia, mwe waunganyanya wala kuwazika, miya newaituke sa mantu mwe shanga.<verse eid="JER 25:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 25:34" />Sininikai inywi wagholokezi wa wantu wangu, kemai na kusaghana mwe mazeu inywi wagholokezi, mishi ya kuchinjwa kwenyu na kuasakanywa izabula, nemuchinjwe sa ngoto ya ngoshi nemukine na kutuika sa ntanu za shanga. <verse eid="JER 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 25:35" />Wagholokezi hewaituke na hantu hakughuukia, wala wakulu wa wantu hewadahe kunyiika. <verse eid="JER 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 25:36" />Teghelezai viiyo vya wagholokezi na vuzo ja wakulu wa wantu, kwa kuti Zumbe Mulungu azazibana shi zawe zikaituka mahuzu. <verse eid="JER 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 25:37" />Mahemelo yawe matana azayabana kwa mbuli ya maya makai ya Zumbe Mulungu. <verse eid="JER 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 25:38" />Zumbe Mulungu azawaeka wantu wakwe, sa via shimba ivyeleka mpanga yakwe, kwa mbuli ya nkondo na maya makai ya Zumbe Mulungu shi yawe izaituka ukiwa na kimaka.<verse eid="JER 25:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="JER 26" />
  <para style="s">Yelemia atalahwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 26:1" />Mwe mishi ya ugholokezi wa Yehoyakimu ng'wana wa Yosia, zumbe wa Yuda, Zumbe Mulungu aanighamba kuti, <verse eid="JER 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 26:2" />“Yelemia, hita ukagholoke mwe nyumba yangu, ukawaghambile wantu woshe weiza kwevika umo mbuli zosheni nikuaghiizezo ushezashighaza mbuli hata ng'wenga. <verse eid="JER 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 26:3" />Wadaha wakategheleza na kueka sia zawe mbada. Vikibinda neniwaivile mbazi na kueka kuwaetea ntogho nikundiezo kuwaetea kwa mbuli zawe mbada waghosholayo.”<verse eid="JER 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 26:4" />Uwaghambe kuti, “Zumbe Mulungu aghamba, mukishenitegheleza na kughoshola sa via nimihinyievyo, <verse eid="JER 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 26:5" />kati hemutegheleze mbuli zelongwa ni wateghanyi wangu niwewaaghiiza kwenyu kia mshi, na hemuwategheleze na hemughoshole sa wamighambilevyo, <verse eid="JER 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 26:6" />nee ndiho niibane inu nyumba sa via nibanievyo mzi wa Shilo, na mbali zoshe nezione kuti unu mzi wa Yelusalemu una ute.”<verse eid="JER 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 26:7" />Wavikizi, wateghanyi na wantu woshe wakamtegheleza Yelemia ahelongo izo mbuli mwe nyumba ya Zumbe Mulungu. <verse eid="JER 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 26:8" />Ushe Yelemia ahebinda kulonga mbuli zoshe Zumbe Mulungu amuaghiizezo, wavikizi na wateghanyi na wantu woshe wakamgwia na kutua vuzo wakighamba, “Ukundighwa ukong'we! <verse eid="JER 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 26:9" />Kwai uzateghanya kwa zina ja Zumbe Mulungu ukighamba, inu nyumba ya Zumbe Mulungu neibanighwe sa Shilo na unu mzi neubanighwe hekuna mntu ndiye aikale umo?” Wantu woshe wakamdenga Yelemia. <verse eid="JER 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 26:10" />Ushe, wagholokezi wakulu wa Yuda waheziiva izo mbuli, wakalawa mwe kitaa cha zumbe, wakaita mpaka mwe nyumba ya Zumbe Mulungu, wakaikala mwe zuvi hya jakuingiiya mwe nyumba ya Zumbe Mulungu. <verse eid="JER 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 26:11" />Vikibinda wavikizi na wateghanyi wakawaghambila wagholokezi na wantu woshe, “Uyu mntu akundigwa akong'we, kwa kuti azaulonga vibada unu mzi, samuivievyo kwa magutwi yenyu.”<verse eid="JER 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 26:12" />Nee Yelemia akawaghamba waja wagholokezi wakulu hang'we na wantu woshe kuti, “Zumbe Mulungu ateniaghiiza niteghanye mbuli mbada ndizo ziibule inu nyumba na unu mzi sa muivilevyo nihelonga. <verse eid="JER 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 26:13" />Ivi ushe, votekai mueke mbuli zenyu mbada na kumuiva Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu wenyu. Mukighoshola mbuli ntana Zumbe Mulungu haamietee ntogho. <verse eid="JER 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 26:14" />Miya kwa mbuli yangu, imi ni mwe mikono yenyu, nighosholai muvyeona kuti ni vitana na chaafaa mwe mesho yenyu. <verse eid="JER 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 26:15" />Miya mutaile kuti mukinikoma, mutekiinka wenye ute kwa kukoma mtu ashinaye masa. Kwa kuti, ni kweli Zumbe Mulungu nee anighiizeye kwenyu nimishunde.” <verse eid="JER 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 26:16" />Wagholokezi na wantu wosheni wakawaghambila wavikizi na wateghanyi, “Uyu mntu hakundigwa kukong'wa, kwa kuti alongie na ishwi kwa zina ja Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu wetu.” <verse eid="JER 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 26:17" />Waghundu wagheke wa shi wakagholoka wakawaghambila wantu wosheni wadughanewo, wakawaghambila kuti, <verse eid="JER 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 26:18" />“Mishi iyo Hezekia ai zumbe wa Yuda, mteghanyi Mika wa Moleshesi, akawaghambila wantu woshe kuti Zumbe Mulungu mwena nguvu zoshe aghamba ivi, ‘Mzi wa Sayuni newiimighwe sa ubuwa, mzi wa Yelusalemu neughalushwe kiugha cha shanga, na muima wa nyumba ya Zumbe Mulungu newiituke mzitu.’ <verse eid="JER 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 26:19" />Ivi, Hezekia zumbe wa Yuda na wantu wosheni wa Yuda waamkoma Mika? Doo! Ivi, Hezekia hamuivile Zumbe Mulungu na kuombeza mbazi zakwe? Zumbe Mulungu akaeka kuwaetea ntogho. Miya ishwi titakietea ntogho wenye.”<verse eid="JER 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 26:20" />Nee kuina mntu mtuhu vingi ateghanyaye kwa zina ja Zumbe Mulungu. Uyo mtu nee akiitangwa Ulia ng'wana wa Shemaya, kulawa mzi wa Kiliasi Yealimu. Ye ateghanya mbuli mbada ndizo ziubule unu mzi na inu shi sa Yelemia aghosholevyo. <verse eid="JER 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 26:21" />Zumbe Yehoyakimu hang'we na waghojo wakwe na wagholokezi woshe waheiva mbuli alongiezo Ulia, zumbe akakunda kumkoma Ulia. Miya Ulia aheiiva iyo mbuli akaingiwa ni wogha, akanyiika, akaita na mwe shi ya Misii. <verse eid="JER 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 26:22" />Zumbe Yehoyakimu akamuighaa Elinasani ng'wana wa Akiboli, hang'we na wantu wangahi du waite Misii wakamgwie Ulia. <verse eid="JER 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 26:23" />Waamuuza Ulia kulawa mwe shi ya Misii, wakamuighala kwa zumbe Yehoyakimu. Zumbe Yehoyakimu akamkoma Ulia kwa uhamba ng'wii wakwe ukaashighwa mwe hantu hena mbiya za wantu wa washitaikanawo kunga uzikwe. <verse eid="JER 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 26:24" />Kwa kuti Yelemia nee akiambizwa ni Ahikamu ng'wana wa Shefani kwa ivyoho hagwizighwe vingi kunga akong'we.<verse eid="JER 26:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="JER 27" />
  <para style="s">Yelemia ataghangwa akishunge kigongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 27:1" />Mwe andukio ja ugholokezi wa Sedekia ng'wana wa Yosia, zumbe wa Yuda, mbuli kulawa kwa Zumbe Mulungu ikamuizila Yelemia. <verse eid="JER 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 27:2" />Zumbe Mulungu aanighambila ivi, “Shongola kigongo uchishunge mwe shingo yako kwa ughoe wa babu. <verse eid="JER 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 27:3" />Vikibinda, ighala inu mbuli kwa zumbe wa Edomu, zumbe wa Moabu, zumbe wa Amoni, zumbe wa Tilo na zumbe wa Sidoni, kuzinkia kwa wajumbe waizilewo Yelusalemu kwemvuiya Sedekia zumbe wa Yuda. <verse eid="JER 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 27:4" />Uwaghambe awo wajumbe wawaghambile wazumbe wawe kuti, imi Zumbe Mulungu nena nguvu zoshe, Mulungu wa Izilaeli, naghamba ivi, <verse eid="JER 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 27:5" />ni miyo niumbieye ngulu, wantu na vizama vyeumo kwa kudaha kwangu na kwa nguvu zangu, na imi nimnka ivyo vintu mntu yoyoshe niyekunda. <verse eid="JER 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 27:6" />Kwa ivyoho nizamnka mtung'wa wangu Nebukadineza zumbe wa Babeli, izo shi zoshe vingi nizamnka vizama vya tundui vimtumikile. <verse eid="JER 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 27:7" />Wantu wa mbali zoshe newamtumikile ye, ng'wanae na ng'wezukuue, mpaka ndiho shi yakwe igwe. Vikibinda shi nyingi na wazumbe wangi newamghalushe mtung'wa wawe.”<verse eid="JER 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 27:8" />“Miya waona shi yoyoshe hambu uzumbe wowoshe ukiemela kumtumikila Nebukadineza, zumbe wa Babeli, neniitoe iyo shi kwa kuietea nkondo, saa na matamu mpaka niikome vigima kwa ufung'wa ndiwo nimnke. <verse eid="JER 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 27:9" />Kwa ivyoho mushewategheleze wateghanyi wenyu, watoa bao wenyu, watabii wenyu hambu washai wemighambila inywi kuti, ‘Hemumtumikile zumbe wa Babeli.’ <verse eid="JER 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 27:10" />Awo wamiteghanyiza mbuli za lufyo, mbuli ndiyo imieke muighawe hale na inu shi yenyu. Nenimighuushe na hale na nemufiie ghuko. <verse eid="JER 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 27:11" />Miya wantu wa mbali yoyoshe ndiwo wamuive zumbe wa Babeli na kumtumikila, neniwaeke waikale mwe shi yawe, waiime shanga yawe na kuikala umo.” Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.<verse eid="JER 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 27:12" />Imi Yelemia naamghambila Sedekia zumbe wa Yuda mbuli zizoizo. Namghamba kuti, “Muivei zumbe wa Babeli. Mtumikile ye na wantu wakwe, na iwe neuituke moyo. <verse eid="JER 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 27:13" />Kwai iwe na wantu wako mufiie kwe nkondo, kwa saa na kwa matamu? Kwa kuti ivyo nee Zumbe Mulungu alongavyo kwa mbuli ndizo ziwabule wantu wa shi yoyoshe ndiwo waemele kumtumikila zumbe wa Babeli. <verse eid="JER 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 27:14" />Mushetegheleze mbuli wateghanyi wazemighambila kuti, mushemtumikile zumbe wa Babeli, kwa kuti wamiteghanyiiza mbuli za lufyo. <verse eid="JER 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 27:15" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba kuti, ‘Imi siwaaghiize awo wateghanyi, miya wateghanya mbuli za lufyo kwa zina jangu. Kwa ivyoho neniwaghuushe na hale, na inywi nemufe hang'we na awo wateghanyi wemiteghanyiiza mbuli za lufyo.’ ”<verse eid="JER 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 27:16" />Vikibinda, nikawaghambila wavikizi na wantu woshe kuti, Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, “Mushewategheleze wateghanyi weteghanya kuti vivi ushe vintu vya nyumba ya Zumbe Mulungu neviuzighwe kulawa Babeli. Wamiteghanyiza mbuli za lufyo. <verse eid="JER 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 27:17" />Mushewategheleze! Mghosholeei ndima zumbe wa Babeli, nenywi nemuituke moyo. Kwai unu mzi uzezaituka mahuzu? <verse eid="JER 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 27:18" />Kati awo ni wateghanyi na wana mbuli ya Zumbe Mulungu, newamvike Zumbe Mulungu mwena nguvu zoshe, kunga vintu vishighalevyo mwe nyumba ya Zumbe Mulungu na mwe kitaa cha zumbe wa Yuda na mwe mzi wa Yelusalemu, visheghuighwe na kuighawa Babeli.”<verse eid="JER 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 27:19" />Kwa kuti ivi nee avyelonga Zumbe Mulungu mwena nguvu zoshe kwa mbuli ya mikowa, maigha yaghosholweyo kwa madini ya shaba, vinala na vintu vituhu viekighwevyo mwe unu mzi, <verse eid="JER 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 27:20" />vishighuighwevyo ni Nebukadineza, zumbe wa Babeli ahezawagwia Yehoyakini ng'wana wa Yehoyakimu, zumbe wa Yuda hang'we na wagholokezi woshe wa Yuda na wa Yelusalemu kulawa Yelusalemu na kuwaighala na mwe shi ya ugheni.<verse eid="JER 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 27:21" />Ivi nee avyelonga Zumbe Mulungu mwena nguvu zoshe, Mulungu wa Izilaeli, kwa mbuli ya vintu viekighwevyo mwe nyumba yakwe, mwe kitaa cha zumbe wa Yuda na mwe mzi wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JER 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 27:22" />“Ivyo vintu nevighuighwe viighawe Babeli, na neviituke uko mpaka mshi ndiwo nivikunde. Vikibinda neniviuze vingi na kuviika aha hantu.” Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongieye.<verse eid="JER 27:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="JER 28" />
  <para style="s">Hanania atateghanya mbuli za lufyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 28:1" />Uhebula ng'wezi wa shano wa vui jijo ijo ja ne ja ugholokezi wa Sedekia zumbe wa Yuda, mteghanyi Hanania ng'wana wa Azuli, mweandukia na mwe mzi wa Gibeoni, atelonga naimi mwe nyumba ya Zumbe Mulungu, haja wavikizi na wantu wosheni waihaho, akanighambila, <verse eid="JER 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 28:2" />Zumbe Mulungu mwena nguvu zoshe, Mulungu wa Izilaeli, aghamba ivi, “Neniushe ufung'wa wa zumbe wa Babeli ndiwo aimishungie nawo sa kigongo. <verse eid="JER 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 28:3" />Ndai ya mavui mei neniviuze aha vintu vyoshe vya nyumba yangu vyaghuighwavyo na kuighawa Babeli ni Nebukadineza, zumbe wa Babeli. <verse eid="JER 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 28:4" />Vingi nenimuuze Yehoyakini ng'wana wa Yehoyakimu zumbe wa Yuda, hang'we na wantu wosheni wa Yuda waighawewo Babeli. Neniushe ufung'wa amishungiewo nawo zumbe wa Babeli sa kigongo.” Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.<verse eid="JER 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 28:5" />Vikibinda, mteghanyi Yelemia akamhisa mteghanyi Hanania mwe mesho ya wavikizi na wantu wosheni ndiwo waigholoke mwe nyumba ya Zumbe Mulungu, <verse eid="JER 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 28:6" />akaghamba, “Neviituke ivyoho! Zumbe Mulungu naaghoshole ivyoho. Zumbe Mulungu naabontoe mbuli uteghanyezo kwa kuviuza aha vintu vya nyumba ya Zumbe Mulungu kulawa Babeli hang'we na wantu wosheni washamizwewo na uko. <verse eid="JER 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 28:7" />Miya tegheleza inu mbuli niyekughambila iwe na awa wantu woshe. <verse eid="JER 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 28:8" />Wateghanyi wa kale, waja wationgoeewo imi na iwe, wateghanya mbuli za nkondo, saa na matamu nezilawiye mwe shi nyingi na mwe zumbe nkulu. <verse eid="JER 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 28:9" />Miya mteghanyi mweteghanya mpolele, neataikane kuti kweli aaghiizwe ni Zumbe Mulungu, vikiituka zia mbuli azeteghanya zizalawiya.”<verse eid="JER 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 28:10" />Nee mteghanyi Hanania akachighua chia kigongo ndicho chiimwe shingo ya mteghanyi Yelemia, akachibonda. <verse eid="JER 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 28:11" />Vikibinda Hanania akaghamba ivi mwe mesho ya wantu woshe, “Zumbe Mulungu aghamba, ivi nee ndivyo nichibonde kigongo cha zumbe Nebukadineza aikilecho mwe shingo za wantu wa mbali zoshe, nenighoshole ivyoho mwe mavui mai yeiza.” Nee Yelemia aheuka.<verse eid="JER 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 28:12" />Mishi migheke ihezinka kuanduka mteghanyi Hanania ahechibonda chia kigongo ndicho chiimwe shingo ya mteghanyi Yelemia, Zumbe Mulungu atemghamba Yelemia, <verse eid="JER 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 28:13" />“Hita ukamghambile Hanania kuti, imi Zumbe Mulungu naghamba kuti, iwe uzabonda kigongo cha mti, miya neughoshole kituhu cha chuma. <verse eid="JER 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 28:14" />Imi Zumbe Mulungu nena nguvu zoshe, Mulungu wa Izilaeli, naghamba ivi, neniike kigongo cha chuma cha utung'wa mwe shingo za wantu wa mbali zoshe wamtumikile Nebukadineza zumbe wa Babeli, wohe newamghosholee ndima. Nenimnke mpaka vizama vya tundui avigholokele.”<verse eid="JER 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 28:15" />Vikibinda mteghanyi Yelemia akamghamba mteghanyi Hanania, “Hanania, tegheleza, Zumbe Mulungu hakuaghiize, miya iwe uzawaeka awa wantu watozeshe mbuli za lufyo. <verse eid="JER 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 28:16" />Kwa ivyoho Zumbe Mulungu aghamba neakuushe mwe shi. Mwe vui jiji iji neufe, kwa kuti uzawaghambila wantu wamhituke Zumbe Mulungu.”<verse eid="JER 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 28:17" />Mwe ng'wezi wa mfungate vui jiajia, mteghanyi Hanania akafa.<verse eid="JER 28:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="JER 29" />
  <para style="s">Baluwa ya Yelemia kwa Wayahudi we uko Babeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 29:1" />Inu nee baluwa mteghanyi Yelemia aighaayo kwa wagholokezi wa wantu, wavikizi, wateghanyi na kwa wantu woshe waghuighwawo ni Nebukadineza kulawa Yelusalemu akawaighala na uko Babeli. <verse eid="JER 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 29:2" />Yelemia agonda iyo baluwa haja zumbe Yehoyakini na nine akwe, wandima wa mahakama, wagholokezi wa Yuda na wa Yelusalemu, wafundi na weghoshola vyuma waheuka Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JER 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 29:3" />Inu baluwa yaighawa ni Elasa ng'wana wa Shafani, na Gemalia ng'wana wa Hilikia, watung'wawo ni Sedekia zumbe wa Yuda, waiighale kwa Nebukadineza zumbe wa Babeli. Iyo baluwa yagondwa ivi, <verse eid="JER 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 29:4" />“Zumbe Mulungu mwena nguvu zoshe, Mulungu wa Izilaeli, aghamba ivi kwa inywi nyoshe mughuighwewo kulawa Yelusalemu mukaighawa Babeli, <verse eid="JER 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 29:5" />‘Zengai mzi muikale. Imai mbuwa, handai mbeyu na kuja nkande zakwe. <verse eid="JER 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 29:6" />Ghuai wavyele, muvyae wana, waeteei wana wenyu wa kibwanga wavyele wawateghue na wandele wenyu waondeei waghoshi wawateghue wavyae wana wa kibwanga na wa kindele. Mughenee na musheituke wagheke. <verse eid="JER 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 29:7" />Ondezai mpolele na kuonea mwe mzi nimiighalewo muituke watung'wa. Nivikai kwa mbuli ya uwo mzi, kwa kuti ukitama nainywi nemutame. <verse eid="JER 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 29:8" />Imi Zumbe Mulungu nena nguvu zoshe, Mulungu wa Izilaeli, naghamba, mushekunde kuufighwa ni wateghanyi wenyu na watabii we hang'we na inywi, na mushetegheleze sozi wazeoshighwa. <verse eid="JER 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 29:9" />Kwa kuti wamiteghanyiiza inywi mbuli za lufyo kwa zina jangu. Imi siwaghiize.’ Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.<verse eid="JER 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 29:10" />“Ivi nee avyelonga Zumbe Mulungu, ‘Yakizinka mavui miongo mfungate uko Babeli, niniize na kubontoa kilagha changu cha kumiuza na aha hantu. <verse eid="JER 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 29:11" />Kwa kuti imi Zumbe Mulungu naataila fanyanyi nizena nazo kwa mbuli yenyu. Ni fanyanyi za kumieka mbuli zenyu zimiitile vitana na shiyo kumietea ntogho, kunga muituke na kialilo cha kuonea mwe mishi yeiza. <verse eid="JER 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 29:12" />Nee ndiho muniitange na kuiza kwenivika, naimi nenimitegheleze. <verse eid="JER 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 29:13" />Nemuniondeeze na kuniona, mukiniondeeza kwa myoyo yenyu yoshe. <verse eid="JER 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 29:14" />Nemunione, naimi nenimiuze kulawa mwe shi ya ugheni. Nenimiunganye kulawa mwe shi zoshe na kia hantu nimighuusheho naho. Nenimiuze na hantu nimiushizeho na kumiighala na mwe shi ya ugheni.’ ” Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.<verse eid="JER 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 29:15" />“Kwa kuti muzaghamba, Zumbe Mulungu azatietea wateghanyi kunu Babeli. <verse eid="JER 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 29:16" />Miya ivi nee avyelonga Zumbe Mulungu kwa mbuli ya zumbe mwegholokela uzumbe ndiwo ukigholokewa ni Daudi, na kwa mbuli ya wantu wosheni washighalewo mwe unu mzi yani wandughu wenyu washiitilewo hang'we na inywi mwe shi ya ugheni. <verse eid="JER 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 29:17" />Zumbe Mulungu mwena nguvu zoshe aghamba ivi, ‘Neniwaighaiye nkondo, saa na matamu, neniwaghalushe waituke sa tini zivundiezo zishitamazo kujighwa. <verse eid="JER 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 29:18" />Neniwaghuushe kwa nkondo, kwa saa na kwa matamu. Na nenimighalushe muituke kintu chegeza wogha kwe zumbe zoshe ze mwe shi na kuituka kintu chena ute, kintu cha kubewa na kuhazwa mwe shi zoshe ndizo nimighuushe nako. <verse eid="JER 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 29:19" />Nenighoshole ivyoho kwa kuti hemutegheleze mbuli zangu nimighambilezo kia mshi kuzinkia watung'wa wangu wateghanyi. Hang'we na inywi mweikala mwe shi ya ugheni hemutegheleze. Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo. <verse eid="JER 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 29:20" />Kwa ivyoho, niteghelezai imi Zumbe Mulungu inywi nyoshe nimilavizewo Yelusalemu nikamiighala Babeli.’ ”<verse eid="JER 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 29:21" />Zumbe Mulungu mwena nguvu zoshe, Mulungu wa Izilaeli aghamba ivi, “Kwa mbuli ya Ahabu ng'wana wa Kolaya, na Sedekia ng'wana wa Maaseya, wemiteghanyiiza inywi mbuli za lufyo kwa zina jangu, neniwagee mwe mikono ya Nebukadineza, zumbe wa Babeli, yohe neawakome muiwelele kwa mesho yenyu. <verse eid="JER 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 29:22" />Kwa mbuli ndiyo iwabule, wantu woshe washamizwewo kulawa Yelusalemu wakaighawa Babeli, wakikunda kulapa newaghambe, ‘Zumbe Mulungu akughosholee sa Sedekia na Ahabu, wakaswawo mwe moto ni zumbe wa Babeli wai moyo.’ <verse eid="JER 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 29:23" />Kwa kuti waghoshola mbuli mbada ziisizezo mwe shi ya Izilaeli. Wazaghoshola ukilanga na waka za wantu wawehakana nawo, na kulonga mbuli za mambeza kwa zina jangu, mbuli nishiwaaghiizeyo waighoshole. Izo mbuli imi naazitaila na naaziona.” Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.<verse eid="JER 29:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baluwa ya Shemaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 29:24" />Zumbe Mulungu aaniaghiiza nimghambile Shemaya mweandukia mwe mzi wa Nehelamu kuti, <verse eid="JER 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 29:25" />Zumbe Mulungu mwena nguvu zoshe, Mulungu wa Izilaeli, aghamba kuti, kwa kuti uzaighala baluwa kwa zina jako kwa wantu wosheni wa Yelusalemu na kwa mvikizi Sefania ng'wana wa Maaseya na kwa wavikizi watuhu woshe. Mwe iyo baluwa uzamghambila Sefania kuti, <verse eid="JER 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 29:26" />“Zumbe Mulungu azakushaghula iwe Sefania uituke mvikizi, ughue hantu ha mvikizi Yehoyada, uituke mgholokezi mkulu wa nyumba ya Zumbe Mulungu. Ndima yako neiituke ni kumzughaiya na kumshunga mpingu mkilalu yoyoshe mwekighoshola ye ni mteghanyi. <verse eid="JER 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 29:27" />Kwai ushe humhazize Yelemia mweandukia Anasosi mwemiteghanyiiza? <verse eid="JER 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 29:28" />Kwa kuti azatietea inu mbuli uko Babeli kuti, netiikale uko kwe shi ya ugheni kwa mishi mingi, kwa ivyoho tizenge nyumba tiikale ghuko, tiime mbuwa, tihande mbeyu na kuja nkande zakwe.”<verse eid="JER 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 29:29" />Mvikizi Sefania akamfyomea Yelemia iyo baluwa. <verse eid="JER 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 29:30" />Nee Zumbe Mulungu ahemghamba mteghanyi Yelemia, <verse eid="JER 29:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 29:31" />“Waighaiye inu mbuli wantu wosheni we mwe shi ya ugheni, imi Zumbe Mulungu naghamba ivi kwa mbuli ya Shemaya mweandukia mwe mzi wa Nehelamu amiteghanyizeye hang'we na kuti simuaghiize, akamieka mutozeshe mbuli za lufyo, <verse eid="JER 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 29:32" />imi Zumbe Mulungu naghamba, nenimtoe Shemaya mweandukia mwe mzi wa Nehelamu hang'we na wavyawa wakwe. Wosheni newafe, hewaone mbuli ntana ndizo niwaghosholee wantu wangu, kwa kuti azawaghambila wantu wanihituke.” Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.<verse eid="JER 29:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="JER 30" />
  <para style="s">Kilagha cha Zumbe Mulungu kwa wantu wakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 30:1" />Zumbe Mulungu aamnka Yelemia mbuli ntuhu akighamba, <verse eid="JER 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 30:2" />“Imi Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu wa Izilaeli naghamba ivi, gonda mbuli zosheni nikughambilezo mwe gondwe, <verse eid="JER 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 30:3" />kwa kuti mishi yaaiza ndiho niwauze wantu wangu wa Izilaeli na wa Yuda kulawa mwe shi ya ugheni, wauye na mwe shi nawainkayo baba zawe iituke yawe.” Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.<verse eid="JER 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 30:4" />Izi nee mbuli Zumbe Mulungu alongiezo kwa mbuli ya wantu wa Izilaeli na wa Yuda,<verse eid="JER 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 30:5" />Imi Zumbe Mulungu naghamba ivi, “Tizaiva nkoo zegea wogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:5">ni nkoo zegea futofuto na shiyo kwedi.<verse eid="JER 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 30:6" />Kiuzei ushe kunga mutaile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:6">ivi mghoshi aadaha kuvyaa ng'wana?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:6">Kwai ushe niona kia mghoshi mwena nguvu atekitoza kighwidi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:6">sa vinga ni mvyee mwena mishango ya kuvyaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:6">vingi watehinduka vyeni?<verse eid="JER 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 30:7" />Kweli uwo mushi newiituke waagea wogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:7">hezekulawiye mushi mutuhu sa uwo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:7">kwa kuti ni mushi wa ntogho kwa wavyawa wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:7">miya nezewavuniwe.”<verse eid="JER 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 30:8" />Zumbe Mulungu mwena nguvu zoshe aghamba ivi, “Uwo mushi ukizabula, nenibonde kigongo che mwe shingo zawe na kudwisha mpingu zawe, hezewaghalushwe vingi watung'wa ni wantu wagheni. <verse eid="JER 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 30:9" />Miya newanitumikile imi Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu wawe na zumbe ndiye niwashaghuiye mweandukia mwe wavyawa wa Daudi.”<verse eid="JER 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 30:10" />“Musheogohe inywi watung'wa wangu wavyawa wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:10">usheangwe ni moyo iwe Izilaeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:10">Kweli nemiuze kaya kulawa shi hale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:10">neniwauze wavyawa wako kulawa kwe shi ya ugheni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:10">Nemuuye muikale kwa mpolele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:10">na hekuna ndiye amigee wogha.<verse eid="JER 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 30:11" />Imi ni hang'we na iwe nikuvunie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:11">Hang'we na kuti mbali zosheni nenizikome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:11">uko kwawe nikuasakanyiizeko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:11">miya inywi senimikome.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:11">Nenimilahe kwa mbuli ya uhuza mughosholewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:11">senimieke bia kumilaha.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:11">Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.<verse eid="JER 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 30:12" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:12">“Vionda vyako hevina mzighi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:12">vingi heviaghuika.<verse eid="JER 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 30:13" />Hekuna mntu ndiye akuambize mwe masa yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:13">wantu waahona vionda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:13">miya iwe hekuna chedaha kukuhonya.<verse eid="JER 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 30:14" />Woshe wehang'we na iwe wazakujaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:14">hewakuwelela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:14">Nikutoiye sa via ambavyo wangatoighwa ni mnkuu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:14">utoighwe bia mbazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:14">kwa kuti masa yako ni makulu muno</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:14">na uhuza wako uzaisiiza.<verse eid="JER 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 30:15" />Kwai waakema kwa mbuli ya kionda chako?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:15">Kuuma kwako hekuhoa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:15">Nikughosholee ivyoho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:15">kwa kuti masa yako ni makulu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:15">na uhuza wako uzaisiiza.<verse eid="JER 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 30:16" />Miya wantu woshe wekukoma newakong'we,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:16">wankuu wako woshe newaighawe na kwe shi ya ugheni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:16">Woshe wekuhoka vintu vyako newahokwe vintu vyawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:16">woshe wekuingata newaingatwe.<verse eid="JER 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 30:17" />Miya nenikuuzize ugima wako</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:17">na kuhonya vionda vyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:17">kwa kuti uzaitangwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:17">‘Aashighweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:17">iwe mntu wa Sayuni hekuna mwekuwelela!’ ”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:17">Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.<verse eid="JER 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 30:18" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:18">“Neniwauze vingi wantu wa Izilaeli na mwe shi yawe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:18">na mizi yawe neniiivile mbazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:18">mzi wa Yelusalemu neuzengwe vingi ulanga ya mahuzu yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:18">na kitaa cha zumbe nechizengwe vingi haho ndiho chiiho.<verse eid="JER 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 30:19" />Wantu weikala uko newaimbe maimbo ya kutogola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:19">newatoe nkeeghee.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:19">Neniwaghenyeeze hewaituke wagheke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:19">newaheshimiwe miya hewabewe.<verse eid="JER 30:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 30:20" />Wana wawe newaituke sa haja kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:20">bumba jawe nenijitogheshe kunga wanivike mwe mesho yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:20">neniwatoe wosheni wewasungudisha.<verse eid="JER 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 30:21" />Mweawo mng'we wawe neaituke zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:21">mgholokezi neaandukie kwawe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:21">Nenimuete hehi na imi yohe neaituke hehi na imi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:21">ni ndai mwedaha kuiza hehi na imi niishimkongie?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:21">Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.<verse eid="JER 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 30:22" />Newaituke wantu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 30:22">naimi neniituke Mulungu wawe.”<verse eid="JER 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 30:23" />Welela maya ya Zumbe Mulungu yazakwea sa kilazoni chegeza wogha, neyabule wahuza mwe mitwi yawe. <verse eid="JER 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 30:24" />Maya makai ya Zumbe Mulungu heyahoe mpaka ndiho abontole chia afanyanyecho mwe moyo wakwe. Mishi yeiza nemuzitaile vitana izi mbuli.<verse eid="JER 30:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="JER 31" />
  <para style="s">Waizilaeli watauya kaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 31:1" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, “Mwe iyo mishi, neniituke Mulungu wa makolwa yoshe ya Izilaeli, wohe newaituke wantu wangu. <verse eid="JER 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 31:2" />Wantu washikomighwewo neniwaivile mbazi uko kwe ughongo. Neniize na kuwainka wantu wa Izilaeli hemelo.” <verse eid="JER 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 31:3" />Zumbe Mulungu aatilawiya aho kale akighamba, “Nizamikunda kwa lukundisho lwa kale na kale, kwa ivyoho nizahimba kuituka mkweli kwenyu. <verse eid="JER 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 31:4" />Nenikuzenge uhya na iwe neuzengeke, iwe Izilaeli mwenivika imi du. Neuzighue vingi ngoma zako uvine kwa nyemi. <verse eid="JER 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 31:5" />Neuhande vingi ubuwa wa mizabibu mwe vitui vya Samalia, waimi newahande mbeyu na kujitamiwa shumo jakwe. <verse eid="JER 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 31:6" />Mishi yaaiza waghojo newabilikile mwe vitui vya Efulaimu wakighamba, ‘Gholokai, tikwee Yelusalemu tikamvike Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu weshu.’ ”<verse eid="JER 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 31:7" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba kuti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:7">“Muimbilei Yakobo kwa nyemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:7">nitoeai nkeeghee imi mkulu wa shi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:7">Biikilai, togolai mukighamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:7">‘Iwe Zumbe Mulungu wavunie wantu wako wa Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:7">waja washikomighwewo.’<verse eid="JER 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 31:8" />Nenimiuze kulawa shi ya kasikazini</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:8">na kumiunganyanya kulawa mwe bontokelo ja shi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:8">Mwe awo wantu nekuituke na matuntu na viema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:8">wavyele wena nda na waja wekishungua,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:8">bumba ja wantu wangi nejiuye aha.<verse eid="JER 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 31:9" />Newauye kunu waakema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:9">newaituke waavika nikiwauza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:9">Neniwazise nkanda ya vikoongo vya mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:9">newazinke mwe sia ntana wohe hewakitoe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:9">Kwa kuti imi ni tate wa Izilaeli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:9">na Efulaimu ni mpaa yangu.”<verse eid="JER 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 31:10" />Imi Zumbe Mulungu naghamba ivi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:10">“Niteghelezai inywi wantu wa mbali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:10">biikiai mbuli zangu kwa wantu weikala shi za hale nkanda ya bahai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:10">awaasakanyeye Waizilaeli neawaunganyanye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:10">neawawelele sa mulishi avyewelela ngoto zakwe.<verse eid="JER 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 31:11" />Imi Zumbe Mulungu nizamuambiza Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:11">nimvunile kulawa kwa wantu wena nguvu kuiko ye.<verse eid="JER 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 31:12" />Newaize na kuimba kwa nyemi mwe kitui cha Sayuni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:12">newatamiwe kwa vintu vitana ndivyo niwainke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:12">neniwainke nkande, divai mpya na mavuta ya mzaituni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:12">hang'we na maghoto na ng'ombe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:12">Newaituke sa ubuwa unyweshighwewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:12">newaituke na kia kintu wachekunda.<verse eid="JER 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 31:13" />Nee ndiho wandele wawe watamiwe na kuvina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:13">wabwanga kwa wadaa newatamiwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:13">Sungu zawe nenizihitue ziituke nyemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:13">neniwagee moyo na kuwainka nyemi na shiyo usoyoyo.<verse eid="JER 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 31:14" />Neniwainke wavikizi nkande ntana</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:14">na kuwainka wantu wangu kia kintu wachekunda.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:14">Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.<verse eid="JER 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zumbe Mulungu atawaivila mbazi Waizilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 31:15" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:15">“Kuzaivighwa sauti mwe mzi wa Lama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:15">kusigiia na kiiyo cha ukiwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:15">Lahei atawakemea wanae,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:15">hakunda kuhembeezwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:15">kwa kuti wosheni wazafa.<verse eid="JER 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 31:16" />Eka kuiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:16">honoa meshozi yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:16">nenikulihe kwa mbuli ya ndima yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:16">ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:16">wanao newauye kulawa mwe shi ya wankuu.<verse eid="JER 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 31:17" />Kuna kialilo mwe mishi yenyu yeiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:17">wana wenyu newauye na mwe shi yawe.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:17">Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.<verse eid="JER 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 31:18" />“Nizaiva wantu wa Efulaimu wakisuumia na kughamba kuti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:18">‘Uzanitoa kwei sa kadama kashikundako kushungwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:18">kwa ivyoho nizakunda kukuiva.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:18">Unihitue,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:18">naimi nenihituke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:18">kwa kuti iwe niweyo Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu wangu.<verse eid="JER 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 31:19" />Nihezakughoshoela uhuza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:19">naavoteka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:19">nihehinywa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:19">nikakiona ni dashi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:19">nikaingiwa ni shoni na kukibea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:19">kwa kuti naainua shoni ya ubwanga wangu.’ ”<verse eid="JER 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 31:20" />“Efulaimu ni ng'wanangu niyemkunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:20">ni ng'wanangu mwenitamila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:20">Hata kati naamvaiya miya naamfukila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:20">Naamfanyanya kweli mwe moyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:20">naamuivila mbazi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:20">Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.<verse eid="JER 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 31:21" />Ika ntangilo mwe sia zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:21">ika vibaa vyekuonyesha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:21">ufukile vitana ija sia nkulu uzinkiieyo ukiita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:21">Uya na mwe mizi yako iwe Izilaeli mwenivika imi du.<verse eid="JER 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 31:22" />Iwe Izilaeli neusangadike mpaka ini sa mndele ashiye mkweli?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:22">Kwa kuti, imi Zumbe Mulungu nenighoshole mbuli mpya mwe shi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:22">wantu wa Izilaeli newaniuiye sa mvyele avyemuiya mghoshi wakwe.”<verse eid="JER 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kung'azwa mesho kwa wantu wa Zumbe Mulungu mwe mishi yeiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 31:23" />Zumbe Mulungu mwena nguvu zoshe, Mulungu wa Izilaeli, aghamba ivi, “Nikiwauza vingi wantu wa Izilaeli kulawa mwe shi ya ugheni na mwe shi yawe, wo newaghambe mwe shi ya Yuda na mwe mizi yawe kuti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:23">‘Zumbe Mulungu akung'aze mesho iwe muima mng'azi wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:23">hantu hang'azi aheikala.’ <verse eid="JER 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 31:24" />Wantu we mwe mzi wa Yuda na mizi yakwe yoshe, waimi na walishi weshamashama na mafyo yawe, newaikale hang'we kwa nyemi na mpolele. <verse eid="JER 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 31:25" />Neniwainke hemelo watibukewo na waegheekewo neniwainke nguvu. <verse eid="JER 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 31:26" />Mntu aadaha kughamba, ‘Niheita kwelala niheinuka nikataila kuti usisiiza wangu nee ni mtana kweli.’”<verse eid="JER 31:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 31:27" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, “Mishi yaaiza neniimemeeze wantu na vizama mwe shi ya Izilaeli na shi ya Yuda. <verse eid="JER 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 31:28" />Savia niitukevyo mtanda kwe kuwausha na kuwaikiza, kuwakinya, kuwabana na kuwaetea ntogho, nee ndivyo niituke mtanda kunga niwatamize na kuwaika hantu hawe. Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo. <verse eid="JER 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 31:29" />Iyo mishi ikizabula wantu hewaghambe vingi kuti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:29">‘Wavyazi wawe waaja zabibu zekala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:29">miya meno ya wana wawe yaatozwa ni wizia.’ <verse eid="JER 31:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 31:30" />Miya kia mng'we neafe kwa uhuza wakwe ng'wenye na uja ndiye aje zabibu zekala meno yakwe neyatozwe ni wizia.”<verse eid="JER 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 31:31" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, “Mishi yaaiza neniike kilagha kihya na wantu wa Izilaeli na wantu wa Yuda. <verse eid="JER 31:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 31:32" />Ichi kilagha hechiituke sa chia naikacho na baba zawe nihezawatoza kwa mkono wangu walawe mwe shi ya Misii. Icho kilagha waachibana, hata kati imi nee ni Zumbe wawe. Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo. <verse eid="JER 31:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 31:33" />Mishi iyo neniike kilagha kihya na wantu wa Izilaeli, neniike sheiya yangu mwe akii zawe na kuigonda mwe myoyo yawe. Imi neniituke Mulungu wawe, wohe newaituke wantu wangu. <verse eid="JER 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 31:34" />Mntu heamhinye vingi nyiae wala mndughu wakwe kumtaila Zumbe Mulungu, kwa kuti wosheni newanitaile imi, kuanduka wadodo mpaka wakulu. Kwa kuti neniwaushiize ubada wawe na seniufukile vingi uhuza wawe.”<verse eid="JER 31:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 31:35" />Zumbe Mulungu nee aikileye zua jimuike mshii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:35">ng'wezi na ntondwe vimuike nakio.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:35">Azaghoshola bahai iituke na mawimbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:35">zina jakwe ni Zumbe Mulungu mwena nguvu zoshe.<verse eid="JER 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 31:36" />Waona izo mbuli niikilezo mwe ngulu zauka mwe mesho yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:36">wavyawa wa Izilaeli hewaituke mbali mwe mesho yangu kale na kale.<verse eid="JER 31:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 31:37" />Kati lwingu jaadaha kuighanywa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:37">na andukio ja ngulu kuwelelwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:37">nee ndivyo niwaashe hale wavyawa wa Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:37">kwa mbuli zawe waghosholezo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 31:37">Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.<verse eid="JER 31:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 31:38" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, “Mishi yaaiza, unu mzi wa Yelusalemu neuzengwe uhya kwa mbuli yangu imi Zumbe Mulungu, kulawa kwe mnala wa Hananeli mpaka kwe zuvi ja nkandai. <verse eid="JER 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 31:39" />Na ughoe wa kuighanyiiza mzi neuzinke kulawa kwe kitui cha Galebu, vikibinda newiite mpaka Goa. <verse eid="JER 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 31:40" />Mwe koongo joshe wazikiiwejo wafiewo na kuashiizwa mazeu, mbuwa zoshe mpaka kikoongo cha Kidiloni, mpaka mwe mpembe za uvi wa Faashi wazu zua jikwelawiya, nehaituke hantu hang'azi kwa Zumbe Mulungu. Uwo mzi heubanighwe wala kugandulwa kale na kale.”<verse eid="JER 31:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="JER 32" />
  <para style="s">Yelemia ataghula ubuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 32:1" />Mbuli ya Zumbe Mulungu yaamuizila Yelemia mwe vui ja muongo mng'we ja ugholokezi wa Sedekia zumbe wa Yuda, ndijo jii vui ja muongo mng'we na mnane ja ugholokezi wa Nebukadineza zumbe wa Babeli. <verse eid="JER 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 32:2" />Mishi iyo, waghojo wa zumbe wa Babeli nee wakiudenga na kuutoa mzi wa Yelusalemu, mteghanyi Yelemia yohe nee aishungighwe mwe ukomea wa waghojo we ndai ya kitaa cha zumbe wa Yuda. <verse eid="JER 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 32:3" />Sedekia zumbe wa Yuda nee aimzughaiye Yelemia akighamba, “Kwai waateghanya na kughamba kuti Zumbe Mulungu azaghamba neauweke unu mzi ughuighwe ni zumbe wa Babeli, yohe neaughue kwa nguvu <verse eid="JER 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 32:4" />na Sedekia zumbe wa Yuda, headahe kuwasupuuka mwe mikono ya Wakalidayo, miya neagwiwe aighawe kwa zumbe wa Babeli, yohe neamuone kwa mesho yakwe na kushimoea naye. <verse eid="JER 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 32:5" />Sedekia neaighawe mpaka Babeli, yohe neaikale uko mpaka ndiho nimlahe. Hata kati Sedekia neatoane na Wakalidayo, heawadahe.”<verse eid="JER 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 32:6" />Yelemia akiituka aizughaiwe mbuli ya Zumbe Mulungu ikamuizila ikighamba, <verse eid="JER 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 32:7" />“Hanameli ng'wana wa isho ako mdodo Shalumu, neakubashe na kukughamba ughule ubuwa wakwe we uko Anasosi, kwa kuti iwe u mndughu wakwe, waadaha kuughula.” <verse eid="JER 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 32:8" />Vikibinda Hanameli akanibasha mwe ukomea wa waghojo sa Zumbe Mulungu anighambilevyo, akanighamba nighule ubuwa wakwe weuko Anasosi mwe shi ya Benjamini kwa kuti ni miyo nekundighwa kuughula. Nee nihetaila kuti kweli iyo nee ni mbuli ya Zumbe Mulungu. <verse eid="JER 32:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 32:9" />Kwa ivyoho, nikaughula uja ubuwa we uko Anasosi, kulawa kwa Hanameli ng'wana mtumba, nikamnka vihindi muongo mng'we na mfungate vya madini ya kughoshoela hea. <verse eid="JER 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 32:10" />Nikaika unyindi mwe kaatasi jeonyesha kuti nizaughula uwo ubuwa, nikawaitanga waona na kuviighanya via vihindi vya madini ya kughoshoela hea mwe mizani. <verse eid="JER 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 32:11" />Nikajighua jia kaatasi nigeziejo unyindi jeonyesha kuti nizaughula uwo ubuwa, jena mashaliti na maivano, hang'we na kaatasi tuhu jishinajo unyindi. <verse eid="JER 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 32:12" />Nikamnka jia kaatasi jeonyesha kuti nizaughula uwo ubuwa Baluku ng'wana wa Nelia ng'wezukuue ja Maaseya, mwe mesho ya Hanameli ng'wana mtumba na waona wageziewo unyindi mwe ijo kaatasi na mwe mesho ya Wayahudi woshe ndiwo waiikale mwe ukomea wa waghojo. <verse eid="JER 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 32:13" />Nikamghamba Baluku mwe mesho ya awo wantu woshe kuti, <verse eid="JER 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 32:14" />“Zumbe Mulungu mwena nguvu zoshe, Mulungu wa Izilaeli, aakughamba kuti ughue aya makaatasi yosheni maili, kaatasi jigezighwejo unyindi jeonyesha kuti nizaughula uwo ubuwa na iji tuhu jishigezighwejo unyindi, uyagee mwe nyungu kunga yaikale kwa mishi mingi. <verse eid="JER 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 32:15" />Kwa kuti Zumbe Mulungu mwena nguvu zoshe, Mulungu wa Izilaeli, aakughamba kuti, zia nyumba na mbuwa hang'we na mbuwa za mizabibu ze mwe inu shi, nezighulwe vingi.”<verse eid="JER 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yelemia atamvika Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 32:16" />Nihebinda kumnka Baluki ng'wana wa Nelia, kaatasi jeonyesha kuti nizaughula uwo ubuwa, nikamvika Zumbe Mulungu nikighamba, <verse eid="JER 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 32:17" />“Iwe Zumbe Mulungu kwa nguvu zako nyingi na kwa kudaha kwako, uzaumba lwingu na shi, hekuna mbuli ushidahayo. <verse eid="JER 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 32:18" />Iwe uzaonyesha lukundisho lwako kwa wantu wangi, miya vingi waawatoa wana kwa mbuli ya uhuza wa wavyazi wawe. Iwe u Mulungu mkulu mwena nguvu, Zumbe Mulungu mwena nguvu zoshe nee zina jako. <verse eid="JER 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 32:19" />Fanyanyi zako ni za viugho na mbuli zako ni nkulu, mbuli za wantu wosheni waazitaila, umuliha kia mng'we kuighana na mbuli zakwe azeghoshola. <verse eid="JER 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 32:20" />Aho kale waaghoshola vimaka na mbuli zemasha mwe shi ya Misii, na waahimba kughoshola mpaka lelo kwa Waizilaeli na kwa wantu wa mbali zoshe, mbuli ikuekileyo utaikane kia hantu. <verse eid="JER 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 32:21" />Waawalavya wantu wako wa Izilaeli kulawa mwe shi Misii kwa ntangilo na vimaka, kwa nguvu zako nyingi, kwa kudaha kwako na kwa kugeza wogha kuisiizeko. <verse eid="JER 32:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 32:22" />Uzawainka inu shi waikayo kilagha na baba zawe kuti neuwainke, shi yeozoka na yetama kwa kuishiiza. <verse eid="JER 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 32:23" />Miya wo wahebula na kuighua iituke yawe, hewakuivile hambu kutongela sheiya zako. Hewaghoshole via uwaaghiizevyo, nee vyeleka uzawaetea izi ntogho zoshe.<verse eid="JER 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 32:24" />“Waghojo wa Wakalidayo wazafuka matubwi na kuudenganyiza unu mzi kunga waughue, wohe watautoa. Nkondo, saa na matamu nevieke unu mzi ughuighwe. Mbuli zosheni ulongiezo kweli zizalawiya. <verse eid="JER 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 32:25" />Miya iwe Zumbe Mulungu waanighambila nighule ubuwa kwa madini ya kughosholea hea mwe mesho ya waona, hang'we na kuti uwo mzi wiidengighwe ni Wakalidayo.”<verse eid="JER 32:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 32:26" />Vikibinda Zumbe Mulungu akanighamba, <verse eid="JER 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 32:27" />“Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu wa wantu wosheni. Hekuna mbuli yoyoshe nishidahayo.”<verse eid="JER 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 32:28" />Ivi nee avyelonga Zumbe Mulungu, “Imi neniulavye unu mzi kwa Wakalidayo na kwa Nebukadineza zumbe wa Babeli, yohena neaughuwe. <verse eid="JER 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 32:29" />Wakalidayo weutoa unu mzi newaize na kuutoa moto, newauwoke hang'we na nyumba ambazo wantu wakwe wazanikweza maya kwa kumuokea ubani mulungu Baali kwe mataa na kumgeea ntogoo za chanywa kwa mulungu. <verse eid="JER 32:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 32:30" />Wantu wa Izilaeli na wa Yuda hewaghoshole kintu chochoshe, miya waghoshole ubanasi mwe mesho yangu kuanduka ubwanga wawe, na ivi ushe Waizilaeli hewaghoshole kintu chochoshe miya wazanikweza maya kwa vintu waghosholevyo kwa mikono yawe. Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo. <verse eid="JER 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 32:31" />Kuandusha unu mzi uzengwe mpaka ivi lelo, wantu wa unu mzi wazanikweza maya na kuniihiza. Shuti niubane, <verse eid="JER 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 32:32" />kwa mbuli ya ubanasi waghosholewo wantu wa Izilaeli na wantu wa Yuda, hang'we na wazumbe na wagholokezi wawe, wavikizi na wateghanyi wawe. <verse eid="JER 32:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 32:33" />Wantu wangu wazanieka na hewakunda kuniuiya, hang'we na kuti kia mshi naawahinya, miya hewanitegheleze wala kuhokela vinyanyi vyangu. <verse eid="JER 32:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 32:34" />Wakaika vinyago vyeniihiza mwe nyumba yetaikana kwa zina jangu, wakaiyeka ishetame kwa kunivika. <verse eid="JER 32:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 32:35" />Wakazenga hantu hakumvika mulungu Baali mwe koongo ja ng'wana Hinomu, kunga wamulaviize mulungu Moleki ntogoo za wabwanga na wandee wawe, hang'we na kuti siwaaghiize na sifanyanye kuti newaghoshole ivyoho, wakawaeka wantu wa Yuda waghoshole uhuza.”<verse eid="JER 32:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waizilaeli watainkwa kilagha cha kuuzizwa mzi wawe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 32:36" />Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu wa Izilaeli, aghamba ivi, “Yelemia, iwe utaghamba unu mzi neughuighwe ni zumbe wa Babeli, kwa nkondo, kwa saa na kwa matamu. Miya imi Zumbe Mulungu wa Izilaeli naghamba, <verse eid="JER 32:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 32:37" />kweli neniwaunganyanye Waizilaeli kulawa mwe shi zoshe nawaasakanyako kwa maya yangu makai na kuihiwa kwangu kuisiizeko. Neniwauze vingi na aha hantu na kuwaeka waikale kwa mpolele. <verse eid="JER 32:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 32:38" />Newaituke wantu wangu, naimi neniituke Mulungu wawe. <verse eid="JER 32:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 32:39" />Neniwaghalushe waituke na moyo mng'we na wena fanyanyi za hang'we kunga waniive imi kale na kale, kwa mbuli yawe wenye na wana wawe ndiwo wavyawe. <verse eid="JER 32:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 32:40" />Nenighoshole nawo kilagha cha kale na kale, senieke kuwaghoshoela mbuli ntana, neniwainke kuniiva kwa myoyo yawe yoshe kunga washezanihituka. <verse eid="JER 32:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 32:41" />Nenitamiwe kuwaghoshoela mbuli ntana na kuwatoghesha mwe inu shi kwa moyo wangu woshe.”<verse eid="JER 32:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 32:42" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, “Sa naetavyo ntogho kwa awa wantu, nee ndivyo niwaetee mbuli ntana niwaghambilezo. <verse eid="JER 32:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 32:43" />Mbuwa nezighulwe mwe inu shi muyeghamba izaituka ukiwa heina wantu wala vizama kwa kuti izainkiwa kwa Wakalidayo. <verse eid="JER 32:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 32:44" />Wantu newaghule mbuwa kwa madini ya kughoshoela hea na newagee unyindi mwe makatasi yeonyesha kuti ni mbuwa zawe, newagee unyindi mwe mesho ya waona mwe shi ya Benjamini, mwe vijiji vye mwe mzi wa Yelusalemu, mwe mizi ya Yuda, mwe mizi ya shi ya vitui, mwe mizi ye wazu zua jikwengookea kushinako vitui na mwe mizi ya nyika ye wazu wa kusini ya Yuda. Neniwaeke mbuli zawe ziwaitile vitana vingi.” Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.<verse eid="JER 32:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="JER 33" />
  <para style="s">Waizilaeli newaonee kialilo vingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 33:1" />Zumbe Mulungu alonga vingi na Yelemia, haja akiituka akezughaiwe mwe ukomea wa waghojo. <verse eid="JER 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 33:2" />Zumbe Mulungu aumbieye shi, aighosholeye na kuiika hantu hakwe, ye zina jakwe ni Zumbe Mulungu, aghamba, <verse eid="JER 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 33:3" />“Niitanga na imi nenikuitikile nenikughambile mbuli nkulu ushitailazo na zishidahazo kutaiwa. <verse eid="JER 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 33:4" />Imi Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu wa Izilaeli, naghamba kwa mbuli ya nyumba za mzi wa Yelusalemu na nyumba za wazumbe wa Yuda, zikinyighwezo kunga waike viugha ndivyo viwahonye na vidanto vighosholevyo ni wankuu, kunga wawatoe wantu we ndai ya mzi, <verse eid="JER 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 33:5" />‘Wantu newagheze kutoana na Wakalidayo miya hewadahe, kwa kuti mpanga nezimeme maiti za wantu ndiwo niwakome kwa maya na kuihiwa kwangu. Neniuweke unu mzi kwa kuti woshe wazaghoshola uhuza. <verse eid="JER 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 33:6" />Hang'we na ivyoho, neniuhonye unu mzi na kuwainka wantu wakwe ugima na nguvu, waonee na waikale kwa mpolele. <verse eid="JER 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 33:7" />Neniwauze wantu wa Yuda na wantu wa Izilaeli kulawa kwe shi ya ugheni nawaighalako na neniwaeke waonee vingi sa via ndivyo waivyo aho boosi. <verse eid="JER 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 33:8" />Wazanighoshoela uhuza, miya neniwang'aze na kuwaushiiza uhuza wawe. <verse eid="JER 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 33:9" />Unu mzi neunietee ukulu, nyemi, ntogoo na ishima mwe wantu wa mbali zoshe za mwe shi ndiwo waive mbuli ntana nizeughoshoela, wohe newamake na kuzingiza kwa kuonea na mpolele ndivyo niuwetee unu mzi wa Yelusalemu.’ ”<verse eid="JER 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 33:10" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, “Muzaghamba aha hantu hazaituka ukiwa, hehana wantu wala vizama. Muzalonga kweli, mwe mizi ya Yuda na mwe sia za Yelusalemu hekuna kintu chochoshe, wantu wala vizama. Miya aha hantu nehaivikane vingi, <verse eid="JER 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 33:11" />vuzo ja visheko na nkeeghee, vuzo ja nteghuzi, vuzo ja weeta ntogoo za kutogola mwe nyumba ya Zumbe Mulungu, wakighamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 33:11">‘Mtogolei Zumbe Mulungu mwena nguvu zoshe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 33:11">kwa kuti ye ni mtana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 33:11">lukundisho lwakwe ni lwa kale na kale.’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JER 33:11">Neniitamize inu shi sa ivyo ndivyo iivyo aho kale.” Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.<verse eid="JER 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 33:12" />Zumbe Mulungu mwena nguvu zoshe aghamba ivi, “Aha hantu haekwaho ukiwa, hashinaho wantu wala vizama mwe mizi yakwe yoshe, nehaituke vingi na mani, ndiho walishi waishiize mafyo yawe. <verse eid="JER 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 33:13" />Mwe mizi ya shi ya vitui, mwe mizi ya shi ishinayo vitui ye wazu zua jikwegongookea na mwe mizi ya ughongo ya kasikasini mwa Yuda, mwe shi ya Benjamini na nkandankanda ya mzi wa Yelusalemu na mwe mizi ya Yuda, walishi newatae vingi mafyo yawe.” Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.<verse eid="JER 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 33:14" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, “Mishi yaaiza ndiho nibontole kilagha changu niikilecho na wantu wa Izilaeli na wantu wa Yuda. <verse eid="JER 33:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 33:15" />Mwe iyo mishi, na muda uwo nenimshaghule zumbe mkweli kuanduka mwe kolwa ja Daudi. Yohe nealahe kwa utanda na kwa ukweli mwe shi ngima. <verse eid="JER 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 33:16" />Mwe iyo mishi, wantu wa Yuda newavuniwe na wantu wa Yelusalemu newaikale vitana. Na uwo mzi newiitangwe, ‘Zumbe Mulungu nee Mghojo weshu.’ <verse eid="JER 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 33:17" />Imi Zumbe Mulungu naghamba, hekushoe kale mvyawa wa kolwa ja Daudi ndiye agholokele Izilaeli. <verse eid="JER 33:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 33:18" />Vingi na wavikizi weanduka na mwe kolwa ja Lawi, newaituke aho kale na kale wanitumikila kunilaviiza ntogoo za kuoka za nkande na kunighoshoela fika kale na kale.”<verse eid="JER 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 33:19" />Zumbe Mulungu akanighambila, <verse eid="JER 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 33:20" />“Kati mukidaha kuusha kilagha changu niikilecho na nakio na mshii kuti mshii na nakio visheoneke sa niikilevyo, <verse eid="JER 33:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 33:21" />vivyo ivyo naimi neniushe kilagha changu niikilecho na mtung'wa wangu Daudi, kunga asheituke na ng'wana wa kibwanga ndiye agholokele hantu hakwe, viavia kilagha changu niikilecho na watung'wa wangu Walawi nechihake. <verse eid="JER 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 33:22" />Sa via ntondwe za uko ulanga hambu mshanga wa bahai vishitaikavyo, nee ndivyo niwaghenyeeze wavyawa wa Daudi na wavikizi wa kolwa ja Lawi wenitumikila.”<verse eid="JER 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 33:23" />Zumbe Mulungu akanighambila vingi kuti, <verse eid="JER 33:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 33:24" />“Ivi, huivile wantu wavyelonga kuti imi Zumbe Mulungu nizawashaghula wantu wa Izilaeli na wantu wa Yuda na iviaha nizawaeka? Kwa ivyoho wazawabea wantu wangu na wawaona kuti wo shiyo wantu wa inu shi. <verse eid="JER 33:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 33:25" />Miya imi Zumbe Mulungu nizaika kilagha cha kio na mshii na kuika sheiya zigholokele lwingu na shi. <verse eid="JER 33:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 33:26" />Kwa ivyo nighosholevyo, nee ndivyo nibontole kilagha changu niikilecho na wavyawa wa Yakobo na mtung'wa wangu Daudi. Nenishaghule mng'we wa wavyawa wa Daudi awagholokele wavyawa wa Ibulahimu, Isaka na Yakobo. Neniwauze vingi na mwe shi yawe kulawa mwe shi ya ugheni na kuwaivila mbazi.”<verse eid="JER 33:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="JER 34" />
  <para style="s">Zumbe Mulungu ataaghiiza mbuli kwa Sedekia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 34:1" />Mwe mishi Nebukadineza zumbe wa Babeli, ahezaiza hang'we na waghojo wa mbali zoshe na shi zoshe ndizo akigholokela na mbali zosheni za wantu woshe kunga kuutoa mzi wa Yelusalemu na mizi yoshe ya Yuda, Zumbe Mulungu akamghamba Yelemia, <verse eid="JER 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 34:2" />“Hita kwa Sedekia zumbe wa Yuda, ukamghambe kuti, ‘Imi Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu wa Izilaeli, ni hehi kuugea unu mzi mwe mikono ya zumbe wa Babeli, yohe neauwoke. <verse eid="JER 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 34:3" />Iwe heumnyiike, miya neugwiwe na neuighawe kwakwe, neudughane na zumbe wa Babeli na kushimoea naye, vikibinda neuighawe Babeli.’ <verse eid="JER 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 34:4" />Iwe Sedekia zumbe wa Yuda, tegheleza nichekughambila. Heufiie kwe nkondo. <verse eid="JER 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 34:5" />Neufe kifa kitana sa via wantu waokavyo ubani wahewazika baba zako ndiwo wai wazumbe, nee ndivyo wantu wakuokee ubani na kusininika wakighamba, ‘Waume! Zumbe weshu azafa!’ ” Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo. <verse eid="JER 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 34:6" />Vikibinda, mteghanyi Yelemia akamghambila Sedekia, zumbe wa Yuda, izo mbuli zoshe uko Yelusalemu, <verse eid="JER 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 34:7" />mishi waghojo wa zumbe Nebukadineza wa Babeli waheituka waatoana na wantu wa Yelusalemu na mizi ya Yuda ndiyo ikikidaha yaani Lakishi na Azeka, inu nee mizi izungushiizweyo ukando yashighalayo mwe shi ya Yuda.<verse eid="JER 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuekewa kwa watung'wa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 34:8" />Inu nee mbuli ya Zumbe Mulungu yamuiziayo Yelemia mishi zumbe Sedekia aheivana na wantu woshe wa Yelusalemu wabilikile kuekewa kwa watung'wa. <verse eid="JER 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 34:9" />Kia mntu akundighwa amuekee mtung'wa wakwe wa Kiebulania, aituke mghoshi hambu mvyele, asheoneke mntu yoyoshe mwemghalusha Myahudi nyiae mtung'wa. <verse eid="JER 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 34:10" />Kwa ivyoho wagholokezi woshe na wantu woshe waikilewo icho kilagha wakaivana woshe wawaekee watung'wa wawe wa kighoshi na wa kivyele na mntu yoyoshe ashezawaghalusha watung'wa vingi. Wakaivana wakawaekea. <verse eid="JER 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 34:11" />Miya wakahitua fanyanyi zawe, wakawagwia awo watung'wa wa kighoshi na wa kivyee ndiwo waiwaekee, wakawaghalusha vingi watung'wa.<verse eid="JER 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 34:12" />Nee Zumbe Mulungu ahemghamba Yelemia kuti, <verse eid="JER 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 34:13" />“Naaika kilagha na baba zenyu nihezawalavya Misii mwe shi ya utung'wa, nikawaghamba kuti, <verse eid="JER 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 34:14" />kia jikibula vui ja mfungate, kia mng'we wenyu amuekee mtung'wa wakwe Muebulania nyiae akitaghieye ng'wenye kuituka mtung'wa kwa mavui mtandatu. Muwaekee washemighosholee vingi ndima. Miya baba zenyu hewanitegheleze wala kuniiva. <verse eid="JER 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 34:15" />Mishi migheke izinkileyo, mutevoteka mukaghoshola mbuli nimighambilezo, kia mng'we wenyu akakunda kumuekea Muebulania nyiae. Na inywi mukaika kilagha mwe mesho yangu mwe nyumba yeitaikana kwa zina jangu. <verse eid="JER 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 34:16" />Miya ushe muzahituka mukakanka zina jangu kwa kuti, kia mng'we wenyu azawauza vingi watung'wa wakwe wa kighoshi na wa kivyele ndiwo aiwaekee waite wakwekunda. Muzawakungumiza waituke watung'wa wenyu vingi. <verse eid="JER 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 34:17" />Imi Zumbe Mulungu naghamba, inywi hemuniivile kwa mbuli ya kuwaekea wandughu wenyu Waizilaeli. Naimi ushe nenimieke mukong'we kwa nkondo, kwa matamu na kwa saa. Nenimieke wantu wa zumbe zoshe ze mwe shi wamiihiwe. <verse eid="JER 34:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 34:18" />Wantu waekilewo kilagha changu na kuemela maaghizo ya kilagha waghosholecho mwe mesho yangu, neniwaghoshole waituke sa kadama kashengighweko kaili vikibinda wakazinka gatigati yakwe. <verse eid="JER 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 34:19" />Neniwashenge vihindi, hata kati ni wagholokezi wa Yuda na wagholokezi wa mzi wa Yelusalemu, wakulu wa kaya cha zumbe, wavikizi, hang'we na wantu woshe, kwa kuti woshe wazaeka kilagha changu. <verse eid="JER 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 34:20" />Neniwaeke wagwiwe ni wankuu na wantu wekunda kuwakoma. Maiti zawe neziituke nkande za madeghe na vizama vya tundui. <verse eid="JER 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 34:21" />Sedekia, zumbe wa Yuda, hang'we na waambizi wakwe, neniwaeke wagwiwe ni wankuu wawe wekunda kuwakoma na wagwiwe ni waghojo wa zumbe wa Babeli waekilewo kuwatoa. <verse eid="JER 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 34:22" />Imi Zumbe Mulungu neniwauze vingi waghojo wa Babeli na mwe unu mzi. Newautoe, newaughue na kuuwoka. Neniighalushe mizi ya Yuda iituke mahuzu yashiikawayo ni mntu.”<verse eid="JER 34:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="JER 35" />
  <para style="s">Yelemia atawatogola Walekabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 35:1" />Mwe mishi ya ugholokezi wa Yehoyakimu ng'wana wa Yosia zumbe wa Yuda, Zumbe Mulungu aanighamba, <verse eid="JER 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 35:2" />“Hita kwe mzi wa kolwa ja Walekabu, ukalonge nawo. Vikibinda, uwakonge na mwe chumba king'we cha nyumba yangu imi Zumbe Mulungu, uwainke divai wavate.” <verse eid="JER 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 35:3" />Kwa ivyoho, nikamghua Yaazania ng'wana wa Yelemia mtuhu, ng'wezukuue ja Habazinia na wandughu wakwe hang'we na wanae wa kibwanga wa kolwa ja Walekabu. <verse eid="JER 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 35:4" />Nikawaeta na mwe nyumba ya Zumbe Mulungu, mwe chumba cha wana wa Hanani ng'wana wa Igidalia, mntu wa Zumbe Mulungu. Icho chumba nee chii hehi na chumba cha wagholokezi watuhu, ulanga ya chumba cha Maaseya ng'wana wa Shalumu, mghojo wa nyumba ya Zumbe Mulungu. <verse eid="JER 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 35:5" />Vikibinda, nikaeta vitumbi na vibakui vimemievyo divai mwe mesho ya awo Walekabu, nikawaghamba, “Vatai divai.”<verse eid="JER 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 35:6" />Miya wo wakaghamba, “Ishwi hetivata divai, kwa kuti baba yeshu Yonadabu ng'wana wa Lekabi, aatighamba tishevate divai ishwi na wana weshu kale na kale. <verse eid="JER 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 35:7" />Vingi mushezenge nyumba, mushezaima mbuwa wala mushezahanda mizabibu hambu kughula mbuwa za mizabibu. Miya nemuikale mwe makumbi mishi yoshe ya ugima wenyu, kunga mudahe kuikala mavui mangi mwe shi muyeikala sa wagheni. <verse eid="JER 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 35:8" />Ishwi tizaiiva maaghiizo yoshe tiinkighweyo ni Yonadabu ng'wana wa Lekabu. Ishwi hetivata divai, wala wavyele weshu na wana weshu wa kibwanga na wa kindele. <verse eid="JER 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 35:9" />Hetizenga nyumba za kuikala, vingi hetina mbuwa za mizabibu wala mbuwa za kuima na kuhanda mbeyu. <verse eid="JER 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 35:10" />Tiikale mwe makumbi na kutongela maaghiizo yoshe tiinkighweyo ni Yonadabu, baba yeshu. <verse eid="JER 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 35:11" />Miya Nebukadineza zumbe wa Babeli, ahezaiza kweitoa inu shi, tikaamuwa kuiza Yelusalemu kunga kuwanyiika waghojo wa Wakalidayo na Waashulu. Nee vyeleka tiikala mwe mzi wa Yelusalemu.”<verse eid="JER 35:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 35:12" />Vikibinda, Zumbe Mulungu mwena nguvu zoshe, Mulungu wa Izilaeli akanighambila, <verse eid="JER 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 35:13" />“Hita ukawaghambile wantu wa Yuda na wantu wa Yelusalemu kuti, Imi Zumbe Mulungu naghamba ivi, ‘Kwai hemukunda kutegheleza vinyanyi vyangu na kuiiva maaghiizo niyeminka?’ <verse eid="JER 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 35:14" />Yonadabu ng'wana wa Lekabu aawaaghiiza wanae washevate divai, wohe wazamuiva, hewavata divai mpaka ivi lelo kwa kuti wazaiva maaghiizo ya baba awe. Miya imi nee nikishindia longa na inywi, miya inywi hemuniivile. <verse eid="JER 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 35:15" />Vingi nee nikishindia mietea watung'wa wangu wateghanyi, wamishunde mueke sia zenyu mbada, vingi muandushe kughoshola mbuli ntana. Waamishunda mueke kuvika mulungu mituhu na kuitumikila, kunga muikale kwa mpolele mwe inu shi naminkayo inywi na baba zenyu. Miya inywi hemunitegheleze wala kuniiva. <verse eid="JER 35:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 35:16" />Wana wa Yonadabu ng'wana wa Lekabu, waatoza kanwa wainkwacho ni baba awe, miya inywi hemuniiva. <verse eid="JER 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 35:17" />Kwa ivyoho, imi Zumbe Mulungu mwena nguvu zoshe, Mulungu wa Izilaeli, naghamba kuti, wantu wa Yuda na wantu woshe wa Yelusalemu, neniwaetee mbuli zosheni mbada nighambilezo kuti neniwaetee, kwa kuti imi nizalonga nawo, miya hewanitegheleze, nizawaitanga, miya hewaniitikile.”<verse eid="JER 35:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 35:18" />Vikibinda Yelemia akawaghambila wantu wa kolwa ja Walekabu kuti, Zumbe Mulungu mwena nguvu zoshe, Mulungu wa Izilaeli, aghamba ivi, “Inywi wantu wa kolwa ja Walekabu, muzaiva kanwa cha baba enyu Yonadabu na kutongela mbuli zoshe vingi muzaghoshola kia kintu amiaghiizecho. <verse eid="JER 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 35:19" />Kwa ivyoho imi Zumbe Mulungu nena nguvu zoshe, Mulungu wa Izilaeli naghamba kuti, Yonadabu ng'wana wa Lekabu heashoe mvyawa wa kunitumikila imi kale na kale.”<verse eid="JER 35:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="JER 36" />
  <para style="s">Baluku atawafyomea wantu gondwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 36:1" />Mwe vui ja ne ja ugholokezi wa Yehoyakimu ng'wana wa Yosia zumbe wa Yuda, Zumbe Mulungu aamghamba Yelemia, <verse eid="JER 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 36:2" />“Ghua gondwe ugonde mbuli zosheni nikughambilezo kuanduka haja niandusheho kukughambila kwa mbuli ya shi ya Izilaeli na shi ya Yuda na mbali zosheni mwe mishi ya ugholokezi wa Yosia mpaka ivi lelo. <verse eid="JER 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 36:3" />Ngea wantu wa Yuda wakiiva ntogho zoshe nifanyanyezo kuwaetea, newahituke waeke mbuli zawe mbada. Naimi neniwaushiize ubada wawe na uhuza wawe.”<verse eid="JER 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 36:4" />Nee Yelemia ahemuitanga Baluku ng'wana wa Nelia. Baluku yohe akagonda mwe gondwe mbuli zoshe ashimoeezo Yelemia, aghambiwezo ni Zumbe Mulungu. <verse eid="JER 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 36:5" />Vikibinda, Yelemia akamuaghiiza Baluku, akamghambila, “Imi niishungighwe, sikundighwa kuingila mwe nyumba ya Zumbe Mulungu. <verse eid="JER 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 36:6" />Miya mwe mushi wa mviko wa kufunga, neuite mwe mesho ya bumba ja wantu we mwe nyumba ya Zumbe Mulungu, ukafyome mbuli zosheni ugondiezo, niaghiizwezo ni Zumbe Mulungu. Izo mbuli zoshe neuzifyome vingi mwe mesho ya wantu wa Yuda na wantu woshe waizilewo kulawa kwe mizi yawe. <verse eid="JER 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 36:7" />Ngea newamvike Zumbe Mulungu yohe neaive mviko wawe, na wantu wosheni newahituke waeke mbuli zawe mbada, kwa kuti Zumbe Mulungu aifanyanye kuwatoa awa wantu kwa maya makai.” <verse eid="JER 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 36:8" />Kwa ivyoho Baluku ng'wana wa Nelia, akaghoshola mbuli zoshe aaghiizwezo ni mteghanyi Yelemia, akafyoma mbuli za Zumbe Mulungu zigondighwezo mwe ijo gondwe, ndai ya nyumba ya Zumbe Mulungu.<verse eid="JER 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 36:9" />Mwe vui ja shano ja ugholokezi wa zumbe Yehoyakimu ng'wana wa Yosia zumbe wa Yuda, mwe ng'wezi wa kenda, wantu woshe wa Yelusalemu na wantu watuhu wosheni waizilewo Yelusalemu kuandukia mwe mizi ya Yuda, wakaaghiiza mushi wa kufunga mwe mesho ya Zumbe Mulungu. <verse eid="JER 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 36:10" />Nee Baluku ahefyoma mbuli zoshe za Yelemia aghambilezo ni Zumbe Mulungu ze mwe jia gondwe mwe mesho ya wantu woshe we mwe nyumba ya Zumbe Mulungu ai mwe chumba cha Gemalia ng'wana wa Shafani mwegonda. Icho chumba nee chii wazu we kenya hehi na zuvi hya ja kuingiila mwe nyumba ya Zumbe Mulungu.<verse eid="JER 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wagholokezi wa Yuda watafyomewa gondwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 36:11" />Mikaya ng'wana wa Gemalia, ng'wezukuue ja Shafani, aheziiva mbuli zoshe za Zumbe Mulungu zifyomighwezo ni Baluku kulawa mwe jia gondwe, <verse eid="JER 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 36:12" />ateita mwe kaya cha zumbe mwe chumba cha mwegonda, hantu ndiho waiikale wagholokezi woshe. Nee waihaho Elishama mwegonda, Delaya ng'wana wa Shemaya, Elinasani ng'wana wa Akiboli, Gemalia ng'wana wa Shafani, Sedekia ng'wana wa Hanania na wagholokezi watuhu woshe ndiwo waii uko. <verse eid="JER 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 36:13" />Mikaya akawaghambila mbuli zosheni aivilezo Baluku akiwafyomea wantu kulawa mwe jia gondwe. <verse eid="JER 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 36:14" />Nee, wagholokezi wakamuaghiiza Yehudi ng'wana wa Nesania, ng'wezukuue ja Shelemia, chezukuue cha Kushi, amghambile Baluku aghue jia gondwe afyomeejo wantu. Kwa ivyoho, Baluku ng'wana wa Nelia, akajighua jia gondwe, akawaighaiya. <verse eid="JER 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 36:15" />Wohe wakamghamba, “Taaombeza uikale shi utifyomee.” Baluku akawafyomea kunu wakimtegheleza. <verse eid="JER 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 36:16" />Waheiva izo mbuli zoshe, wakaweana kwa wogha. Wakamghamba Baluku, “Tikundighwa tikamghambile zumbe izi mbuli zoshe.” <verse eid="JER 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 36:17" />Nee wahemuuza Baluku, “Tee tighambile, udahie zeze kugonda mbuli izi zoshe? Hambu Yelemia nee akushimoezeye ukazigonda?”<verse eid="JER 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 36:18" />Baluku akawahisa, “Yelemia nee akinishimoeza naimi nee nikizigonda kwa kaamu ya wino mwe iji gondwe.”<verse eid="JER 36:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 36:19" />Nee waja wagholokezi wahemghambila Baluku, “Iwe na Yelemia hitai mukakifishe, mntu yoyoshe ashezataila hantu ndiho mukifishe.”<verse eid="JER 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zumbe Yehoyakimu atajioka gondwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 36:20" />Waja wagholokezi wahejiika jia gondwe mwe chumba cha Elishama mwegonda, wakamtongela zumbe mwe ukomea, wakamuukuiya mbuli zoshe. <verse eid="JER 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 36:21" />Vikibinda, zumbe akamuaghiiza Yehudi aite kwejighua jia gondwe. Yehudi akajighua mwe chumba cha Elishama mwegonda, akamfyomea zumbe na wagholokezi woshe ndiwo waigholoke hehi naye. <verse eid="JER 36:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 36:22" />Nee ni ng'wezi wa kenda mishi ya mpeho, zumbe nee ai mwe kitaa chakwe acheikala mwe mishi ya mpeho akiotea moto we mwe nyungu. <verse eid="JER 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 36:23" />Vikaituka kuti, Yehudi akibindiiza kufyoma makaatasi matatu hambu mane ivi ya ijo gondwe, zumbe atayatatua ayo makaatasi kwa tuni na kuyaoka mwe moto. Akahimba kughoshola ivyoho mpaka gondwe joshe jikahya. <verse eid="JER 36:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 36:24" />Miya, zumbe na waambizi wakwe woshe waheziiva zia mbuli zoshe, hewaivile wogha wala hewatatue shuke zawe kwa usoyoyo. <verse eid="JER 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 36:25" />Hang'we na kuti, Elinasani, Delaya na Gemalia waamkengeeza zumbe ashejioke ijo gondwe, miya zumbe hawategheleze. <verse eid="JER 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 36:26" />Miya zumbe akamghamba Yelameeli ng'wanae hang'we na Selaya ng'wana wa Azilieli na Shelemia ng'wana wa Abudeeli, wamgwiye Baluku agondieye ijo gondwe na mteghanyi Yelemia. Miya Zumbe Mulungu nee aiwafishize.<verse eid="JER 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yelemia atagonda gondwe tuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 36:27" />Zumbe Yehoyakimu ahebinda kuoka jia gondwe jigondighwejo ni Baluku kwa mbuli ashimoezwezo ni Yelemia, Zumbe Mulungu akamghambila Yelemia kuti, <verse eid="JER 36:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 36:28" />aghue gondwe tuhu, agonde mbuli zoshe ndizo zii mwe jia gondwe ja boosi jaokwajo ni Yehoyakimu, zumbe wa Yuda. <verse eid="JER 36:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 36:29" />Na uyo Yehoyakimu zumbe wa Yuda, amghambile kuti Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, “Iwe uzaoka ijo gondwe na kuuza kuti kwai Yelemia azagonda kuti zumbe wa Babeli neaize kweibana inu shi na kuwakoma wantu na vizama? <verse eid="JER 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 36:30" />Kwa ivyoho, imi Zumbe Mulungu naghamba kuti kwa mbuli ya Yehoyakimu zumbe wa Yuda, ye heaituke na mvyawa mweikaila kiti cha uzumbe cha Daudi, na maiti yakwe neiyashighwe na se itoighwe ni zua mshii na mpeho nakio. <verse eid="JER 36:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 36:31" />Nenimtoe ye na wavyawa wakwe hang'we na waambizi wakwe kwa mbuli ya uhuza wawe. Neniwaetee ntogho wo wenye na wantu woshe weikala Yelusalemu hang'we na wantu woshe wa Yuda, nilongiewo kwa mbuli yawe kwa kuti hewanitegheleze.”<verse eid="JER 36:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 36:32" />Vikibinda, Yelemia akaghua gondwe tuhu jishigondighwejo kintu chochoshe, akajimnka Baluku ng'wana wa Nelia, akagonda umo mbuli zoshe ashimoezwezo ni Yelemia ndizo zii mwe jia gondwe ja boosi jaokwajo ni Yehoyakimu zumbe wa Yuda. Na mbuli ntuhu zeitiana na izo zikaongezwa umo mwe ijo gondwe tuhu.<verse eid="JER 36:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="JER 37" />
  <para style="s">Sedekia atamuombeza Yelemia vinyanyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 37:1" />Nebukadineza zumbe wa Babeli aamshimika Sedekia ng'wana wa Yosia aituke zumbe wa Yuda, agholokele hantu ha Konia ng'wana wa Yehoyakimu. <verse eid="JER 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 37:2" />Miya Sedekia na waambizi wakwe hang'we na wantu wa Yuda hewategheleze mbuli za Zumbe Mulungu alongazo kuzinkia mteghanyi Yelemia.<verse eid="JER 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 37:3" />Zumbe Sedekia awaaghiiza Yehukali ng'wana wa Shelemia hang'we na mvikizi Sefania ng'wana wa Maaseya waite kwa mteghanyi Yelemia, wakamuombeze awavikile kwa Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu wawe. <verse eid="JER 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 37:4" />Mishi iyo Yelemia nee akiingila na kulawa kwa wantu kwa kuti nee aishizati kuzughaiwa. <verse eid="JER 37:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 37:5" />Waghojo wa zumbe wa Misii na waghojo wa Wakalidayo ndiwo wakiudenga mzi wa Yelusalemu, waheiva izo mbuli wateghuuka.<verse eid="JER 37:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 37:6" />Nee Zumbe Mulungu ahemghamba Yelemia kuti, <verse eid="JER 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 37:7" />“Imi Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu wa Izilaeli naghamba kuti, zumbe wa Yuda akuaghiizeye kwangu uniuze mbuli ndizo zilawiye umghambe kuti, waghojo wa zumbe wa Misii waizilewo kwekuambiza, wahehi kuuya na kwe shi yawe ya Misii. <verse eid="JER 37:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 37:8" />Wakalidayo newaize vingi kweutoa unu mzi. Newaughue na kuutoa moto. <verse eid="JER 37:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 37:9" />Imi Zumbe Mulungu naghamba kuti, mushekilufye wenye mukighamba kuti, waghojo wa Wakalidayo newauke na hewauye vingi. <verse eid="JER 37:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 37:10" />Hata mukiwadaha waghojo woshe wa Wakalidayo wetoana na inywi, wakashighaa waja wena vionda mwe makumbi yawe, newagholoke na kuuoka unu mzi.”<verse eid="JER 37:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yelemia atagwiwa na kuzughaiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 37:11" />Waghojo wa Wakalidayo wahelawa pee Yelusalemu kuwaghuuka waghojo wa zumbe wa Misii ndiwo waibuzie hehi, <verse eid="JER 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 37:12" />Yelemia akauka Yelusalemu akaita kwe shi ya Benjamini kunga akainkwe kifu chakwe mwe wandughu wakwe. <verse eid="JER 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 37:13" />Ahebula mwe uvi wa Benjamini, mghojo mng'we mweitangwa Iliya ng'wana wa Shelemia, ng'wezukuue ja Hanania, akamgwiya Yelemia na kumghambia, “Iwe utanyiika uite kwevungana na waghojo wa Wakalidayo!”<verse eid="JER 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 37:14" />Yelemia akamghamba, “Ayo ni mambeza! Imi sitanyiika niite kwevungana na Wakalidayo.” Miya Iliya hategheleze aghambiwevyo ni Yelemia. Kwa ivyoho akamgwiya na kumuighala kwa wagholokezi. <verse eid="JER 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 37:15" />Awo wagholokezi wakakwewa ni maya kwa mbuli ya Yelemia wakamtoa, vikibinda wakamzughaiya mwe nyumba ya Yonasani mwegonda, ighalushweyo kuituka geeza. <verse eid="JER 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 37:16" />Yelemia ageighwe ndai mwe chumba ndicho chiifukighwe shi, yohe akaikala uko kwa mishi mingi.<verse eid="JER 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 37:17" />Vikibinda, zumbe Sedekia akaaghiiza wantu wamuighale Yelemia mwe nyumba ya kizumbe, zumbe akamuuza kwa kifisho kuti, “Ivi kuna mbuli yoyoshe kulawa kwa Zumbe Mulungu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 37:17">Yelemia akamhisa, “Ehe ihaho, iwe neugwiwe ni zumbe wa Babeli.” <verse eid="JER 37:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 37:18" />Yelemia akamuuza zumbe Sedekia kuti, “Nikubaniei iwe hambu waambizi wako na awa wantu, mpaka mukanizughaiya? <verse eid="JER 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 37:19" />Wakuhi wateghanyi wakuteghanyiizawo wakighamba kuti, zumbe wa Babeli heakutoe iwe wala inu shi? <verse eid="JER 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 37:20" />Ushe naakuombeza unitegheleze iwe zumbe wangu. Naakuombeza usheniuze vingi na mwe chumba che shi mwe nyumba ya Yonasani mwegonda, kwa kuti nenifiie umo.”<verse eid="JER 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 37:21" />Kwa ivyoho, zumbe Sedekia akaaghiiza Yelemia aikwe he ukomea wa waghojo. Na ainkwe mkate kia mshi kulawa kwa wedika mikate mpaka ndiho mikate yoshe ishiye mwe mzi. Kwa ivyoho Yelemia akaikala mwe ukomea wa waghojo.<verse eid="JER 37:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="JER 38" />
  <para style="s">Yelemia atageighwa na mwe kishima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 38:1" />Shefatia ng'wana wa Matani, Gedalia ng'wana wa Pashuli, Yehukali ng'wana wa Shelemia na Pashuli ng'wana wa Malikiya, waaiva mbuli zoshe Yelemia awaghambilezo wantu woshe, akighamba, <verse eid="JER 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 38:2" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, “Mntu yoyoshe ndiye ashighale mwe unu mzi neafe kwa nkondo, kwa saa hambu kwa matamu. Miya waja ndiwo walawe se ya mzi na kukiighala kwa Wakalidayo, newauhonye ugima wawe.” <verse eid="JER 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 38:3" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, “Neniuweke unu mzi ughuighwe ni waghojo wa zumbe wa Babeli.”<verse eid="JER 38:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 38:4" />Waambizi wa zumbe wakaita kwa zumbe wakamghamba, “Vikundighwa uyu mntu akong'we, kwa kuti atawakinya mpome na ndai waghojo wagheke washighalewo mwe unu mzi na wantu woshe, kwa kulonga mbuli sa izo. Ye hawakundia mbuli ntana awa wantu, awakundiia mbuli mbada.”<verse eid="JER 38:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 38:5" />Zumbe Sedekia akaghamba, “Waume, mghosholeei vyovyoshe muvyekunda, imi sidaha kumiemeza.” <verse eid="JER 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 38:6" />Kwa ivyoho, wakamghua Yelemia wakamgea na mwe kishima cha Malikiya ng'wana wa zumbe che mwe ukomea wa waghojo. Wamuikiza Yelemia mwe kishima kwa ngoe. Mwe icho kishima nee hekuna mazi miya ntope, Yelemia akadidimia mwe iyo ntope. <verse eid="JER 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 38:7" />Miya Ebedimeleki towashi Muesiopia, ndiye ai mgholokezi mwe nyumba ya kizumbe, akaiva kuti wazamgea Yelemia mwe kishima. Mda uwo zumbe nee aiikale he zuvi ja Benjamini. <verse eid="JER 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 38:8" />Nee Ebedimeleki akaita kwa zumbe akamghamba, <verse eid="JER 38:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 38:9" />“Zumbe wangu mkulu, mbuli waghosholeyo awa wantu ni mbada. Wazamgea uja Yelemia mteghanyi mwe kishima, hantu ndiho afe kwa saa, kwa kuti hekuna nkande vingi mwe mzi.” <verse eid="JER 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 38:10" />Nee zumbe ahemuaghiiza Ebedimeleki, Muesiopia, aghue wantu miongo mitatu aite nawo wakamulavye Yelemia mteghanyi mwe kishima, aishizati kufa. <verse eid="JER 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 38:11" />Kwa ivyoho, Ebedimeleki akawaghua awo wantu miongo mitatu akaita nawo mwe nyumba ya kizumbe, wakaingila mwe taa ja kizumbe. Kulawa umo, Ebedimeleki akaghua shuke na makumbi yashakaeyo, wakamsheezeza Yelemia mwe kishima kwa ughoe. <verse eid="JER 38:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 38:12" />Vikibinda Ebedimeleki, Muesiopia, akamghamba Yelemia aike ayo makumbi mwe magwaha, azise uwo ughoe shi ya ayo makumbi. Yelemia akaghoshola ivyoho. <verse eid="JER 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 38:13" />Vikibinda wakamzuta kwa ngoe, wakamulavya mwe kishima. Yelemia akaita kweikala he ukomea wa waghojo.<verse eid="JER 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sedekia ataombeza vinyanyi kwa Yelemia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 38:14" />Mshi mng'we zumbe Sedekia aakunda kumuona mteghanyi Yelemia. Kwa ivyoho, akaaghiiza Yelemia aetwe he uvi wa ntatu wa nyumba ya Zumbe Mulungu. Uko, zumbe akamghambila Yelemia, “Nikunda nikuuze mbui, ushenifishe kintu chochoshe.”<verse eid="JER 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 38:15" />Yelemia akamhisa zumbe Sedekia, “Ivi, nikikughambila ukweli heunikome? Hata nikikunka vinyanyi heuvitegheleze.”<verse eid="JER 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 38:16" />Kwa ivyoho, zumbe Sedekia akamlapia Yelemia kwa kifisho akighamba, “Sa Zumbe Mulungu atiumbileye avyeishi, senikueke ugwiwe ni awo wekunda kukukoma.”<verse eid="JER 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 38:17" />Vikibinda Yelemia akamghambila zumbe Sedekia, Zumbe Mulungu mwena nguvu zoshe, Mulungu wa Izilaeli, aghamba ivi, “Kati ukikiighaa kwa waghojo wa zumbe wa Babeli, neuvunie ugima wako na mzi heutoighwe moto. Iwe hang'we na wantu wa mbali yako nemuendee kuishi. <verse eid="JER 38:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 38:18" />Miya ukishekiighaa kwa waghojo wa zumbe wa Babeli, unu mzi neughuighwe ni Wakalidayo wohe newauoke, naiwe heudahe kuwanyiika.”<verse eid="JER 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 38:19" />Zumbe Sedekia akamghamba Yelemia, “Naawaogoha Wayahudi wakiighalewo kwa Wakalidayo. Yadahikana Wakalidayo wakaniighala kwa Wayahudi wohe wakanigea shoni.”<verse eid="JER 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 38:20" />Yelemia akamhisa, “Hewakuighale kwawe. Naakuombeza utegheleze achelonga Zumbe Mulungu na kughoshola sa nivyekughambila na mbuli zako nezikuitile vitana na neuvunile ugima wako. <verse eid="JER 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 38:21" />Miya ukishekiighala ng'wenye, unu nee mfumbulo Zumbe Mulungu anionyeshewo. <verse eid="JER 38:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 38:22" />Mwe uwo mfumbulo, naaona wavyele washighalewo mwe nyumba ya kizumbe ya zumbe wa Yuda, wakiighawa kwa waghojo wa zumbe wa Babeli, wohe nee wakighamba kuti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 38:22">‘Wantu wako uwealila wazakulufya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 38:22">wohe wazakudaha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 38:22">Miundi yako izaingila mwe ntope,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 38:22">wazakuhituka na kukueka.’ ”<verse eid="JER 38:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 38:23" />“Wavyele wako woshe na wanao newaighawe kwa Wakalidayo na iwe heudahe kusupuuka, miya neugwiwe ni zumbe wa Babeli na unu mzi neuokwe.”<verse eid="JER 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 38:24" />Zumbe Sedekia akamghambila Yelemia, “Mntu yoyoshe ashezataila izi mbuli tizelonga, wakitaila neukong'we. <verse eid="JER 38:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 38:25" />Waona waambizi wangu wakiiva kuti nizashimoea na iwe, vikibinda wakaiza na kukughamba ‘Tighambile umghambilecho zumbe na zumbe akughambilecho, ushetifishe chochoshe, ukitifisha netikukome.’ <verse eid="JER 38:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 38:26" />Iwe neuwaghambie kuti, ‘Nee nikimuombeza zumbe asheniuze na mwe nyumba ya Yonasani, nishezafiia uko.’ ” <verse eid="JER 38:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 38:27" />Vikibinda, waambizi wa zumbe wakambasha Yelemia, wakamuuza izo mbuli, yohe akawahisa sa zumbe amuaghiizevyo. Nee wakaeka kulonga naye kwa kuti hekuna aivileye shimoezi zawe za kifisho. <verse eid="JER 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 38:28" />Yelemia akashighala he ukomea wa waghojo mpaka mshi mzi wa Yelusalemu uheghuighwa.<verse eid="JER 38:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="JER 39" />
  <para style="s">Mzi wa Yelusalemu utaghuighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 39:1" />Sedekia zumbe wa Yuda, ahegholokela mwe mzi wa Yuda kwa mavui mnane na myezi kenda, Nebukadineza zumbe wa Babeli ateita na waghojo wakwe wakautoa mzi wa Yelusalemu na kuudenga. <verse eid="JER 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 39:2" />Mwe mshi wa kenda ng'wezi wa ne, vui ja muongo mng'we na ng'wenga ja ugholokezi wa zumbe Sedekia, ukando wa mzi ukagandulwa.<verse eid="JER 39:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 39:3" />Vikibinda waambizi wa zumbe wa Babeli wakaingila na kuikala he uvi wa gatigati. Awo waambizi nee ni Neligali Shaleza wa Samugali, Nebo Salisekimu mkulu wa waghojo mwe kaya cha zumbe na Neligali Shaleza mkulu wa waja wemnka zumbe vinyanyi, hang'we na waambizi watuhu woshe wa zumbe wa Babeli.<verse eid="JER 39:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 39:4" />Sedekia yohe zumbe wa Yuda na waghojo wakwe woshe wahewaona kuti mzi wa Yelusalemu uzaghuighwa, wakawanyiika nakio, wakaita se ya mzi, kwa kuzinkia mwe kabuwa ka zumbe, he uvi gati ya nkando mbii, wakaita kwe koongo ja mto Yolidani. <verse eid="JER 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 39:5" />Miya waghojo wa Wakalidayo wakawabasha na kumgwia zumbe Sedekia hantu hashinaho miima uko Yeliko. Wahemgwia wakamuighala kwa Nebukadineza, zumbe wa Babeli ndiye ai mwe mzi wa Libula mwe shi ya Hamasi, yohe akamlaha. <verse eid="JER 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 39:6" />Uko Libula, zumbe wa Babeli akawakoma wana wa kibwanga wa zumbe Sedekia aiwelele kwa mesho yakwe, vingi akawakoma wagholokezi watuhu woshe wa shi ya Yuda. <verse eid="JER 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 39:7" />Vikibinda, akamnkunta Sedekia mesho na kumshunga mpingu na kumuighala Babeli. <verse eid="JER 39:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 39:8" />Waghojo wa Wakalidayo wakaitoa moto nyumba ya kizumbe na nyumba za wantu, na kuzikinya nkando za Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JER 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 39:9" />Vikibinda, Nebuzaladani mkulu wa waghojo wa zumbe, akawaighala Babeli wantu woshe ndiwo waishighale mwe mzi, wantu wakiighalewo kwa zumbe wa Babeli na wantu watuhu wosheni. <verse eid="JER 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 39:10" />Miya Nebuzaladani mkulu wa waghojo wa zumbe, akaeka wantu wagheke wakoshi mwe shi ya Yuda na washikidahawo, akawainka mbuwa za mizabibu na kuwainka mbuwa ntuhu za kuima.<verse eid="JER 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yelemia ataekewa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 39:11" />Nebukadineza zumbe wa Babeli, nee aimuaghiize Nebuzaladani mkulu wa waghojo kwa mbuli ya yelemia kuti, <verse eid="JER 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 39:12" />“Mghue Yelemia umuwelele vitana, ushezamdoa, miya umghosholee chochoshe ndicho akunde.” <verse eid="JER 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 39:13" />Ushe, Nebuzaladani mkulu wa waghojo na Nebushazibani mkulu wa waambizi wa zumbe na Neligali Shaleza mkulu wa waja wemnka zumbe vinyanyi, hang'we na waambizi woshe wa zumbe wa Babeli, <verse eid="JER 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 39:14" />wakawaaghiiza wantu wamulavye Yelemia mwe chumba cha waghojo. Wakamuighala Yelemia kwa Gedalia ng'wana wa Ahikamu, ng'wezukuue ja Shafani, amuuze kaya aikale naye. Yelemia akaikala kaya kwakwe hang'we na wandughu wakwe.<verse eid="JER 39:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zumbe Mulungu ataika kilagha cha kumvunila Ebedimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 39:15" />Haja Yelemia aishungighwe he ukomea wa waghojo, Zumbe Mulungu akamghamba <verse eid="JER 39:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 39:16" />aite akamghambe Ebedimeleki Muesiopia kuti, Zumbe Mulungu mwena nguvu zoshe, Mulungu wa Izilaeli aghamba ivi, “Imi nenibontole zia mbuli nilongiezo, neniushakaze unu mzi na shiyo kuutamiza. Izo mbuli zikizalawiya, neukionee ng'wenye. <verse eid="JER 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 39:17" />Miya mwe uwo mshi, nenikuvunile, heugwiwe ni wantu uweogoha. <verse eid="JER 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 39:18" />Nenikuvunile heukong'we, neniuvunile ugima wako kwa kuti uzanialila imi.” Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.<verse eid="JER 39:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="JER 40" />
  <para style="s">Yelemia ataikala na Gedalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 40:1" />Zumbe Mulungu alonga na Yelemia haja Nebuzaladani mkulu wa waghojo wa zumbe ahemuekea uko Lama. Uyo mkulu wa waghojo ambuiza Yelemia aishungighwe na mnyoo hang'we na wantu watuhu walawiewo Yelusalemu na Yuda ndiwo wakiighawa na mwe shi ya Babeli. <verse eid="JER 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 40:2" />Uyo Nebuzaladani mkulu wa waghojo ahemuona Yelemia akamghamba, “Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu wako aighambile kuti neaete ntogho aha hantu. <verse eid="JER 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 40:3" />Na ivi ushe Zumbe Mulungu azaghoshola sa alongievyo. Ivi vyoshe vilawiye kwa kuti inywi nyoshe muzamghoshoela Zumbe Mulungu uhuza na kushemuiva. <verse eid="JER 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 40:4" />Ushe, nitakuchopoa minyoo ye mwe mikono yako. Tiite hang'we mpaka Babeli kati waakunda, naimi nenikuwelele. Miya kati hukunda kuita naimi, usheize. Waadaha kuita hantu hohoshe uhekunda mwe inu shi uheona kuti ni hatana.” <verse eid="JER 40:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 40:5" />Yelemia aishizati kumhisa, Nebuzaladani akamghamba kuti, “Uya na kwa Gedalia ng'wana wa Ahikamu, ng'wezukuue ja shafani, ashaghulweye ni zumbe wa Babeli aituke mgholokezi wa mizi yoshe ya Yuda, ukaikale naye uko, hambu hita hohoshe hekutamila.” Vikibinda uyo mgholokezi akamnka Yelemia nkande hang'we na vintu vituhu akamueka aite zakwe. <verse eid="JER 40:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 40:6" />Kwa ivyoho Yelemia akaita kwa Gedalia ng'wana wa Ahikamu uko Mizipa na kuikala naye hang'we na wantu washighalewo mwe shi.<verse eid="JER 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gedalia atashimikwa kuituka mgholokezi wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 25:22-24">2 Wazumbe 25:22-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 40:7" />Wagholokezi watuhu wa Yuda na waghojo nee waishizati kukiighala kwa Nebukadineza zumbe wa Babeli. Wakaiva kuti zumbe wa Babeli azamshaghula Gedalia ng'wana wa Ahikamu aituke mgholokezi mwe shi, vingi azamshaghula aituke mgholokezi wa wantu waisiizewo ukiwa mwe shi, washigwizighwewo na kuighawa na mwe shi ya Babeli, yani waghoshi, wavyele na wana. <verse eid="JER 40:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 40:8" />Kwa ivyoho Ishimaeli ng'wana wa Nesania na Yohanani na Yonasani wana wa Kalea na Selaya ng'wana wa Tanihumesi na wana wa Efai wa Munetofa na Yezania ng'wana wa Mmaaka hang'we na wantu wawe, wakambasha Gedalia uko Mizipa. <verse eid="JER 40:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 40:9" />Gedalia ng'wana wa Ahikamu ng'wezukuue ja Shafani akawalapia wo hang'we na mwe mesho ya waghojo wawe, akighamba, “Musheogohe kukiighala kwa Wakalidayo. Ikalai mwe shi na mumtumikile zumbe wa Babeli na mbuli zenyu zoshe nezimiitile vitana. <verse eid="JER 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 40:10" />Imi neniikale Mizipa kunga mwelonga mbuli zenyu kwa Wakalidayo weiza aha. Miya inywi nemuituke mwaashuma zabibu na kuzikoota na kuika divai na kuunganyanya matunda na mafuta ya mzaituni mwe maigha yenyu, vingi nemuikale mwe ndiyo muighue.” <verse eid="JER 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 40:11" />Wayahudi wosheni weikala mwe shi ya Moabu na Amoni na Edomu na mwe shi ntuhu waheiva kuti zumbe wa Babeli azawaeka wantu watuhu washighale Yuda, vingi azamshaghula Gedalia ng'wana wa Ahikamu ng'wezukuue ja Shafani aituke mgholokezi wawe, <verse eid="JER 40:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 40:12" />wakalawa mwe shi ndizo waaiasakanywe, wakauya woshe na mwe shi ya Yuda, uko Mizipa kwa Gedalia. Wakashuma zabibu na matunda mangi mwe mishi zua ja ng'waka.<verse eid="JER 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gedalia atakong'wa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 25:25-26">2 Wazumbe 25:25-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 40:13" />Izo mbuli zihezinka, Yohanani ng'wana wa Kalea hang'we na wakulu wa waghojo ndiwo waishikiighale kwa zumbe wa Babeli wakambasha Gedalia uko Mizipa <verse eid="JER 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 40:14" />wakamghamba, “Ivi hutaila kuti Baalisi zumbe wa Waamoni azamuaghiiza Ishimaeli ng'wana wa Nesania akukome?” Miya Gedalia ng'wana wa Ahikamu hawategheleze. <verse eid="JER 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 40:15" />Vikibinda, Yohanani ng'wana wa Kalea akalonga na Gedalia kwa kifisho uko Mizipa, “Eka niite nikamkome Ishimaeli ng'wana wa Nesania na hekuna mntu yoyoshe ndiye ataile kuti ni ndai amkomieye. Kwai akukome iwe na kueka wantu wosheni wa Yuda waungananewo aha waasakane na Wayahudi washighalewo mwe mzi wa Yuda wakong'we woshe?” <verse eid="JER 40:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 40:16" />Miya Gedalia ng'wana wa Ahikamu akamhisa Yohanani ng'wana wa Kalea, “Ushezaghoshola mbuli sa iyo! Mbuli uyelonga kwa mbuli ya Ishimaeli shiyo ya kweli.”<verse eid="JER 40:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="JER 41" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 41:1" />Mwe ng'wezi wa mfungate, Ishimaeli ng'wana wa Nesania, ng'wezukuue ja Elishama, mweandukia na mwe wavyawa wa kizumbe vingi nee ni mng'we wa wagholokezi mwe kitaa cha zumbe, atebula uko Mizipa kwa Gedalia ng'wana wa Ahikamu aiongozane na wantu muongo mng'we. Waheituka waaja nkande hang'we uko Mizipa, <verse eid="JER 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 41:2" />Ishimaeli ng'wana wa Nesania hang'we na waja wantu muongo mng'we, wateshooa mamundu yawe wakamkoma Gedalia ng'wana wa Ahikamu ng'wezukuue ja Shafani. Gedalia nee ashaghulwaye ni zumbe wa Babeli aituke mgholokezi wawe. <verse eid="JER 41:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 41:3" />Ishimaeli akawakoma wantu wa Yuda ndiwo wai hang'we na Gedalia uko Mizipa na waghojo wa Babeli ndiwo wai aho hantu.<verse eid="JER 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 41:4" />Keloi hakwe wantu waishizati kutaila kuti Gedalia azakong'wa, <verse eid="JER 41:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 41:5" />wateiza wantu miongo mnane kulawa Shekemu na Shilo na Samalia. Nee waimoiye ndezu zawe na shuke nee waizitatue na waikishengieshengie. Wakiituka wainue ntogoo zawe za nkande na ubani kunga wakalavye mwe nyumba ya Zumbe Mulungu. <verse eid="JER 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 41:6" />Kwa ivyoho ushe Ishimaeli ng'wana wa Nesania akauka Mizipa akaita kwewahokela awo wantu uko aakema. Ahedughana nawo akawaghamba, “Kaibui mwe mzi wa Gedalia ng'wana wa Ahikamu.” <verse eid="JER 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 41:7" />Waheingila mwe mzi, Ishimaeli ng'wana wa Nesania hang'we na wantu wakwe muongo mng'we ndiwo aina nawo, wakawakoma na mii yawe wakaigongoosha na mwe kishima. <verse eid="JER 41:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 41:8" />Miya nee kuina wantu muongo mng'we mwe awo wantu aitilewo kwewahokela, wakamghamba Ishimaeli, “Taakuombeza ushetikome! Tina ngano na shayili, mavuta ya mzaituni na woki tifishizevyo mwe ubuwa.” Kwa ivyoho hawakomie. <verse eid="JER 41:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 41:9" />Chiya kishima Ishimaeli agongooshezecho zia maiti za waja wantu akomiewo, ni chiya kishima kikulu chafukwacho ni zumbe Asa kunga akifishe mwe ija mishi ahezaingiiwa ni Baasha zumbe wa Izilaeli. Ishimaeli ng'wana wa Nesania akamemeeza maiti za wantu akomiewo mwe icho kishima. <verse eid="JER 41:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 41:10" />Ishimaeli akawagwia wana wa kindele wa zumbe hang'we na wantu wosheni washighalawo uko Mizipa, waja wainkiwawo ni Nebuzaladani mkulu wa waghojo kwa Gedalia ng'wana Ahikamu awagholokele. Ishimaeli ng'wana wa Nesania akawaghua awo wantu awagwizilewo kwa nguvu akaomboka nawo kuita kwa Waamoni. <verse eid="JER 41:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 41:11" />Yohanani ng'wana wa Kalea hang'we na wagholokezi woshe wa waghojo waheiva mbuli zosheni Ishimaeli ng'wana wa Nesania aghosholezo, <verse eid="JER 41:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 41:12" />wakawaunganyanya wantu wawe wosheni wakaita kwetoana na Ishimaeli ng'wana wa Nesania, wakambuiza he bwawa kulu jeuko Gibeoni. <verse eid="JER 41:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 41:13" />Wantu woshe ndiwo waigwizighwe ni Ishimaeli wahemuona du Yohanani ng'wana wa Kalea hang'we na wagholokezi wa waghojo wakatamilwa. <verse eid="JER 41:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 41:14" />Kwa ivyoho, waja wantu wosheni ndiwo waighuighwe ni Ishimaeli kulawa Mizipa, wakahituka na kumbasha Yohanani ng'wana wa Kalea. <verse eid="JER 41:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 41:15" />Miya Ishimaeli ng'wana wa Nesania hang'we na waja wantu mnane wakamnyiika Yohanani, wakaghuukia kwa Waamoni. <verse eid="JER 41:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 41:16" />Vikibinda Yohanani ng'wana wa Kalea na wagholokezi wa waghojo ndiwo wai hang'we naye, wakawavunila wantu woshe washighalewo uko Mizipa haja Gedalia ng'wana wa Ahikamu ahezakong'wa, yani waghojo, wavyele, wana na wagholokezi wa waghojo alawiewo nawo uko Gibeoni. <verse eid="JER 41:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 41:17" />Wakakihima na ntambo, wakanaikala kwe mzi wa Gelusi Kimuhamu hehi na Betilehemu, ndiho wakikiighanya kuita Misii, <verse eid="JER 41:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 41:18" />kunga wawanyiike Wakalidayo. Wawaiva wogha kwa kuti, Ishimaeli ng'wana wa Nesania nee aimkomie Gedalia ng'wana wa Ahikamu, ashaghulwaye ni zumbe wa Babeli aituke mgholokezi mwe shi.<verse eid="JER 41:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="JER 42" />
  <para style="s">Wantu watamuombeza Yelemia awavikile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 42:1" />Vikibinda wagholokezi woshe wa waghojo na Yohanani ng'wana wa Kalea na Yezania ng'wana wa Hoshaya hang'we na wantu woshe wakulu na wadodo, <verse eid="JER 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 42:2" />wakambasha Yelemia na kumghamba kuti, “Taaombeza utegheleze tivyekuombeza, utivikile kwa Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu wako, ishwi woshe tishighalewo, kwa kuti nee tiiwangi, miya iviaha tishighale wagheke du sa uvyeona. <verse eid="JER 42:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 42:3" />Vika, kunga Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu wako, ationyeshe sia ayekunda tizinkiie na mbuli tizekundighwa tighoshole.” <verse eid="JER 42:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 42:4" />Mteghanyi Yelemia akawahisa, “Nizamiiva, nenimvike Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu wenyu, sa muniombezevyo, mbuli yoyoshe ndiyo Zumbe Mulungu anighambile, nenimighambile, senimifishe kintu chochoshe.” <verse eid="JER 42:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 42:5" />Vikibinda wantu wakamghambila Yelemia, “Zumbe Mulungu neaituke muona mkweli kwetu kati hetighoshole via Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu wako akuaghiizevyo utighambile. <verse eid="JER 42:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 42:6" />Vikiituka ni mbuli ntana hambu mbada kwetu, ishwi netimuive Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu weshu akuaghiizeye iwe kunga mbuli zeshu ziituke ntana tikimuiva Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu weshu.”<verse eid="JER 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zumbe Mulungu atahisa mviko wa Yelemia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 42:7" />Mishi muongo mng'we ihezinka, Zumbe Mulungu akalonga na Yelemia. <verse eid="JER 42:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 42:8" />Yelemia akamuitanga Yohanani ng'wana wa Kalea na wagholokezi wa waghojo ndiwo wai hang'we naye na wantu watuhu wosheni wakulu kwa wadodo. <verse eid="JER 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 42:9" />Akawaghamba, “Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu wa Izilaeli muniaghiizeye kwakwe niighale mviko wenyu, aghamba ivi, <verse eid="JER 42:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 42:10" />‘Waona mwahema mwe inu shi, nenimitogheshe na hemuituke wabovu, nenimieke muonee na hemushamizwe vingi, kwa kuti ntogho nimieteezo zizanigea usoyoyo. <verse eid="JER 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 42:11" />Mushemuogohe zumbe wa Babeli muyemuogoha, ehe mushemuogohe, kwa kuti imi ni hang'we na inywi nimivunile na kumiusha mwe mikono yakwe. Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo. <verse eid="JER 42:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 42:12" />Kwa kuti imi naamiivila mbazi, yohe nenimghalushe amiivile mbazi na kumiuza na mwe shi yenyu.’ ”<verse eid="JER 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 42:13" />“Miya mukishemuiva Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu wenyu na mukighamba, ‘Hetikunda kuikala mwe inu shi, <verse eid="JER 42:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 42:14" />miya netikaikale mwe shi ya Misii, hantu hashinaho nkondo hambu vuzo ja magunda ya nkondo na hashinaho saa, <verse eid="JER 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 42:15" />teghelezai avyelonga Zumbe Mulungu inywi wantu mushighalewo mwe shi ya Yuda.’ Zumbe Mulungu mwena nguvu zoshe, Mulungu wa Izilaeli aghamba ivi, ‘Kati muzakunda kuita kweikala mwe shi ya Misii, <verse eid="JER 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 42:16" />nkondo muzeogoha nezimibuize ghuko uko kwe shi ya Misii, na saa muyeogoha, neilawiye uko Misii na nemufiie uko. <verse eid="JER 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 42:17" />Wantu woshe wefanyanya kuita kweikala kwe shi ya Misii, newafe kwa nkondo na kwa saa na kwa matamu, na hekuna mntu yoyoshe ndiye ashighale wala kuhona kwa mbuli ya ntogho ndizo niwaetee.’ ”<verse eid="JER 42:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 42:18" />“Kwa kuti imi Zumbe Mulungu mwena nguvu, Mulungu wa Izilaeli, naghamba ivi, ‘Sa via nikweighwevyo ni maya kwa mbuli ya wantu wa Yelusalemu, nee ndivyo munikweze maya mukiita Misii. Nemuituke kintu cha kushweea ute na chegea wogha na cha kukaaiziza na chegea shoni na inu shi hemuiyone vingi.’ ” <verse eid="JER 42:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 42:19" />Yelemia akahimba kuwaghambila, “Inywi wantu mushighalewo mwe shi ya Yuda, Zumbe Mulungu azamighambila kuti musheite Misii. Tailai ushe kuti lelo nizamishunda, <verse eid="JER 42:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 42:20" />kwa kuti, muzakigea mwe masa muheniaghiiza nikamivikile kwa Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu wenyu, vikibinda nimighambile kia ndicho anighambile, nainywi nemughoshole. <verse eid="JER 42:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 42:21" />Lelo imi nizamighambila, miya hemutegheleze mbuli yoyoshe niaghiizweyo ni Zumbe Mulungu nimighambile. <verse eid="JER 42:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 42:22" />Kwa ivyoho ushe tailai kuti, hantu muhekunda kuita kweikala, nemufiie ghuko kwa nkondo na kwa saa na kwa matamu.”<verse eid="JER 42:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="JER 43" />
  <para style="s">Yelemia ataighawa Misii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 43:1" />Yelemia ahebinda kuwaghambila wantu mbuli zoshe aaghiizwezo ni Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu wawe awaghambile, <verse eid="JER 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 43:2" />Azalia ng'wana wa Hoshaya na Yohanani ng'wana wa Kalea na wantu woshe wena utii wakamghamba Yelemia, “Iwe ulonga lufyo! Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu weshu hakuaghiize utighambile kuti tishezaita kweikala Misii. <verse eid="JER 43:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 43:3" />Baluku ng'wana wa Nelia aakushonganya na ishwi utighambile izo mbuli kunga tigwiwe ni Wakalidayo, watikome hambu watiighale Babeli.” <verse eid="JER 43:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 43:4" />Ushe Yohanani ng'wana wa Kalea na wagholokezi woshe wa waghojo na wantu wosheni hewamuivile Zumbe Mulungu awaaghiizevyo, wakahimba kuikala mwe shi ya Yuda. <verse eid="JER 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 43:5" />Miya Yohanani ng'wana wa Kalea na wagholokezi wosheni wa waghojo, wakawaghua wantu wosheni wa Yuda washighalewo, wauyawo kulawa mwe shi zosheni ndiko waighuukeko nako. <verse eid="JER 43:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 43:6" />Vingi wakawaghua waghoshi woshe na wavyele na wana wa kibwanga na wa kindee hang'we na wana wa kindee wa zumbe waashighwawo ni Nebuzaladani mgholokezi wa waghojo hang'we na Gedalia ng'wana wa Ahikamu, ng'wezukuue ja Shafani vingi wakamghua mteghanyi Yelemia na Baluku ng'wana wa Nelia. <verse eid="JER 43:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 43:7" />Kwa ivyoho wakaita na mwe shi ya Misii, wakabula mwe mzi wa Tahipanesi. Ivyo nee waemelavyo kumuiva Zumbe Mulungu.<verse eid="JER 43:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 43:8" />Waaiuko Tahipanesi, Zumbe Mulungu akamghamba Yelemia, <verse eid="JER 43:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 43:9" />“Ghuwa mawe makulu mangahi ukayashiiye mwe shanga ya kilongo mwe sia izengighweyo kwa matufai he zuvi ja kuingiila mwe kitaa cha zumbe wa Misii uko Tahipanesi. <verse eid="JER 43:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 43:10" />Vikibinda uwaghambile wantu wa Yuda kuti, imi Zumbe Mulungu nena nguvu zoshe, Mulungu wa Izilaeli nenimuete mtung'wa wangu Nebukadineza zumbe wa Babeli, vingi nenichiike kiti chakwe cha uzumbe ulanga ya aya mawe nishiieyo aha, yohe neakime kumbi jakwe ja kizumbe ulanga ya ayo mawe. <verse eid="JER 43:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 43:11" />Zumbe Nebukadineza akizaiza kweitoa shi ya Misii, waja wekundighwa kufa kwa matamu, newafe, neawagwie waja wekundighwa kugwiwa na neawakome waja wekundighwa kufa kwa nkondo. <verse eid="JER 43:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 43:12" />Nenimueke zumbe Nebukadineza aoke nyumba za kuvikila mulungu zeuko Misii, yohe neaighue iyo mulungu yawe na kuiighala Babeli. Neaghue kia kintu kitana mwe shi ya Misii na kuuka bia sungu yoyoshe. <verse eid="JER 43:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 43:13" />Ndai ya nyumba ya mulungu ya zua mwe shi ya Misii, neakinye shiki za miviko na kuoka nyumba za kuvikila mulungu ya Misii.”<verse eid="JER 43:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="JER 44" />
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya Zumbe Mulungu kwa Wayahudi we mwe shi ya Misii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 44:1" />Inu nee mbuli Zumbe Mulungu alongieyo na Yelemia kwa mbuli ya wantu wa Yuda waikalawo mwe shi ya Misii mwe mizi ya Migidoli na Tahipanesi na Memufisi na weikala wazu wa kusini wa shi ya Misii. <verse eid="JER 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 44:2" />Zumbe Mulungu mwena nguvu zoshe, Mulungu wa Izilaeli aghamba ivi, “Mwaaona mbuli zosheni mbada naetazo mwe mzi wa Yelusalemu na mwe mizi yosheni ya Yuda. Iyo mizi lelo izaghaluka mahuzu na hekuna mntu mweikala uko. <verse eid="JER 44:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 44:3" />Vizaituka ivyoho kwa mbuli ya ubanasi mughosholewo, muzanikweza maya kwa kuiokea ubani na kuitumikila mulungu mushiitailayo inywi wenye, washiitailayo wo wala baba zawe. <verse eid="JER 44:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 44:4" />Mishi yoshe nee nikiwaaghiiza watung'wa wangu wateghanyi kwenyu, wamighambilewo musheghoshole mbuli mbada yenikweza maya. <verse eid="JER 44:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 44:5" />Miya hekuna aniteghelezeye wala kuniiva, wakaemela kueka ubanasi wawe na kueka kuokea ubani mulungu mituhu. <verse eid="JER 44:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 44:6" />Kwa ivyoho, maya yangu yakakwea sa moto na kuoka mizi ya Yuda na mwe nkiii za Yelusalemu, zikaituka nyumba zigomokezo na mahuzu sa viivyo ivi lelo.”<verse eid="JER 44:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 44:7" />Kwa ivyoho ushe, Zumbe Mulungu mwena nguvu zoshe, Mulungu wa Izilaeli aghamba ivi, “Kwai mwaakietela ubanasi mkulu ndiwo umieke, wavyele na waghoshi na wana wadodo na wana wankebe wakong'we mwe shi ya Yuda kusheshighale hata mntu mng'we? <verse eid="JER 44:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 44:8" />Kwai mwanikweza maya kwa kuvika mulungu mukighosholeeyo na kuiokea ubani mulungu mituhu mwe shi ya Misii muizileko kweikala? Nemukikome wenye na kuituka wantu wa kubewa na wena ute mwe mesho ya wantu wa mbali zosheni za mwe shi. <verse eid="JER 44:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 44:9" />Kwani mutejaa ubanasi wa baba zenyu na ubanasi wa wazumbe wa Yuda na ubanasi wa wavyele wawe na ubanasi wenyu na wavyele wenyu, mwaughosholawo mwe shi ya Yuda na mwe nkiii za Yelusalemu? <verse eid="JER 44:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 44:10" />Mpaka ivi lelo hemudee ama kuninka ishima wala kutongela kanwa changu na ng'wiko nimiikilewo inywi na baba zenyu.”<verse eid="JER 44:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 44:11" />“Kwa ivyoho, imi Zumbe Mulungu nena nguvu zoshe, Mulungu wa Izilaeli, nizafanyanya kumietea ntogho na kuwakoma wantu woshe wa Yuda. <verse eid="JER 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 44:12" />Neniwaushe wantu wa Yuda washighalewo, waja wekunda kuita kweikala Misii. Neniwakomee ghuko, wetaikana na washitaikanawo, newafe kwa uhamba hambu kwa saa. Nemuituke wantu wena ute na wa kubewa, wantu wa kukaaizwa na wegea shoni. <verse eid="JER 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 44:13" />Neniwatoe waja waizilewo kweikala mwe shi ya Misii sa via niwatoilevyo wantu wa Yelusalemu kwa nkondo, kwa saa na kwa matamu. <verse eid="JER 44:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 44:14" />Kwa ivyoho hekuituke na mntu yoyoshe mwe wantu wa Yuda washighalewo na kuiza kweikala mwe shi ya Misii, ndiye anyiike, ndiye ahone hambu kuuya na mwe shi ya Yuda, wayekunda kuuya na kuikala uko. Hewauye, miya nekuuye wantu wagheke du ndiwo waituke watanyiika nkondo.”<verse eid="JER 44:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 44:15" />Vikibinda, waghoshi woshe watailewo kuti wakazie wawe nee wakiiokela ubani mulungu mituhu na wavyele woshe ndiwo wai aho, yani bumba kulu ja wantu wa Yuda ndiwo wakiikala wazu wa kusini mwe shi ya Misii wakamghamba Yelemia kuti, <verse eid="JER 44:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 44:16" />“Izi mbuli za Zumbe Mulungu utighambilezo hetizitegheleze. <verse eid="JER 44:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 44:17" />Netighoshole kia kintu tighambilecho kuti netichighoshole. Netimuokee ubani malikia wa kwe lwingu na kumgeea ntogoo za vyanywa sa ndivyo tikighoshola ishwi na baba zeshu, wazumbe lweshu na wagholokezi yweshu mwe mizi ya Yuda na mwe sia za Yelusalemu. Mwe iyo mishi, nee tiina nkande nyingi, taaonea na hetibuzighwe ni ntogho yoyoshe. <verse eid="JER 44:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 44:18" />Miya kuanduka tiekilevyo kumuokea ubani malikia wa kwe lwingu na kumgeea ntogoo za vyanywa, hetionee kintu chochoshe, na wandughu weshu wazaituka wakifa kwa nkondo na kwa saa.”<verse eid="JER 44:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 44:19" />Na awo wavyele wakahimba kughamba kuti, “Ufanyanya kuti nee tikimuokea ubani na kumgeea ntogoo za vyanywa malikia wa kwe lwingu na kughoshola mikate sa cheni chakwe chiivyo bia waghoshi weshu kutaila? Shivyo ivyo.”<verse eid="JER 44:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 44:20" />Nee Yelemia ahewaghambila waghoshi na wavyele ndiwo wakishimoea naye, <verse eid="JER 44:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 44:21" />“Kwani mufanyanya kuti Zumbe Mulungu hafukile na kuntongonyeza kwa mbuli ya ubani mumuokeewo ye ng'wenye mwe mizi ya Yuda, inywi hang'we na baba zenyu na wazumbe na wagholokezi wenyu na wantu woshe mwe sia za Yelusalemu? <verse eid="JER 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 44:22" />Zumbe Mulungu ahezaituka hadaha kuzizimiza kwa mbuli ya ubanasi wenyu na mbuli zemuihiza mughosholezo, shi yenyu izaituka na ute na nkeiikawa ni wantu mpaka ivi lelo. <verse eid="JER 44:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 44:23" />Izi ntogho zilawiiye kwa kuti, muzaiokea ubani mulungu na kughoshola uhuza kwa Zumbe Mulungu na muzaemela kumuiva na hemutongele kanwa chakwe, ng'wiko na maaghiizo yakwe.”<verse eid="JER 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 44:24" />Vikibinda Yelemia akawaghambila wantu woshe hang'we na wavyele woshe kuti, “Teghelezai mbuli ya Zumbe Mulungu, inywi wantu wa Yuda mwe umu mwe shi ya Misii. <verse eid="JER 44:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 44:25" />Zumbe Mulungu mwena nguvu zoshe, Mulungu wa Izilaeli, aghamba ivi, ‘Inywi hang'we na wakazie wenyu muzaghoshola zia mbuli mulongiezo kwa vyanwa vyenyu mukighamba kuti, nemubontole shogha zenyu muikilezo kuti nemumulaviize ntogolo na kumgeea chanywa malikia wa kwe lwingu. Tozai shogha zenyu na kulavya ntogolo za vyanywa.’ <verse eid="JER 44:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 44:26" />Miya teghelezai mbuli yangu imi Zumbe Mulungu, inywi wantu woshe wa Yuda mweikala mwe shi ya Misii. Imi Zumbe Mulungu nitaja mlape kwa zina jangu kulu kuti, hekuna mntu yoyoshe alawieye mwe shi ya Yuda mweikala mwe shi ya Misii, ndiye alape vingi kwa zina jangu akighamba, ‘Sa Zumbe Mulungu avyeishi.’ <verse eid="JER 44:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 44:27" />Naamifanyanyiiza kumietea mbuli mbada na shiyo ntana. Wantu woshe wa Yuda weuko Misii newakong'we kwa nkondo na kwa saa mpaka ndiho washie woshe. <verse eid="JER 44:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 44:28" />Waja ndiwo wadahe kunyiika kwe nkondo kulawa mwe shi ya Misii na kuuya na mwe shi ya Yuda, newaituke wagheke. Aho nee ndiho wantu wa Yuda washighalewo na kuiza kweikala Misii, wataile kuti ni mbuli yangu hambu ni mbuli yawe ndiyo ibontoke. <verse eid="JER 44:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 44:29" />Inu nee ndiyo iituke ntangilo kwenyu. Imi Zumbe Mulungu nenimitoe haha aha kunga mutaile kuti mbuli yangu ya kumitoa ndiyo nikimighambila neilawiiye. <verse eid="JER 44:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 44:30" />Nenimueke Hofula zumbe wa Misii agwiwe ni wankuu wakwe waja wekunda kumkoma, sa Sedekia zumbe wa Yuda agwizighwevyo ni wankuu wakwe, yani Nebukadineza zumbe wa Babeli mnkulu wakwe akundieye kumkoma.” Ni miyo zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.<verse eid="JER 44:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="JER 45" />
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya Zumbe Mulungu kwa Baluku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 45:1" />Inu nee mbuli mteghanyi Yelemia amghambilayo Baluku ng'wana wa Nelia mwe vui ja ne ja ugholokezi wa Yehoyakimu ng'wana wa Yosia zumbe wa Yuda, haja Baluku ahebinda kugonda mwe gondwe mbuli zosheni ashimoeezo Yelemia. Yelemia aamghambila Baluku <verse eid="JER 45:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 45:2" />kuti, Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu wa Izilaeli aghamba ivi kwa mbuli yako, “Iwe Baluku <verse eid="JER 45:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 45:3" />waaghamba kuti, ‘Changu ndicho! Zumbe Mulungu azaeka kuumia kwangu kuisiize, nizatibuka kwa kukema wala sihona.’ ”<verse eid="JER 45:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 45:4" />Iwe Baluku, Zumbe Mulungu ateniaghiiza nikughambile kuti, “Nenibane inu shi nizengileyo ng'wenye na neninkunte kia kintu nihandilecho. Nenighoshole ivyoho mwe shi zoshe. <verse eid="JER 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 45:5" />Ivi, ukiondeea mbuli nkulu kwa mbuli yako iwe ng'wenye? Usheziondeeze! Ekana nazo kwa kuti, neniete sungu kwa wantu woshe, miya hohoshe ndiho uite nenikuvunile ugima wako du.” Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.<verse eid="JER 45:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="JER 46" />
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya Zumbe Mulungu kwa Wamisii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 46:1" />Inu nee mbuli Zumbe Mulungu amghambilayo Yelemia, kwa mbuli ya wantu wa mbali zoshe, <verse eid="JER 46:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 46:2" />kwa mbuli ya Misii na waghojo woshe wa Neko zumbe wa Misii, watoanawo na Nebukadineza zumbe wa Babeli, wakadahighwa uko Kalikemishi kwe mto Eufulate, mwe vui ja ne ja ugholokezi wa Yehoyakimu ng'wana wa Yosia zumbe wa Yuda.<verse eid="JER 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 46:3" />“Wagholokezi wa waghojo wa Misii watabiikila kuti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:3">‘Ighanyai ngao zenyu nkulu na ndodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:3">mulawe mukatoane nkondo!<verse eid="JER 46:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 46:4" />Ighanyai faashi zenyu na muzikwee,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:4">kia mntu neaikale hantu hakwe na muzwike nkofia za chuma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:4">Noai maguha yenyu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:4">Zwikai shuke zenyu za chuma!’”<verse eid="JER 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 46:5" />Zumbe Mulungu atauza, “Ni mbwai ivi nivyeona?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:5">“Niona wazagewa wogha, watauya mghongo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:5">Waghojo wawe wekidaha wazatoighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:5">wataghuuka kwa wogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:5">hewawelela mghongo.<verse eid="JER 46:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 46:6" />Wantu wedaha kughuuka wazahewa kughuuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:6">waghojo hewadaha kusupuuka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:6">Uko wazu wa kasikazini hehi na mto Eufulate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:6">watakitoa na kugwa.<verse eid="JER 46:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 46:7" />Ni ndai uyo mwekiiva sa mto Nile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:7">mto wemema mazi yakaingila kwe vidau?<verse eid="JER 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 46:8" />Ni shi ya Misii yekiiva sa mto Nile umemilewo mazi yakaingila kwe vidau,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:8">sa mto wena makumbo ya mazi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:8">Misii yaaghamba, ‘Nenimeme na kughubika ngulu ngima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:8">neniibane mizi na wantu wakwe.<verse eid="JER 46:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 46:9" />Kihimei kughuuka inywi faashi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:9">na magai ya nkondo yaite nguzunguzu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:9">Kihimei inywi waghojo mwekidaha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:9">inywi wantu wa Esiopia na Libia mutozizewo ngao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:9">inywi wantu wa Lidia mwedaha kutoa maosa.’ ”<verse eid="JER 46:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 46:10" />Uwo mshi, ni mshi wa Zumbe Mulungu mwena nguvu zoshe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:10">ni mshi wa kuihiiza nkuu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:10">mshi wa kuwatoa wankuu wakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:10">Uhamba neuwakome woshe mpaka wiighute,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:10">neuvate mpome zawe mpaka ushishiwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:10">Kwa kuti Zumbe Mulungu mwena nguvu zoshe atalavya ntogoo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:10">wazu wa kasikazini kwe mto Eufulate.<verse eid="JER 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 46:11" />Kweai Gileadi inywi wantu wa Misii</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:11">mukaonde mizighi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:11">Muzanywa mizighi mingi miya hemuhonie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:11">kwa kuti hekuna umihonyizewo.<verse eid="JER 46:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 46:12" />Mbali zoshe zizaiva mugeighwevyo shoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:12">kiio chenyu chizabula kia hantu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:12">Waghojo wenyu watatoana vikumbo wenye kwa wenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:12">woshe wazagwa.<verse eid="JER 46:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zumbe Nebukadineza ataitoa shi ya Misii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 46:13" />Nebukadineza zumbe wa Babeli ahezaita kweitoa shi ya Misii, Zumbe Mulungu aamghamba Yelemia,<verse eid="JER 46:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 46:14" />“Biikia mwe shi ya Misii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:14">biikia uko Migidoli na Memufisi na uko Tahipanesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:14">‘Waghambile wakiighanye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:14">kwa kuti nkondo neiwakome woshe we hehi na iwe!<verse eid="JER 46:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 46:15" />Kwai waghojo wako wekidaha wazaghuuka? Kwai mulungu wako Apisi nkadaha kumiambiza?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:15">Nkadaha kugholoka kwa kuti, imi Zumbe Mulungu nizamkinya!’<verse eid="JER 46:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 46:16" />Waghojo wenyu wazakitoa na kugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:16">kia mng'we atamghamba nyiae,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:16">‘Kihime tiuye kaya kwa wandughu weshu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:16">tinyiike mata ya mnkuu!’ ”<verse eid="JER 46:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 46:17" />“Mnkei zumbe wa Misii zina hya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:17">‘Mtua vuzo mweaza muda.’<verse eid="JER 46:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 46:18" />Imi Zumbe Mulungu nena nguvu zoshe, ni miyo zumbe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:18">Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nemoyo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:18">Sa kitui Taboli chiivyo kitai kuzinka vyoshe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:18">na sa kitui cha Kalimeli chivyeonekea kulawa kwe bahai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:18">nee ndivyo ziituke nguvu za mweiza kwemitoa.<verse eid="JER 46:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 46:19" />Inywi wantu woshe mweikala Misii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:19">kiighanyei kuita kwe shi ya utung'wa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:19">Mzi wa Memufisi neubanighwe vigima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:19">neughaluke mahuzu yashiikalwayo ni wantu.<verse eid="JER 46:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 46:20" />Misii ni sa kadama kamoi kaginieko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:20">miya nekaung'we ni nguha kulawa wazu wa kasikazini.<verse eid="JER 46:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 46:21" />Hata waghojo wakwe aombezewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:21">hewana uwambizi wowoshe, ni sa vidama viginievyo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:21">Hewadaha kutoana nkondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:21">woshe wazahituka na kughuuka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:21">Mushi wawe wa kutoighwa uzabula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:21">muda wawe wa kukong'wa uzabula.<verse eid="JER 46:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 46:22" />Waghojo wa Misii watanyiika kwa kusuumuka sa nyoka yeghuuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:22">haja wankuu wawe wakiwaizila kwa nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:22">newawatoe na machoka sa vinga ni wantu weita kwekinya miti.<verse eid="JER 46:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 46:23" />Newawashenge wantu wa Misii sa miti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:23">kwa kuti waghojo wawe ni wangi washitaikawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:23">ni wangi sa mpasi.<verse eid="JER 46:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 46:24" />Wantu wa Misii newagewe shoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:24">newagwiwe ni wantu wa kasikazini.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:24">Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.<verse eid="JER 46:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 46:25" />Zumbe Mulungu mwena nguvu zoshe, Mulungu wa Izilaeli aghamba ivi, “Imi nenimtoe Amoni mulungu yevikwa ni wantu wa Sebesi, hang'we na mulungu yoshe ya Misii na wazumbe wakwe. Nenimtoe zumbe wa Misii hang'we na woshe wemualila. <verse eid="JER 46:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 46:26" />Neniwaeke wagwiwe ni Nebukadineza zumbe wa Babeli na waghojo wakwe wekunda kuwakoma. Vikibinda, shi ya Misii neiikawe vingi ni wantu sa aho boosi.” Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.<verse eid="JER 46:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zumbe Mulungu neawavunile wantu wakwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 46:27" />“Musheogohe inywi watung'wa wangu wavyawa wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:27">usheangwe ni moyo iwe Izilaeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:27">Kweli nemiuze kaya kulawa shi hale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:27">neniwauze wavyawa wako kulawa kwe shi ya ugheni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:27">Nemuuye muikale kwa mpolele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:27">na hekuna ndiye amigee wogha.<verse eid="JER 46:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 46:28" />Imi ni hang'we na iwe nikuvunie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:28">Hang'we na kuti mbali zosheni nenizikome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:28">uko kwawe nikuasakanyiizeko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:28">miya inywi senimikome.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:28">Nenimilahe kwa mbuli ya uhuza mughosholewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:28">senimieke bia kumilaha.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 46:28">Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.<verse eid="JER 46:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="JER 47" />
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya Zumbe Mulungu kwa Wafilisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 47:1" />Zumbe wa Misii aishizati kuitoa Gaza, Zumbe Mulungu akalonga na Yelemia kwa mbuli ya Wafilisiti. <verse eid="JER 47:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 47:2" />Akaghamba ivi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 47:2">“Welela ivyo mazi yavyekwea kulawa wazu wa kasikazini</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 47:2">na yataituka mafuliko yena nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 47:2">neyaighubike shi ngima na vintu vyoshe vyeumo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 47:2">mizi na wantu weikala umo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 47:2">Wantu newaiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 47:2">woshe weikala mwe shi newasininike.<verse eid="JER 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 47:3" />Newaive shindo za nkwato za faashi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 47:3">vuzo ja magai ya nkondo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 47:3">na shindo za mataili yawe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 47:3">Waghoshi hewahituke mghongo kuwaambiza wana wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 47:3">mikono yawe neiyegheeke.<verse eid="JER 47:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 47:4" />Mushi wa kuwakoma Wafilisiti woshe uzabula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 47:4">na kuwakoma wantu woshe washighalewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 47:4">waja ambawo wangeiza kweiambiza mizi ya Tilo na Sidoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 47:4">Imi Zumbe Mulungu neniwakoma Wafilisiti woshe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 47:4">awa waizilewo kulawa sheja ya kisiwa cha Kafutoli.<verse eid="JER 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 47:5" />Wantu wa Gaza newamoe vinoo kunga wasininike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 47:5">mzi wawe wa Ashikeloni neuhoe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 47:5">Inywi wantu mushighalewo kulawa sheja ya bahai ya Meditelania, nemukishengeshenge kwa kusininika mpaka ini?<verse eid="JER 47:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 47:6" />Wafilisiti wataghamba, ‘Zumbe Mulungu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 47:6">Neuwahaze ini wankuu weshu waeke kutikoma kwa mahamba yawe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 47:6">Waghambe wauze mahamba yawe na mwe maala yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 47:6">wayaike mahamba yawe yaheme!’<verse eid="JER 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 47:7" />Miya ayo mahamba neyadahe zeze kuhema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 47:7">kunu imi Zumbe Mulungu niiyainkile ndima ya kughoshola?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 47:7">Niiyaaghiize yautoe mzi wa Ashikeloni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 47:7">na wantu weikala sheja ya bahai.”<verse eid="JER 47:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="JER 48" />
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya Zumbe Mulungu kwe mzi wa Moabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 48:1" />Zumbe Mulungu mwena nguvu zoshe, Mulungu wa Izilaeli, aghamba ivi kwa mbuli ya Moabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:1">“Chenyu ndicho inywi wantu wa Nebo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:1">kwa kuti mzi wenyu neubanighwe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:1">Wantu wa mzi wa Kiliasaimu newagewe shoni na kugwiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:1">ukando wakwe mkulu neukinywe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:1">na wantu wakwe weikala umo newagewe shoni.<verse eid="JER 48:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 48:2" />Kutaikana kwa Moabu nekushie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:2">wankuu weuko Heshiboni wafanyanya kuukinya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:2">‘Haya, soi tiwakome awa wantu washetaikane vingi mwe shi!’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:2">Inywi wantu wa mzi wa Madimena nemutongomazwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:2">waghojo wa wankuu newamiizile.<verse eid="JER 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 48:3" />Nkoo zaaivikana uko Holonaimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:3">ziivikana kwa mbuli ya nkumbizi na ubanasi mkulu!”<verse eid="JER 48:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 48:4" />“Shi ya Moabu neibanighwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:4">kukema kwakwe nekuivikane mpaka uko Soali.<verse eid="JER 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 48:5" />Wahoniewo kwe nkondo watakwea kuita Luhisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:5">uku watoa nkoo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:5">Kwe sia yeita Holonaimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:5">kwaaivikana nkoo kwa mbuli ya ubanasi.<verse eid="JER 48:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 48:6" />Ghuukai muvunile ugima wenyu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:6">Ghuukai sa mpunda za tundui zivyeghuuka mwe ughongo!”<verse eid="JER 48:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 48:7" />“Iwe Moabu, waalila nguvu zako na kiiko chako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:7">miya ushe hata iwe neugwiwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:7">mulungu wako Kemoshi neaighawe kwe shi ya ugheni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:7">hang'we na wavikizi wakwe na wantu wemghoshoela ndima.<verse eid="JER 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 48:8" />Mkomi neazinke kia hantu mwe mzi na hekuna mzi ndiwo uhone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:8">wantu weikala mwe koongo na waja we kwe vitui newakong'we.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:8">Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.<verse eid="JER 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 48:9" />Mfukiei Moabu mbiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:9">kwa kuti kweli neakong'we,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:9">mizi yakwe neiituke mahuzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:9">hekuituke na mntu yoyoshe mweikala umo.”<verse eid="JER 48:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 48:10" />Ana ute mweghoshola ndima ya Zumbe Mulungu kwa uvizu, ana ute mntu mweemela uhamba wakwe ushekome!<verse eid="JER 48:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mizi ya Moabu itabanighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 48:11" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, “Wantu weikala mwe shi ya Moabu wazaikala kwa mpolele kuanduka shi yawe iyandushwe, hewataila kuighawa kwe shi ya ugheni. Waitongomale sa divai ye mwe igha, ishigeighweyo na mwe igha tuhu. Kwa ivyoho wakena muiye sa divai na mzingo wawe mtana sa ndivyo waivyo.”<verse eid="JER 48:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 48:12" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba, “Mshi waaiza ndiho niighale wankuu ndiwo wawatoe wantu wa Moabu sa wantu wavyeitila divai. Newaiitie na kueka maigha bue, newayatue vibae bae. <verse eid="JER 48:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 48:13" />Vikibinda wantu wa Moabu newamuone mulungu wawe Kemoshi hana uwambizi, sa via wantu wa Izilaeli wamuenevyo Baseli ashinavyo uwambizi, mulungu wamualileye.”<verse eid="JER 48:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 48:14" />“Mudaha zeze kughamba, ‘Ishwi ti waghojo tedaha nkondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:14">wantu tena nguvu nyingi za kutoana nkondo?’<verse eid="JER 48:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 48:15" />Wantu wa Moabu newabanighwe na mizi yawe neigwiwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:15">wabwanga wakwe wekidaha newachinjwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:15">Ni miyo zumbe, Zumbe Mulungu nena nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:15">nilongiewo.<verse eid="JER 48:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 48:16" />Kukina kwa wantu wa Moabu kuhehi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:16">kubanighwa kwawe nekufikizelawiya.”<verse eid="JER 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 48:17" />“Msininikiei Moabu inywi nyoshe mwe hehi naye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:17">na nyosheni mwemtaila vitana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:17">Mughambe, ‘Mgholokezi wakwe mkulu azakina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:17">ukulu wakwe na ufung'wa wakwe heviho vingi.’<verse eid="JER 48:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 48:18" />Inywi wantu mweikala Diboni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:18">ikilai kulawa hantu henyu muhekikombea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:18">mukaikale mwe shanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:18">Kwa kuti mkomi wa Moabu azabula kwemitoa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:18">azakinya pee nkando za mizi yenyu.<verse eid="JER 48:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 48:19" />Inywi wantu mweikala Aloeli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:19">gholokai nkanda ya sia kunu mukighoja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:19">mghoshi mweghuuka na mvyele mwenyiika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:19">mumuuze kuti, ‘Kulawiye mbwai?’<verse eid="JER 48:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 48:20" />Newahise kuti, ‘Moabu izaingilwa ni shoni kwa kuti izabanighwa,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:20">kemai kwa ukiwa na kutoa nkoo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:20">Biikilai kwa kia mntu mweikala nkanda ya mto Alinoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 48:20">kuti Moabu izabanighwa vigima.”<verse eid="JER 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 48:21" />“Mlaho uzabula kwe mizi ishinayo miima, Holoni na Yasa na Mefaasi, <verse eid="JER 48:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 48:22" />Diboni na Nebo na Besi Dibulasaimu <verse eid="JER 48:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 48:23" />na Kiliasaimu na Besigamuli na Besimeoni <verse eid="JER 48:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 48:24" />na Keliosi na Bosila. Mlaho uzabula mwe mizi yoshe ya Moabu ye hehi na ye hale. <verse eid="JER 48:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 48:25" />Nguvu za Moabu zizaushighwa na ufung'wa wakwe uzabanighwa.” Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.<verse eid="JER 48:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utii wa Moabu utahaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 48:26" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba kuti, “Mtengeezei Moabu kwa kuti, azakighalusha mkulu kunizinka imi Zumbe Mulungu. Kwa ivyoho Moabu neasaghane mwe matahika yakwe na wantu newamsheke. <verse eid="JER 48:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 48:27" />Moabu, fukila via wawashekavyo wantu wa Izilaeli. Kwani watezagwiwa hang'we na wabavi mpaka ukakucha mtwi wako kwa ubeo kia uhelongea kwa mbuli zawe?”<verse eid="JER 48:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 48:28" />“Inywi wantu mweikala Moabu, lawai mwe mizi yenyu mukaikale kwe mpanga! Itukai sa njiwa yeita kwezenga sasa jakwe he uvi wa mpanga. <verse eid="JER 48:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 48:29" />Nizaiva utii wa wantu wa Moabu, waakikomba kweli. Nizaiva wavyekikomba na kukiiva kwa utii we mwe myoyo yawe. <verse eid="JER 48:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 48:30" />Imi Zumbe Mulungu naataila wavyena utii na kukikomba kwawe hekuwaambize kintu chochoshe. <verse eid="JER 48:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 48:31" />Kwa ivyoho, nenisininike kwa mbuli ya wantu woshe wa Moabu na kwa mbuli ya wantu wa Kili Helesi. <verse eid="JER 48:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 48:32" />Inywi wantu wa Sibima muna mbuwa nyingi za mizabibu kuzinka wantu wa Yazeli. Inywi mu sa mzabibu wena matambi yativileyo mpaka sheja ya bahai ya munyu na kuita mpaka Yazeli, miya mnkuu azazubua matambi ya matunda yenyu ya mishi ya zua na zabibu zenyu. Kwa ivyoho, nenimisininikie inywi wantu wa Sibima kuzinka wantu wa Yazeli. <verse eid="JER 48:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 48:33" />Nyemi na visheko vizaushighwa mwe shi ya Moabu yeozoka. Nizaeka divai ishelawe hantu wahekootea zabibu, hekuna mntu mwekoota zabibu na kutoa nkeeghee, hata kati kuna vuzo miya shiyo ja nyemi.”<verse eid="JER 48:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 48:34" />“Miya kuivikana kiiyo cha wantu wa Heshiboni uko Eleale na Yahazi, icho kiiyo chaavikana kulawa Soali mpaka Holonaimu na uko Egilasi Shelishiya. Na mazi ya Nimulimu yazahwa. <verse eid="JER 48:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 48:35" />Nenimkome kia mntu mweikala Moabu mwelavya ntogoo kwe vitui na kuokea ubani mulungu yakwe.”<verse eid="JER 48:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 48:36" />“Kwa ivyoho moyo wangu utawakemea wantu wa Moabu na wantu wa Kili Helesi, sa mntu mweimba imbo ja ndiyo kwa fiimbi, kwa kuti hata viiko vyawe vyoshe waoneevyo vizabanighwa. <verse eid="JER 48:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 48:37" />Kia mntu azamoa sui zakwe na ndezu zakwe wakisininika. Wazakishengashenga mikono na mwe vighwidi vyawe na waizwikie shuke za magunia. <verse eid="JER 48:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 48:38" />Mwe nyumba za Moabu na mwe sia zawe hekuna cheivikana, miya kuivika viiyo du, kwa kuti nizamtoa Moabu sa igha jishakalejo jishikundwajo ni mntu. Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo. <verse eid="JER 48:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 48:39" />Shi ya Moabu neibanighwe! Welela ndivyo wantu wa Moabu wakeme kwa usoyoyo! Welela ndivyo wauye mghongo kwa shoni! Wantu wa Moabu newaituke wantu wa kushekwa na kimaka kwa wantu wawe wa hehi.”<verse eid="JER 48:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulahwa kwa wantu wa Moabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 48:40" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, “Mnkuu neashee na kuitoa Moabu sa ngwiizi ikusueyo mawawa yakwe ivyesheea kweghua maunde. <verse eid="JER 48:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 48:41" />Mizi yakwe neighuighwe na nkando zakwe nezigandulwe. Mwe iyo mishi, myoyo ya waghojo wa Moabu neiogohe sa mvyele mwekishungua. <verse eid="JER 48:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 48:42" />Wamoabu newakong'we washetaikane vingi mwe shi kwa mbuli ya kukighalusha wakulu kunizinka imi Zumbe Mulungu. <verse eid="JER 48:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 48:43" />Wogha, matubwi na mitegho vyaamighoja inywi wantu wa Moabu. Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo. <verse eid="JER 48:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 48:44" />Mwenyiika vyegea wogha neagongooke mwe tubwi, mwelawa mwe tubwi neagwiwe ni mtegho, kwa kuti neniete izo ntogho kwa Moabu mwe mishi yawe ya kulahwa. Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo. <verse eid="JER 48:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JER 48:45" />Waja wenyiika newaghuuke na mwe mzi wa Heshiboni kweondeeza mpolele, kwa kuti moto waaka uko Heshiboni, sheshe za moto kulawa kwe mzi wa zumbe wa Sihoni zikaoka mihaka ya Moabu, zikaoka vitui vya awa wantu wetamiwa ni nkumbizi. <verse eid="JER 48:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JER 48:46" />Wantu wa Moabu chenyu ndicho! Wantu wa Kemoshi ushe muzakong'wa na wabwanga wenyu newagwiwe na wandee wenyu newaghuighwe waighawe na kwe shi ya ugheni.<verse eid="JER 48:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JER 48:47" />“Miya mishi yeiza neniitamize vingi shi ya Moabu. Imi Zumbe Mulungu naghamba, iji nee bontokelo ja mlaho kwa wantu wa Moabu.”<verse eid="JER 48:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="JER 49" />
  <para style="s">Mlaho wa Zumbe Mulungu kwa wantu wa Amoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 49:1" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi kwa mbuli ya Waamoni, “Kwani Izilaeli hana wana wa kibwanga? Hana wapazi wedaha kupaa inu shi? Kwai ushe wantu wemvika mulungu Moleki wazaghua shi ya Izilaeli na kuikala umo? <verse eid="JER 49:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 49:2" />Mishi yaaiza ndiho niwaeke wantu wa Laba waive vuzo ja nkondo kwa mbuli ya mzi wa Waamoni, newiituke kitui cha mahuzu, na vijiji vyakwe neviokwe kwa moto. Vikibinda Wazilaeli newawaghuushe waja wawaghuushawo. Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo. <verse eid="JER 49:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 49:3" />Inywi wantu wa Heshiboni sininikai, kwa kuti mzi wa Ai uzabanighwa! Inywi wavyele wa Laba kemai! Zwikai shuke za magunia, musininike kwa kughuuka uko na uko ndai ya nkando za mzi, kwa kuti mulungu Moleki neaighawe kwe shi ya ugheni, ye hang'we na wavikizi wakwe na wantu wemghoshoela ndima. <verse eid="JER 49:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 49:4" />Kwai mwaakikomba kwa mbuli ya makoongo yenyu yeozoka? Inywi shiyo wakweli. Inywi mualila viiko vyenyu muvyekikombea kunu mukighamba, ‘Ni ndai mwedaha kutoana na ishwi?’ <verse eid="JER 49:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 49:5" />Nenimigee wogha kulawa kwa wantu woshe we hehi na inywi, nainywi nemughuushwe na se kia mng'we na sia yakwe, hekuna ndiye amiunganyanye na kumiika hantu hang'we.” Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nena nguvu zoshe nilongiewo.<verse eid="JER 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 49:6" />“Miya mishi yaaiza ndiho newauze vingi Waamoni na mwe shi yawe.” Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.<verse eid="JER 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlaho wa Zumbe Mulungu kwa wantu wa Edomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 49:7" />Zumbe Mulungu mwena nguvu zoshe aghamba ivi kwa mbuli ya Waedomu, “Ivi hekuna vingi wantu wena viugho mwe mzi wa Temani? Ivi hekuna ashighaleye wa kuminka viugho? Ivi viugho vyawe viteshiya vigima? <verse eid="JER 49:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 49:8" />Hitukai na mughuuke inywi wantu wa Dedani mukakifishe mwe mpanga. Neniwaetee ntogho wavyawa woshe wa Esau, kwa kuti mishi ya kumitoa izabula. <verse eid="JER 49:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 49:9" />Wantu weiza kweshuma zabibu waashighaza na wabavi wakiiza nakio kwebawa, wabawa wavyekunda. <verse eid="JER 49:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 49:10" />Miya wavyawa wa Esau neniwahoke kia kintu na kughubula kia hantu ndiho wadahe kukifisha kunga washekifishe vingi. Wana wakwe na wandughu wakwe na wantu wakwe we hehi naye newakong'we na shi ya Edomu neibanighwe vigima. <verse eid="JER 49:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 49:11" />Niekeai wana wenyu wafiiwewo ni waishe zawe na wanine zawe neniwawelele, vingi niekeai wavyele wafiiwewo ni waghoshi wawe wanialile imi.”<verse eid="JER 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 49:12" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, “Kati waja washikundighwawo kusungudishwa shuti wasungudishwe, inywi wantu wa Edomu shuti muisiize kusungudishwa. Hemudahe kunyiika uwo mlaho. <verse eid="JER 49:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 49:13" />Nizalapa kwa zina jangu kuti mzi wa Bosila newiituke mahuzu na hewiikawe ni wantu na newiituke hantu hegeza wogha na kubewa na mizi yakwe yoshe neiituke mahuzu kale na kale.” Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo. <verse eid="JER 49:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 49:14" />Nizaiva mbuli kulawa kwa Zumbe Mulungu kuti azaaghiiza mntu akabiikile mwe shi zoshe kuti, “Kiunganyei hang'we mukautoe mzi wa Edomu, inukai mukautoe! <verse eid="JER 49:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 49:15" />Imi Zumbe Mulungu nenikughalushe iwe Edomu wiituke mdodo kuiko shi zoshe, wantu woshe we mwe shi newakubee. <verse eid="JER 49:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 49:16" />Kukikomba kwako kuti kia muntu aakuogoha utekilufya, iwe mweikala mwe mpanga za makuungu makulu, naiwe mweikala mwe vitui vya miima. Hata kati uzazenga nyumba yako uko ulanga sa ngwiizi ivyezenga sasa jakwe, miya nenikusheeze kulawa uko ulanga uiko.” Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.<verse eid="JER 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 49:17" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba, “Shi ya Edomu neighaluke hantu hegeza wogha na woshe wezinka hehi naye newamake na kuogoha wakiona ivyo ibanighwevyo. <verse eid="JER 49:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 49:18" />Sa via shi ya Sodoma na Gomola hang'we na mizi ndiyo ii hehi naye ibanighwevyo, imi Zumbe Mulungu naghamba kuti, Edomu kohe hekuituke na mntu yoyoshe mweikala wala kuzenga. <verse eid="JER 49:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 49:19" />Sa shimba yelawa mwe mzitu mtana wa Yolidani na kufikizaita kwaishiiza, nee ndivyo nifikizewaghuusha Waedomu walawe mwe shi yawe. Na mgholokezi ndiye nimshaghule neagholokele shi. Kwa kuti, ni ndai mwedaha kuighana na imi? Ni ndai mwedaha kuhimana na imi? Ni mgholokezi ndai mwedaha kuhimana na imi? <verse eid="JER 49:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 49:20" />Kwa ivyoho, teghelezai fanyanyi zangu imi Zumbe Mulungu nifanyanyezo kuwatoa wantu wa shi ya Edomu na via nivyekunda kuwaghoshoela wantu wa Temani. Wana wawe wankebe newabuutwe na kia mng'we neaituke na wogha. <verse eid="JER 49:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 49:21" />Shi ya Edomu ikizagwa, nekuituke na shindo ndiyo itingishe shi ngima na kukema kwawe nekuivikane mpaka kwe bahai ya Shamu. <verse eid="JER 49:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 49:22" />Mnkuu neaize kweitoa Bosila sa ngwiizi ivyesheea kweghua maunde yakwe. Uwo mshi myoyo ya waghojo wa Edomu neiingiwe ni wogha sa mvyele mwekishungua.”<verse eid="JER 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlaho wa Zumbe Mulungu kwa wantu wa Damesiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 49:23" />Ivi nee Zumbe Mulungu avyelonga kwa mbuli ya mzi wa Damesiki, “Mizi ya Hamasi na Alipadi ye hehi na Damesiki izaingiwa ni wogha kwa kuiva mbuli mbada. Kwa ivyoho watasangadika sa makumbo ya bahai yashitongomaayo. <verse eid="JER 49:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 49:24" />Wantu wa Damesiki wazaituka wakiwa na wantu woshe wataghuuka kwa wogha. Wazaituka na usoyoyo sa mvyele mwena mishango ya kukishungua. <verse eid="JER 49:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 49:25" />Viituka zeze mzi wetaikana na niwekunda uwekwe? <verse eid="JER 49:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 49:26" />Kwa ivyoho, mwe uwo mushi wabwanga wakwe newakong'we mwe sia na waghojo wakwe newakong'we. Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nena nguvu zoshe nilongiewo. <verse eid="JER 49:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 49:27" />Nenikoeze moto mwe nkando za Damesiki na neuwoke nyumba za zumbe Beni Hadadi.”<verse eid="JER 49:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlaho wa Zumbe Mulungu kwa mbali ya Kedali na mzi wa Hazoli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 49:28" />Ivi nee Zumbe Mulungu alongievyo kwa mbuli ya mbali ya Kedali na mizi ndiyo ikigholokewa ni zumbe wa Hazoli yatoighwayo ni Nebukadineza zumbe wa Babeli na kuidaha, “Inukai muite mukawatoe wantu wa mbali ya Kedali na kuwakoma wantu weikala wazu zua jikwelawiya. <verse eid="JER 49:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 49:29" />Makumbi yawe na mafyo ya ngoto yazaghuighwa. Vingi mapazia yawe na viiko vyawe vyoshe na ngamia zawe ntana zizaita, nekuivikane nkoo na wantu newaingiwe ni wogha kia hantu.”<verse eid="JER 49:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 49:30" />“Inywi wantu wa Hazoli ghuukai hale mukakifishe mwe mpanga, imi Zumbe Mulungu nizalonga. Kwa kuti Nebukadineza zumbe wa Babeli azafanyanya kuiza kwemitoa na kumikoma. Ataghamba, <verse eid="JER 49:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 49:31" />‘Gholokai tite kweitoa shi yena mpolele, shi ya wantu washinayo wogha. Iyo shi heizengeewe nkando za mizi na iikeike du wala heina ughojo wowoshe.’ ” Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.<verse eid="JER 49:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 49:32" />“Ngamia zawe na chuma chawe neighuighwe. Neniwaasakanye wantu weikala wazu zua jikwelawiya na neniwaetee ntogho kulawa kia wazu. Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo. <verse eid="JER 49:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 49:33" />Mzi wa Hazoli neughaluke hemelo ja makui ya tundui na neughaluke mzi wena ukiwa kale na kale, hekuna mntu ndiye aikale umo vingi.” Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.<verse eid="JER 49:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlaho wa Zumbe Mulungu kwa wantu wa shi ya Elamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 49:34" />Zumbe Sedekia aheandusha kugholokela shi ya Yuda, Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu mwena nguvu zoshe atelonga na Yelemia kwa mbuli ya shi ya Elamu. <verse eid="JER 49:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 49:35" />Amghamba ivi, “Neniwakome watoa nyuta woshe waighalushewo shi ya Elamu iituke na nguvu. <verse eid="JER 49:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 49:36" />Neniete wankuu kulawa kia wazu wawatoe wantu wa Elamu na kuwaasakanya kia hantu mwe shi. Wohe newashamizwe na mwe shi zoshe ze mwe ngulu. <verse eid="JER 49:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 49:37" />Neniwagee wogha wantu wa Elamu kwa wankuu wawe wekunda kuwakoma. Neniwaetee ntogho kwa maya yangu makai. Neniwadoseeze kwa uhamba mpaka niwabinde woshe. Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo. <verse eid="JER 49:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 49:38" />Nenimkome zumbe wawe hang'we na waambizi wakwe na kuika ufung'wa wangu uko Elamu. Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo. <verse eid="JER 49:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 49:39" />Mwe mishi yeiza, neniwauze wantu wa mzi wa Elamu na kuwatoghesha vingi sa ndivyo waivyo.” Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.<verse eid="JER 49:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="JER 50" />
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya Zumbe Mulungu kwe mzi wa Babeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 50:1" />Inu nee mbuli Zumbe Mulungu alongieyo kuzinkia mteghanyi Yelemia, kwa mbuli ya mzi wa Babeli na shi ya Wakalidayo<verse eid="JER 50:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 50:2" />“Biikilai mwe shi zoshe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:2">inuai biamu kuonyesha ntangilo ya kubiikila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:2">mushefishe kintu chochoshe, mughambe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:2">mzi wa Babeli neugwiwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:2">na Beli mulungu wakwe neaingiwe ni shoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:2">mulungu Melodaki neaingiwe ni wogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:2">vinyago vyakwe nevigee usei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:2">na milungu yakwe neiingiwe ni wogha.”<verse eid="JER 50:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 50:3" />“Kwa kuti mbali kulawa wazu wa kasikazini izaiza kweutoa mzi wa Babeli na kuieka iyo shi ibanighwe na kuituka ukiwa. Hekuna mweikala umo, wantu na vizama nevighuuke viite hale.”<verse eid="JER 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuuya kwa Waizilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 50:4" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, “Mwe iyo mishi na muda uwo, wantu wa Izilaeli na wa Yuda newavungane hang'we kunivika imi Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu wawe na kuuya kunu waakema. <verse eid="JER 50:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 50:5" />Newauze sia ya kuita Sayuni na kuandusha ntambo ya kuuya na uko. Newaghambiane, ‘Soi tiuye kwa Zumbe Mulungu.’ Newaike kilagha na imi cha kale na kale ndicho chishejaighwe.”<verse eid="JER 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 50:6" />“Wantu wangu wazaituka sa ngoto ziazighwezo ni walishi wawe na kuwaeka wasangadike kwe vitui vya miima, wakajata kulawa kwe kitui king'we mpaka kwe kitui kituhu, wakajaa sia ya kuuya kaya kwawe. <verse eid="JER 50:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 50:7" />Wantu woshe wawabuizawo wazawakoma na wankuu wawe wakaghamba, ‘Ishwi hetina masa kwa kuwatoa, kwa kuti wo watemghoshoela uhuza Zumbe Mulungu ndiye akiwainka kia kintu, yohe nee ndiye ai kialilo cha baba zawe.’ ”<verse eid="JER 50:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 50:8" />“Ghuukai kulawa Babeli! Lawai mwe shi ya Wakalidayo, vingi muituke sa mbuzi zeongoea weae. <verse eid="JER 50:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 50:9" />Kwa kuti, neniwahimbile wantu wa mbali nkulu zekidaha kulawa wazu wa kasikazini waitoe shi ya Babeli. Newakiighanye kuitoa shi ya Babeli na kuighua. Waghojo wawe newaituke watoa maosa wekidaha sa mghojo mwena ntae. <verse eid="JER 50:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 50:10" />Shi ya Wakalidayo neighuighwe na awo weighua newaonee.” Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.<verse eid="JER 50:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kugwa kwa Babeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 50:11" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, “Inywi wantu wa Babeli mughuiyewo kiiko changu, hata kati mwaatamiwa na kuja nyemi na kuumbia sa ng'ombe yeheta uhemba na kukema sa faashi ya ngoshi, <verse eid="JER 50:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 50:12" />miya shi yenyu ya Babeli muvyaiweho neiingiwe ni shoni na kubewa. Babeli neighaluke shi ndodo mwe shi zoshe na neighaluke nyika vingi shi nkazu na ishiikawayo ni wantu. <verse eid="JER 50:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 50:13" />Babeli heiikalwe ni mntu kwa mbuli ya maya ya Zumbe Mulungu. Heiikawe ni kintu chochoshe, na kia mwezinka hehi nayo neamake na kuiva wogha kwa ivyo ibanighwevyo.”<verse eid="JER 50:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 50:14" />“Inywi nyoshe mwedaha kutoa maosa, kiighanyei kuudenga mzi wa Babeli. Utoei kwa maosa yenyu yoshe, kwa kuti uzanighoshoela uhuza imi Zumbe Mulungu. <verse eid="JER 50:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 50:15" />Tuai vuzo ja nkondo kia hantu, wantu wa Babeli newakilavye wenye kunga wagwiwe. Ngome zawe nezigwe na nkando zawe nezigandulwe, kwa kuti imi Zumbe Mulungu neniihiize nkuu. Waghosholeei sa via wo waghosholevyo kwa wantu wa mizi mituhu. <verse eid="JER 50:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 50:16" />Mushezaeka wantu wahande mbeyu uko Babeli, wala kueka wantu washume, kwa kuti mnkuu neaize kwewatoa na kia mng'we neaghuuke kuuya na mwe shi yakwe.”<verse eid="JER 50:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waizilaeli newauye kaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 50:17" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, “Izilaeli ni sa fyo ja ngoto ziasakanezo zeghuushwa ni shimba. Wavoka kutoighwa ni zumbe wa Ashulu na iviaha ushe wazatoighwa ni Nebukadineza zumbe wa Babeli. <verse eid="JER 50:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 50:18" />Kwa ivyoho, imi Zumbe Mulungu nena nguvu zoshe, Mulungu wa Izilaeli nenimtoe zumbe wa Babeli na shi yakwe sa namtoavyo zumbe wa Ashulu. <verse eid="JER 50:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 50:19" />Neniwauze Waizilaeli na mwe shi yawe, wohe newaje nkande zeimighwa kwe kitui cha Kalimeli na Bashani na newaighushwe ni nkande zelawa kwe vitui vya Efulahimu na Gileadi. <verse eid="JER 50:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 50:20" />Mwe iyo mishi na muda uwo, wantu newaondeeze ubada mwe shi ya Izilaeli miya hewauwone, wantu newaondeeze uhuza mwe shi ya Yuda, miya heuwoneke, kwa kuti nizawaushiiza uhuza wawe waja wagheke nishighazewo.” Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.<verse eid="JER 50:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zumbe Mulungu neawalahe wantu wa Babeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 50:21" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, “Kweai mukaitoe shi ya Melasaimu na waja weikala uko Pekodi, mukawakome vigima wantu wakwe woshe. Ghosholai kia kintu nimiaghiizecho. Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo. <verse eid="JER 50:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 50:22" />Vuzo ja nkondo jizaivikana mwe shi na kuna ubanasi mkulu. <verse eid="JER 50:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 50:23" />Shi ya Babeli ndiyo iina nguvu kuzinka shi zoshe, izakinywa na kubondeka! Mbali zosheni mwe shi zitamaka kwa ivyo vilawiiyevyo mwe shi ya Babeli. <verse eid="JER 50:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 50:24" />Iwe Babeli naakuikila mtegho ukakugwila, hang'we na kuti nee uishitaile kuti uzagwiwa kwa mbuli ya kuhimana na imi Zumbe Mulungu. <verse eid="JER 50:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 50:25" />Nizazughua taa ja mata yangu na kwa maya niyena nayo nizaghua mata yangu, kwa kuti imi Zumbe Mulungu nedaha mbuli zoshe nina ndima ya kughoshola mwe shi ya Wakaldayo. <verse eid="JER 50:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 50:26" />Itoei kulawa kia wazu, bondai mataa yakwe ya nkande, umbikai vintu mughuiyevyo sa vizuumu vya mbeyu! Ibanei vigima shi yoshe musheshighaze kintu chochoshe! <verse eid="JER 50:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 50:27" />Wakomei waghojo wakwe woshe! Waghuei waghojo wa kibwanga muwaighale machinjoni sa ng'ombe ivyeighawa kwechinjwa! Chawe ndicho! Kwa kuti mshi wawe wa kulahwa uzabula!”<verse eid="JER 50:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 50:28" />Wateghelezei wantu wanyiikewo na kughuuka kulawa Babeli, wakibiikila kunu Yelusalemu ivyo Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu weshu awaihiizevyo nkuu wantu wa Babeli wabaniewo nyumba yakwe.<verse eid="JER 50:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 50:29" />“Waitangei watoa Maosa waitoe shi ya Babeli. Ighalai kia mntu mwedaha kutoa uta. Udengei mzi kunga kushezanyiika mntu hata mng'we. Ulihei kuighana na mbuli zakwe, muughoshole sa via ughosholeevyo wantu watuhu, kwa kuti uzamghoshoela utii Zumbe Mulungu yuja mg'azi wa Izilaeli. <verse eid="JER 50:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 50:30" />Kwa ivyoho wabwanga wa mzi wa Babeli newakine mwe sia na waghojo wakwe wosheni newakong'we mshi uwo uwo.” Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.<verse eid="JER 50:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 50:31" />“Imi Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu nena nguvu zoshe, nitoana na iwe mwena utii kwa kuti mshi wako uzabula, mshi ndiwo nikutoe. <verse eid="JER 50:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 50:32" />Mntu mwena utii neakitoe na kukina na hekuna yoyoshe ndiye amuinue, neniashe moto mwe mizi yakwe, ndiwo uwoke kia kintu che hehi naye.”<verse eid="JER 50:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 50:33" />Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu mwena nguvu zoshe aghamba ivi, “Wantu wa Izilaeli na wantu wa Yuda wataoneewa. Wosheni wawagwiziewo waiwatozize kweli, wataemela kite kuwaekea. <verse eid="JER 50:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 50:34" />Miya mvunizi wawe nina nguvu, Zumbe Mulungu nena nguvu zoshe nee zina jangu. Neniwavunile vigima kunga niete hemelo mwe shi yawe, miya neniete sungu kwa wantu weikala Babeli.”<verse eid="JER 50:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 50:35" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:35">“Wakalidayo newafe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:35">Wantu wakwe newafe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:35">na wagholokezi wakwe hang'we na wena viugho wohe newafe.<verse eid="JER 50:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 50:36" />Wateghanyi wakwe wa lufyo newafe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:36">newaituke madashi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:36">Waghojo wakwe wekidaha newafe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:36">wohe newabulwe ni wogha!<verse eid="JER 50:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 50:37" />Faashi zakwe nezife na magai yakwe ya nkondo neyabanighwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:37">Waghojo wakwe wosheni wa kigheni weikala umo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:37">newaituke wanyonge sa wavyele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:37">Kiiko chakwe choshe nechibanighwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:37">na kia wachena nacho nechighuighwe.<verse eid="JER 50:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 50:38" />Zua nejiake</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:38">na mazi yakwe neyahwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:38">Kwa kuti Babeli ni shi ya milungu ya vinyago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:38">na wantu waakunda vinyago vyawe sa wakilalu.”<verse eid="JER 50:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 50:39" />“Kwa ivyoho, vizama vya tundui mangugwa na mbuni neviikale Babeli. Kale na kale wantu hewaikale umo vivyazi na vivyazi vyoshe vyeiza. <verse eid="JER 50:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 50:40" />Sa via imi Zumbe Mulungu niwakomievyo wantu wa mzi wa Sodoma na Gomola hang'we na mizi yehakana nayo, vivyoho hehaituke na mntu yoyoshe ndiye aikale umo.” Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.<verse eid="JER 50:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 50:41" />“Welela waghojo waaiza kulawa shi ya kaskazini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:41">ni mbali nkulu yena wazumbe wangi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:41">waakuizila kulawa mwe bontokelo ja shi.<verse eid="JER 50:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 50:42" />Waitozize nyuta na maguha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:42">ni wantu makatii na hewana mbazi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:42">Shindo zawe ni sa bahai ye boha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:42">wakiendesha faashi zawe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:42">Wazakiighanya kwa nkondo kunga wakutoe iwe mzi wa Babeli.<verse eid="JER 50:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 50:43" />Zumbe wa Babeli azaiva mbuli zawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:43">mikono yakwe izaegheeka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:43">Mishango izamgwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 50:43">aasumia sa mvyele mwekunda kukishungua.”<verse eid="JER 50:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 50:44" />“Waaiza, sa shimba ivyelawa mwe mashafi ya Yolidani na kugwia ngoto ze hantu hakuishiiza. Imi Zumbe Mulungu neniwaghuushe wantu wa Babeli mwe shi yawe. Neniwashaghuiye mgholokezi mtana ndiye niyemkunda. Ni ndai mwedaha kuighanywa na imi? Ni ndai mwedaha kuhimana na imi? Vingi ni mgholokezi ndai mwedaha kuniemeza? <verse eid="JER 50:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JER 50:45" />Kwa ivyoho niteghelezai nichefanyanya imi Zumbe Mulungu kughoshola kwe wantu wa Babeli, chia nichefanyanya kwa mbuli ya shi ya Wakalidayo. Hata wana wawe wadodo newabuutwe sa maghoto na nyumba zawe nezigandulwe. <verse eid="JER 50:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JER 50:46" />Shindo za kugwiwa kwa wantu wa Babeli nekueke ngulu ngima izingize na kiiyo chakwe nechiiivikane kwe shi zoshe.”<verse eid="JER 50:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 50" />
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="JER 51" />
  <para style="s">Zumbe Mulungu atahimba kuwalaha wantu wa Babeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 51:1" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, “Neniwahimbile waghojo wakaitoe shi ya Babeli na kuwakoma wantu wa Babeli na wantu weikala Lebu Kamai sa mpeho nkai. <verse eid="JER 51:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 51:2" />Neniaghiize wagheni wakaibane shi ya Babeli, sa mpeho nkai yeinua mantu. Uwo mshi ukizabula newaitoe kia hantu na kuiyeka shi bia kintu. <verse eid="JER 51:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 51:3" />Seniwaeke watoa maosa wa Babeli wazute nyuta hambu wazwike shuke zawe za nkondo. Seniwaivile mbazi wabwanga wakwe, waghojo wakwe woshe neniwakome vigima. <verse eid="JER 51:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 51:4" />Newakine na kukong'wa mwe shi yawe wenye na newaumizwe mwe sia za mizi yawe. <verse eid="JER 51:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 51:5" />Imi Zumbe Mulungu nena nguvu zoshe, siwaekile wantu wa Izilaeli na wantu wa Yuda, hang'we na kuti nee waina masa na imi mng'azi wa Izilaeli. <verse eid="JER 51:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 51:6" />Ghuukai mulawe kwa Wababeli! Kia mng'we avunile ugima wakwe! Mushezakong'wa kwa mbuli ya masa yawe. Kwa kuti iyo nee mishi ya imi Zumbe Mulungu kuihiiza nkuu na kuilaha Babeli sa ivyekundighwa. <verse eid="JER 51:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 51:7" />Babeli nee ni sa kikombe cha zahabu chimemilecho divai ya maya yangu, wantu wa mbali zoshe waachivatia icho kikombe wakatengea na kughaluka madashi. <verse eid="JER 51:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 51:8" />Babeli neifikizegwa na kubondekabondeka. Isininikiei! Iighaiyei mzighi wa kuihoza ngea neihone. <verse eid="JER 51:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 51:9" />Wagheni weikala uko wataghamba, ‘Tizagheza kuihonya Babeli, miya vizaema kuhona. Iyekei titei kaya, kwa kuti mlaho wakwe uzabula kwe lwingu.’ ”<verse eid="JER 51:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 51:10" />“Zumbe Mulungu azaonyesha kuti ishwi hetina masa. Titei tikabilikile uko Yelusalemu chia Zumbe Mulungu aghosholecho.”<verse eid="JER 51:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 51:11" />Zumbe Mulungu aawahimbila wazumbe wa Waamedi, kwa fanyanyi zakwe za kuuubana mzi wa Babeli. Ivi nee ndivyo Zumbe Mulungu aihiize nkuu kwa waja wabanilewo nyumba yakwe ya mviko.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 51:11">Wagholokezi wa waghojo wataaghiza, “Noai maosa yenyu! Ghuai ngao zenyu! <verse eid="JER 51:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 51:12" />Kwezai biamu za nkondo ulanga ya nkando za Babeli! Togheshai ughojo na ikai waghojo! Ikai weteghea!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 51:12">Kwa kuti, Zumbe Mulungu neabontole mbuli yakwe afanyanyeyo kwa wantu wa Babeli. <verse eid="JER 51:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 51:13" />Shi yena mito mingi na viiko vingi, bontokelo jakwe jizabula na mishi yakwe izashiya. <verse eid="JER 51:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 51:14" />Zumbe Mulungu mwena nguvu zoshe, azalapa kuti neaete waghojo wangi sa fumba ja nyovu, wautoe mzi wa Babeli na kutoa nkeeghee kwa kukudaha.<verse eid="JER 51:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imbo ja kumtogola Zumbe Mulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 51:15" />Zumbe Mulungu nee aumbileye shi kwa nguvu zakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:15">akaitoghesha shi kwa viugho vyakwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:15">na kwa utalizi wakwe akashaaiza lwingu.<verse eid="JER 51:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 51:16" />Ahelonga, kuboha kwa mazi ye kwe lwingu kukaivikana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:16">aakweza zunde kulawa mwe bontokeo ja shi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:16">Aaghoshola mmweko fua zikigwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:16">na kukuntisha mpeho kulawa mwe taa jakwe.<verse eid="JER 51:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 51:17" />Kia mntu ni dashi hana viugho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:17">kia mweshongola vinyago azagewa shoni ni milungu yakwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:17">kwa kuti vinyago vyakwe ni vya lufyo na hevina ugima.<verse eid="JER 51:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 51:18" />Heviambiza kintu ni vya lufyo du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:18">wakizalahwa nevibanighwe.<verse eid="JER 51:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 51:19" />Mulungu wa Yakobo shiyo sa ivyo vinyago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:19">nee aumbileye vintu vyoshe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:19">na Izilaeli nee mbali yakwe ashaghuleyo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:19">Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu mwena nguvu zoshe nee zina jakwe.<verse eid="JER 51:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bontokelo ja uzumbe wa Babeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 51:20" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:20">“Iwe Babeli u kiboi changu na mata yangu ya nkondo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:20">Kwa iwe naazitoa mbali na kuzibana zumbe,<verse eid="JER 51:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 51:21" />naakonyoa faashi na uja mweikwea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:21">gai ja nkondo na uyo mwejiendesha.<verse eid="JER 51:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 51:22" />Kwa iwe naawakoma waghoshi na wavyele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:22">wadaa na wadodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:22">wabwanga na wandele.<verse eid="JER 51:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 51:23" />Kwa iwe naawakoma walishi na ngoto zawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:23">waimi na ng'ombe zawe za kuimia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:23">wakulu na wagholokezi.”<verse eid="JER 51:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulahwa kwa wantu wa Babeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 51:24" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi, “Neniitoe Babeli na woshe weikala umo kunu muiwelele kwa mesho yenyu wenye kwa mbuli ya uhuza wawe waghosholewo uko Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JER 51:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 51:25" />Iwe Babeli u sa zintu jebana wantu wa mbali zosheni mwe shi. Miya imi Zumbe Mulungu nenikutoe kwa nguvu zangu na kukukinya kulawa uko ulanga uiko na kukughalusha kitui chihyeecho. <verse eid="JER 51:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 51:26" />Hekuna iwe jako ndijo jighuighwe mwe icho kiugha ndijo jizengee na hekuna iwe ndijo jighuighwe jizengee msingi. Shi yako heiikawe ni wantu kale na kale. Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo. <verse eid="JER 51:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 51:27" />Inuiai biamu ya nkondo mwe shi, toai magunda ya nkondo mwe shi, ziighanyei shi zitoane na Babeli, ziitangei izi zumbe kunga zikatoe naye, zumbe za Alalati na Mini na Ashikenazi. Shaghulai mghojo mkulu aongole kutoana naye, ighaai faashi nyingi sa nyovu. <verse eid="JER 51:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 51:28" />Ighanyai shi zoshe zitoane na Babeli, waighanyei wazumbe wa Waamedi na wagholokezi wawe na waambizi wawe woshe, ighanyai waghojo we mwe shi zoshe wazegholokela. <verse eid="JER 51:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 51:29" />Wantu wa shi ya Babeli watazingiza na kunyaghaika kwa wogha, kwa kuti fanyanyi zangu imi Zumbe Mulungu kwa wantu wa Babeli ziitoghile. Neniighalushe shi ya Babeli ughongo na hekuna ndiye aikale umo. <verse eid="JER 51:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 51:30" />Waghojo wa Babeli wazahewa kutoana, wateikala mwe nkambi zawe. Nguvu zawe zizashiya hewana wachedaha. Nyumba za Babeli zizaokwa na nyuvi zakwe za chuma zizabondighwa. <verse eid="JER 51:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 51:31" />Ntung'wa ng'wenga na nyiae newateongozana kughuuka kwemnghambila zumbe wa Babeli, kuti mzi wakwe woshe uzaghuighwa. <verse eid="JER 51:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 51:32" />Hantu hakuombokea hazaghuighwa na nkando zizaokwa kwa moto na waghojo wazaingiwa ni wogha. <verse eid="JER 51:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 51:33" />Mishi inuinu wankuu newawakome na kuwajata sa shumo je mwe chengo. Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu nena nguvu zoshe, Mulungu wa Izilaeli nilongiewo.”<verse eid="JER 51:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 51:34" />Nebukadineza, zumbe wa Babeli azaubana na kuutiha mzi wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:34">akatieka tivuugikiwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:34">Akatieka tiituke sa igha je bue,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:34">azaumeza mzi sa zoka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:34">Akaighusha ifu jakwe kwa vintu vyeshu vitana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:34">vikibinda akatiusha mwe shi yeshu.<verse eid="JER 51:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 51:35" />Wantu wa Yelusalemu waghambe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:35">“Babeli itoighwe kwa mbuli ya ubada ujauja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:35">watighosholeewo ishwi hang'we na wandughu weshu!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:35">Waeke wantu wa Yelusalemu waghambe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:35">“Babeli itoighwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:35">kwa ivyo watisungudishevyo!”<verse eid="JER 51:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zumbe Mulungu neawavunile Waizilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 51:36" />Zumbe Mulungu awaghamba wantu wa Yelusalemu, “Nenimivunile mwe masa yenyu na kuihiza nkuu yenyu. Nenihweeshe mito ya Babeli na kueka shoko zakwe zikaaghale. <verse eid="JER 51:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 51:37" />Shi ya Babeli neiituke viugha vya mahuzu, neighaluke hemelo ja mbweha. Neiituke yaagea usei na kintu cha kubewa, hekuna mtu ndiye aikale uko. <verse eid="JER 51:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 51:38" />Wantu woshe wa Babeli newagumie sa shimba na newatoe mghono sa wana shimba. <verse eid="JER 51:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 51:39" />Wakiituka na ushu wa nkande, neniwaghosholee mvigha, neniwatengeze waituke waasheka na kukutika. Vikibinda newalale na hewainuke vingi. <verse eid="JER 51:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 51:40" />Neniwaikize sa maghoto yeighawa kwechinjwa, sa makosoghoo na mavuata.” Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.<verse eid="JER 51:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bontokelo ja wantu wa Babeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 51:41" />Zumbe Mulungu awaghamba wantu wa Babeli kuti, “Mzi uteikanewo mwe shi ngima uzagwiwa! Babeli itagea usei mwe shi ntuhu! <verse eid="JER 51:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 51:42" />Wankuu wa Babeli newaughubike mzi sa makumbo ya Bahai. <verse eid="JER 51:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 51:43" />Mizi yakwe neiituke kintu chegeza wogha vingi neiituke ughongo ushinawo mazi, shi ishiikawayo ni mntu yoyoshe, wala hekuna mntu mwezinka. <verse eid="JER 51:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 51:44" />Nenimlahe mulungu Beli wa wantu wa Babeli, neauze vintu abaiyevyo. Mbali hezimvike vingi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 51:44">“Ukando wa Babeli neugwe. <verse eid="JER 51:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JER 51:45" />Inywi wantu wangu, haawei waiho, muhonye ugima wenyu na mughuuke maya yangu makai imi Zumbe Mulungu. <verse eid="JER 51:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JER 51:46" />Mushefighwe ni myoyo na kuogoha, kwa mbuli muzeiva mwe shi, kwa kuti mwe vui iji kuivikana ivi na vui tuhu muiva mbuli ntuhu, mbuli za kikatii na zumbe uyu akitoana na zumbe mtuhu. <verse eid="JER 51:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JER 51:47" />Mishi yaaiza ndiho niwatoe wantu wa unu mzi na vinyago vyawe. Shi ngima neiingiwe ni shoni na wantu wakwe woshe weikala umo newakong'we. <verse eid="JER 51:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JER 51:48" />Nee lwingu na shi na vintu vyosheni vyeumo neviimbe kwa nyemi ya kugwa kwa Babeli, waghojo newaize kulawiya wazu wa kasikazini kweutoa. <verse eid="JER 51:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JER 51:49" />Sa via Babeli awakomievyo wantu wa Izilaeli na wantu watuhu mwe shi ngima, kwa ivyoho, wantu wakwe woshe newakong'we.” Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.<verse eid="JER 51:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya Zumbe Mulungu kwa Waizilaeli weikala Babeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JER 51:50" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi kwa Waizilaeli weikala Babeli, “Inywi muhoniewo kwe nkondo, lawai ushe, mushegugeguge! Nifukilai imi Zumbe Mulungu hata kati muhale, vingi muufukile mzi wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JER 51:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JER 51:51" />Mutaghamba, ‘Tizagewa shoni na kukankwa, shoni izaghubika vyeni vyetu, kwa kuti wagheni wazaingila hantu hang'azi he nyumba ya Zumbe Mulungu wakaieka ishetame kwa mviko.’ <verse eid="JER 51:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JER 51:52" />Kwa ivyoho imi Zumbe Mulungu naghamba kuti mishi yaaiza ndiho niwatoe wantu wa Babeli na vinyago vyawe na kukema kwa waja waumiewo nekuivikane mwe shi ngima. <verse eid="JER 51:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JER 51:53" />Hata kati Babeli neakwee kwe lwingu na kuzitoghesha nkando zakwe, neniaghiize wankuu wakamtoe.” Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nilongiewo.<verse eid="JER 51:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vifa vitaisiiza uko Babeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JER 51:54" />Zumbe Mulungu aghamba ivi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:54">“Tegheleza nkoo zaivikana uko Babeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:54">shindo za ubanasi mkulu kulawa mwe shi ya Wakalidayo.<verse eid="JER 51:54" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JER 51:55" />Nizawakoma wantu wa Babeli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:55">na kutongomaza vuzo jakwe kulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:55">Waghojo wataingila sa makumbo ya mazi mangi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:55">vuzo ja nkondo jaaivikana mwe mzi.<verse eid="JER 51:55" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="JER 51:56" />Mkomi ataiza kweibana Babeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:56">waghojo wakwe wazagwiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:56">nyuta zawe zitadwishwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:56">Imi ni Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu nelaha masa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:56">neniighosholee Babeli sa ivyekundighwa kughoshoewa.<verse eid="JER 51:56" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JER 51:57" />Neniwatengeze wakulu wakwe na wena viugho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:57">wagholokezi wakwe na waambizi wakwe hang'we na waghojo wakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:57">Newalale na hewainuke vingi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:57">Nilonga imi zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:57">Zumbe Mulungu, Mulungu nena nguvu zoshe nee zina jangu.<verse eid="JER 51:57" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JER 51:58" />Ukando wa Babeli neukinywe shi na kuasakanywa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:58">na nyuvi zakwe ntai neziokwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:58">Wantu newakisungudishe bue du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JER 51:58">wantu wa mbali newakitibue kwa kuti bontokelo jawe ni moto.” Ni miyo Zumbe Mulungu nena nguvu zoshe nilongiewo.<verse eid="JER 51:58" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uteghanyi wa Yelemia utaighawa Babeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JER 51:59" />Inu nee mbuli ya Zumbe Mulungu amuaghiizeyo mteghanyi Yelemia amnke Selaya ng'wana wa Nelia, ng'wezukuue ja Maaseya, aheita Babeli hang'we na Sedekia zumbe wa Yuda, mwe vui ja ne ja ugholokezi wa Sedekia zumbe wa Yuda. Selaya nee ni mndima mweituka hang'we na zumbe. <verse eid="JER 51:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="JER 51:60" />Imi Yelemia nee nigondile mwe gondwe ntogho ndizo ziubule mzi wa Babeli, hang'we na mbuli ntuhu zosheni ndizo ziigondighwe kwa mbuli ya Babeli. <verse eid="JER 51:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JER 51:61" />Nikamghamba Selaya kuti, “Ukizabula Babeli shuti uwafyomee wantu kwa sauti nkulu izi mbuli zoshe. <verse eid="JER 51:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JER 51:62" />Vikibinda uvike, ‘Iwe Zumbe Mulungu uzaghamba neuubane unu mzi usheikalwe ni kintu chochoshe, mntu hambu vizama na inu shi neiituke ughongo kale na kale.’ <verse eid="JER 51:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JER 51:63" />Ukibinda pee kufyoma iji gondwe, jishunge na iwe vikibinda jihomee na mwe mto Eufulate kunu ukighamba, <verse eid="JER 51:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JER 51:64" />‘Ivi nee ndivyo Babeli igongooke na heiinuke vingi kwa mbuli ya ntogho ndizo niete kwakwe.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 51:64">Mbuli za Yelemia zibontokela aha.<verse eid="JER 51:64" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 51" />
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="JER 52" />
  <para style="s">Kugwa kwa mzi wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 52:1" />Sedekia ashaghulwa aituke zumbe akiituka na mavui miongo mii na ng'wenga. Agholokela kwa mavui muongo mng'we na ng'wenga uko Yelusalemu. Zina ja nine akwe nee ni Hamutali ng'wana wa Yelemia mtuhu, mweandukia mwe mzi wa Libuna. <verse eid="JER 52:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 52:2" />Akaghoshola uhuza mwe mesho ya Zumbe Mulungu, sa uhuza woshe aghosholewo Yehoyakimu. <verse eid="JER 52:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 52:3" />Zumbe Mulungu akawaihiwa wantu wa Yelusalemu na wa Yuda, vikibinda akawaghuusha mwe mesho yakwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 52:3">Sedekia akamhituka zumbe wa Babeli. <verse eid="JER 52:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 52:4" />Kwa ivyoho, mwe mshi wa kumi wa ng'wezi wa kumi, vui ja kenda ja ugholokezi wa Sedekia, Nebukadineza zumbe wa Babeli akaita na waghojo wakwe woshe mwe mzi wa Yelusalemu, wakaumbika shanga mwe ukando kunga kughoshola vidanto vya kukweea waingile ndai ya mzi na kuudenga kia hantu. Wakaika makumbi se ya mzi na kuudenga. <verse eid="JER 52:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 52:5" />Wakaisiiza kuudenga mzi mpaka vui ja kumi na ng'wenga ja ugholokezi wa Sedekia. <verse eid="JER 52:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 52:6" />Uhebula mshi wa kenda mwe ng'wezi wa ne mwe vui jijo ijo, saa ikahimba mwe mzi na nee kuishina nkande. <verse eid="JER 52:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 52:7" />Vikibinda ukando wa mzi ukabondwa na waghojo wosheni wakaghuuka. Wakalawa mwe mzi nakio kwa kuzinkia mwe uvi ndiwo uigati ya nkando mbii hehi na kabuwa ka zumbe, hang'we na kuti Wakalidayo nee waidenganyize mzi mgima. Wakaghuuka kuita kwe koongo ja mto Yolidani. <verse eid="JER 52:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 52:8" />Miya waghojo wa Wakalidayo wakambasha zumbe Sedekia na wakamgwiya kushinako miima kwa Yeliko. Waghojo wakwe woshe wakaasakana wakamueka. <verse eid="JER 52:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 52:9" />Wakalidayo wakamgwia zumbe Sedekia na kumuighala kwa zumbe wa Babeli uko Libula mwe shi ya Hamasi, yohe akamlaha. <verse eid="JER 52:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 52:10" />Uko Libula, zumbe wa Babeli akawachinja wana wa Sedekia mwe mesho ya ishe awe, vikibinda akawakoma wagholokezi woshe wa Yuda. <verse eid="JER 52:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 52:11" />Vikibinda, akamnkunta zumbe Sedekia mesho, akamshunga mpingu za shaba na kumzughiya mwe geeza uko Babeli mpaka mshi ahefa.<verse eid="JER 52:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubanighwa kwa nyumba ya Zumbe Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 25:8-17">2 Wazumbe 25:8-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 52:12" />Mshi wa muongo mng'we wa ng'wezi wa shano, mwe vui ja muongo mng'we na kenda ja ugholokezi wa Nebukadineza zumbe wa Babeli, Nebuzaladani mkulu wa waghojo ndiye akimnka zumbe vinyanyi, amtumikileye zumbe wa Babeli, akaiza Yelusalemu, <verse eid="JER 52:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 52:13" />akaoka nyumba ya Zumbe Mulungu na zumba ja kizumbe na nyumba nkulu zosheni za wantu wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JER 52:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 52:14" />Waghojo woshe wa Wakalidayo ndiwo wai hang'we na Nebuzaladani mkulu wa waghojo wa zumbe, wakagandua nkando zoshe zeuzunguuka mzi wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JER 52:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 52:15" />Nebuzaladani akawaighala kwe shi ya ugheni wantu wagheke waisiizewo kuituka wakiwa na waja washighalewo mwe mzi hang'we na wantu wakiighalewo wenye kwa zumbe wa Babeli na watalizi. <verse eid="JER 52:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 52:16" />Miya Nebuzaladani akaeka waja wantu wakiwa waisiizewo, waikale mwe shi waime na kuwelela mizabibu.<verse eid="JER 52:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 52:17" />Waghojo wa Wakalidayo wakabonda shiki ja shaba yechuta ndijo jii mwe nyumba ya Zumbe Mulungu, viikaiyo hang'we na igha kulu ja shaba ndijo jiimwe nyumba ya Zumbe Mulungu, wakaighua shaba yoshe yechuta wakaiighala Babeli. <verse eid="JER 52:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 52:18" />Vingi wakaghua vizungu na makoleo na mikasi na mabakui na mabesei hang'we na ntanu zosheni za shaba yechuta ndizo zikighoshoela ndima mwe nyumba ya Zumbe Mulungu. <verse eid="JER 52:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 52:19" />Vingi Nebuzaladamu akaghua vibakui na vyetezo vya kuokela ubani na mabakui na viengo na sahani na mabakui ya kuikila ntogoo za vyanywa. Ivyo vintu vyoshe vighosholwe kwa madini ya zahabu ntana na madini yeghosholea hea. <verse eid="JER 52:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 52:20" />Vintu vya shaba vyaghosholwavyo ni zumbe Selemani kwa mbuli ya Zumbe Mulungu nee ni mashiki maili na igha ing'we kulu ja mazi na vinyago vya nkambaku muongo mng'we na mbii vya shaba ndivyo ziishi ya ijo igha kulu ndijo jikizwama. <verse eid="JER 52:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 52:21" />Kia shiki nee jiina utai wa meta mnane, mzunguuko wakwe nee ni meta shano na nusu, upana wakwe nee ni meta shano na lobo na yosheni nee yaing'wazi kwa ndai. <verse eid="JER 52:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 52:22" />Ulanga ya kia shiki nee kuina kichwa cha shaba yechuta, chena utai wa meta mbii na sentimeta miongo mii. Kia kichwa cha jia shiki nee chiizungushizwe mahembo ya wavu na makomamanga yoshe nee ni ya shaba yechuta. <verse eid="JER 52:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 52:23" />Makomamanga ndiyo yakionekea nee ni miongo kenda na mtandatu nkandai ya ayo mashiki. Makomamanga yoshe nee ni gana ing'we na mahembo nkandai yakwe.<verse eid="JER 52:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu wa Yuda wataighawa Babeli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2KI 25:18-21">2 Wazumbe 25:18-21</ref>,<ref loc="2KI 25:27-30">27-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 52:24" />Vikibinda Nebuzaladani mkulu wa waghojo mwemnka zumbe viugho, aamgwiya Selaya mvikizi mkulu na mvikizi Sefania mwetongela mwe ufung'wa hang'we na waghojo watatu wa nyuvi. <verse eid="JER 52:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 52:25" />Mwe waja wantu ndiwo waishighale mwe mzi, akamghuwa mkulu wa waghojo wa Yuda hang'we na wantu wetaikana miongo mtandatu ndiwo wakimnka zumbe vinyanyi awabuizewo Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JER 52:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 52:26" />Nebuzaladani mkulu wa waghojo wa zumbe mwemnka zumbe vinyanyi, akawaghua awo wantu akawaighala kwa zumbe wa Babeli uko Libula. <verse eid="JER 52:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 52:27" />Zumbe Nebukadineza wa Babeli akawalaha awo wantu wakong'we kwe mzi wa Libula mwe shi ya Hamasi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 52:27">Kwa ivyoho wantu wa Yuda wakaighawa kwe shi ya ugheni hale na shi yawe. <verse eid="JER 52:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 52:28" />Awa nee wantu waighawawo kwe shi ya ugheni ni Nebukadineza zumbe wa Babeli mwe vui ja mfungate ja ugholokezi wakwe, aghua Wayahudi elufu ntatu na miongo mii na ntatu. <verse eid="JER 52:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 52:29" />Mwe vui ja muongo mng'we na mnane ja ugholokezi wakwe, aghua wantu magana mnane na miongo mitatu na mbii kulawa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JER 52:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 52:30" />Mwe vui ja miongo mii na ntatu ja ugholokezi wa Nebukadineza, Nebuzaladani mkulu wa waghojo na mwemnka zumbe vinyanyi, aighala Wayahudi magana mfungate na miongo mine na shano kwe shi ya ugheni. Wantu woshe waghuighwawo nee ni elufu ne na magana mtandatu.<verse eid="JER 52:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 52:31" />Mwe vui ja miongo mitatu na mfungate kuanduka Yehoyakini zumbe wa Yuda aighawe kwe shi ya ugheni, mshi wa miongo mii na shano wa ng'wezi wa muongo mng'we na mbii, Evili Melodaki zumbe wa Babeli, mwe vui jiajia ai zumbe akamuekea Yehoyakimu zumbe wa Yuda ndiye aizughaiwe. <verse eid="JER 52:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 52:32" />Zumbe Evili Melodaki akalonga na Yehoyakini kwa uhozu na kumnka ishima nkulu kuzinka waja wazumbe watuhu woshe ndiwo aina nawo uko Babeli kwe shi ya ugheni. <verse eid="JER 52:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 52:33" />Kwa ivyoho, Evili Melodaki zumbe wa Babeli akamnka Yehoyakini shuke za kuzwika akamueka aje naye nkande mishi yakwe yoshe. <verse eid="JER 52:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 52:34" />Kia mshi Evili Melodaki zumbe wa Babeli nee akimnka Yehoyakini hea aghule achekunda. Aghoshole ivyoho mpaka mushi ahefa.<verse eid="JER 52:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 52" />
</usx>